<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="ISA" style="id">Isaia</book>
  <para style="h">Isaia</para>
  <para style="toc1">Isaia</para>
  <para style="toc2">Isaia</para>
  <para style="mt">Isaia</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Uzia te, Jothama te, Ahaza te leh Hezekia te Judai rama an lal laia Amoza fapa, Isaian Judai ram leh Jerusalem khaw chungchâng inlârna a hmuh chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpan thu a sawi e, “Vânte u, ngaithla ula, Leilung, beng lo chhi rawh: Fanaute ka châwm a, ka tiseilian a, Mahse, min helsan ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bâwngin a pu a hria, Sabengtungin a pu chaw pêkna thlêng a hre bawk a, Israel-te erawh hi chuan an hre lo va, Ka mite hian an hre thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A! Hnam sual, khawlohnaa khat, Thlah sual, fa nikhualote tak hi aw! Lalpa in kalsan a, Israel-te Mi Thianghlima chu in hnâwl ta a, In hawisan tâk daih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Engati nge in hel luih zêl? Vuak in la duh cheu em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kephah aṭanga chhîp thlengin dam lai rêng a awm lo, Pem te, hliam te, vuak duk chur tein a khah tawh hi; Chûng chu an ṭhui lo va, an tuam lo va, Damdawi an hnawih hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />In ramte chu tihram a ni ta a, In khuate chu a kâng ral ta, In hmuhah ngei hnam dangte chuan in ram chu an luah ta a, In hmêlmaten an tichhe rem rum mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jerusalem khua chauh a la him a, an hual tlat si, Kulh nei ve lo grep huana chhâwlbûk ang leh Fanghma huana thlâm ang hi a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Engkim Lalpan a dam chhun tlêm min zuahsak suh sela, Sodom khua ang khân kan ral tawh ang a, Gomora khua ang kan ni ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Rorêltu, Sodom khaw mi ang maite u, Lalpa thu sawi hi ngaithla ula, Nangni Gomora khaw mi ang maite u, Kan Pathian Dân hi bengkhawn rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “In inthawina zozai hi ka tân eng nge a nih? In berâm pum hâlte hi ka hnê tawh a, Ran chum thau in hlante hian mi ngei mang e, Bâwng te, berâm te, kêlpa thisen te hi Ka lâwm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka hmaa in rawn inlan hian Tu nge hêng thil in rawn tih hi phûta, Ka tual in rawn chîl hrep ṭhin le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thilhlan rawn la sek tawh suh u, a sâwt lo ve, In rimtui hâlte hi ka ten a ni, Thla thar te, sabat te, khâwmpui in koh chhên te, Inkhâwmpui urhsûnte ka kham ta e, Sualin a khat si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />In thla thar kûtte leh in ruat belh kûtte chu Ninawm ka va ti êm! Ka tân a hnawksak a, ka tuar peih tawh lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Min ngênin ban phar mah ula, Ka maimitchhînsan ang che u, Ṭawngṭai chiam mah ula, Ka beng ka chhi lo vang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Insil ula, intifai zâwk rawh u, Thil sual in tih ka hmuh ṭhin hi bânsan ula, Thil sual tih chîng leh tawh suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thil ṭha tih zir ula, a dik chu ûm rawh u, Hnehchhiahte chhan ula, Fahrahte ro dik takin rêlsak ula, Hmeithaite ṭan rawh u.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Hawh u, i han sawi fel teh ang,” Lalpan a ti. “Sualin sen hlur tawh mah ula, Vûr ang maia vârin ka sil fai ang che u, Senduk tluk mah ula, Sahmul vâr ang maiin in vâr leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka thu in awih zêl chuan In rama thil tui berte in ei ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mahse, in duh lohva luhlul in chhuah zêl chuan Khandaih hriama sah hlum in ni ngei ang,” tiin Lalpan thu a sawi e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Engtizia nge khawpui rinawm tak chu Nawhchizuar ang a lo nih tâk? Dik taka rorêlna, mi dikte chênna chu Tualthattute awmna a lo nih tâk hi le!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nang, tangkarua chu a êkchhiaah i chang ta a, Uain kha tui i lo ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />In hotute chu hel hmang an ni a, Rûkrûte ṭhian bul an ni; Hlêp tûr an zawng vek a, Thamna an ûm ruai ṭhîn, Fahrahte thu dik takin an rêlsak duh lo va, Hmeithaite thuin an hnên a thleng zo bawk hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa , Engkim Lalpa , Israel-te Mi Chaka thuchhuak chuan heti hian a ti: “Khawi nge, ka hmêlmate chungah ka inhrithla ang a, Mi dotute chungah phuba ka la teh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />I chungah ka kut ka lek ang a, Tangkarua angin ka rawh fai ang che a, A êkchhia chu ka thian fai vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hmâna in rorêltute ang kha ka dah leh ang, In remruattute ang kha ka pe leh ang che u; Tichuan, ‘Khawpui rinawm leh dik,’ an ti leh dâwn che u nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Zion khua chu diknaa chhan chhuah a ni ang a, A chhûnga awm sual simte pawh felnaa chhandam an ni bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A laka hel leh mi sualte erawh chu a vaw sawm ang a, Lalpa hawisantute chu an ral vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Sasaw thing biak in uar viau kha in la zak ang, Huan serh in siamte chu in la zahpui bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Sasaw thing thi tûr angin in vuai ang a, Tui hmu lo huan angin in ro reng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mi thiltithei tak chu meibu ang hi a ni, A thiltih pawh meisi ang hi a ni, Chu chuan a timût ang a, tu man an timit lo vang.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judai ram leh Jerusalem chungchânga Amoza fapa Isaian Lalpa thu a dawn chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ni hnuhnûngahte chuan Lalpa In awmna tlâng chu Tlâng ropui ber a ni ang a, Tlâng zawng zawng a khûm vek ang. Tah chuan hnam tinrêng an lo kal duah duah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi tam tak an lo kal ang a, heti hian an ti ang: “Hawh u, Lalpa tlângah i chho vang u, Jakoba Pathian in awmnaah chuan, A kawng min lo kawhhmuh ang a, A kawngah chuan kan kal ang,” Zion aṭangin Dân chu a lo chhuak ang a, Jerusalem aṭang hian Lalpan thu a sawi ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hnam tin inkâr thu a rêl ang a, An thu a remsak ang. An khandaihte leileh nân an chher ang a, An feite chu thei ṭang tanna kawmah an siam bawk ang. Hnam dang chungah hnam dangin hriam an lek tawh lo vang a, Indo dân pawh an zir tawh hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jakoba thlahte u, hawh u, Lalpa êngah i lêng ang u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />I mi, Jakoba fate hi i thlahthlam ta a ni, Khawchhak mite leh Filistia mite dawi an chîng ve a, Hnam dang mite an kawp tâk avâng hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chûng mite ram chu tangka leh rangkachakin a khat a, Sum an ngahzia hriat phâk a ni lo, An ram chu sakawrin a khat bawk a, An tawlailîr lah chhiar sên rual a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An ramah chuan milem a khat a, Anmahni siam, an kutchhuak chu chibai an bûk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi tin an kûn ang a, an tlâwm ang, Tungding hauh suh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa zahawmna ropui leh hlauhawmna pumpelh tûrin Lung pûkahte lût ula, leivûngahte biru rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mihring chapona a tlâwm ang a, An inngaihhlutna pawh tihhniam a ni bawk ang. Chutih hunah chuan Lalpa chauh hi chawisân a ni dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan Engkim Lalpan , Mi chapo te, inngaisâng te leh intivei zawng zawng te A tihniam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lebanon tlâng sidar thing sâng zawng zawng te, Basan ram sasua te a râwt ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tlâng tin leh mual tin, A sâng zawng zawng a râwt hniam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Râlvênbûk sâng leh kulh bangte A tichim vek bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tarsis lawng rual, a lian leh mawi zawng zawng te, A vaiin a tipil ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mihring chapona a tlâwm ang a, An inngaihhlutna pawh tihhniam a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutih hunah chuan Lalpa chauh hi chawimawi a ni dâwn si a. Milemte chu a ral vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lei rawn sâwi nghîng tûra a lo kal hunah chuan, Lalpa zahawmna ropui leh hlauhawmna pumpelh tûrin Khâm pûkahte an lût ang a, Khuarkhurumahte an biru ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chumi ni chu a lo thlen chuan, An biak tangkaraw milem leh rangkachak milem An siamte chu buikelek leh bâk tân An paih chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lei rawn sâwi nghîng tûra a lo thawh hunah chuan, Lalpa zahawmna ropui leh hlauhawmna pumpelh tûrin Khâm kârah leh lung keh kârahte an biru ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thi thei mihring chungah innghat suh u, Eng mah an nih loh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa , Engkim Lalpan Jerusalem leh Judai ram aṭangin An innghahna tinrêng a la bo mêk a ni, An rinpui chaw leh tui te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An pasalṭhate leh râltu mi te, Rorêltu te leh zâwlnei te, aienthiam te leh sipai te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sawmnga hotu te leh mi chhuanawm te, Mi râwn tlâk te leh dawi thiam te, Aikaih thiam te a la bo mêk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An hotu-ah naupang ka dah ang a, An chungah naupangchhiain ro an rêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mite chu an inep ang a, Pa leh pa an insual ang a, Ṭhian leh ṭhian an inbei bawk ang. Tleirâwl chu upa lakah a inlek ang a, Michhe tê tê pawhin mi zahawmte an pawisa lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Miin an unau an pa ina awm chu an chelh ang a, “Nang zawng silhfên pawh i neih hi, kan hotu-ah ṭang la, hêng niai nuai hi I kutah awm rawh se,” an la ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chumi hun chuan ani chuan a lo hnial ang a, “Hêngho hi ka tuamhlâwm thei lo vang, Chaw leh silhfên ka nei bîk lo, Mipui hotu-ah zawng mi siam suh u,” a lo ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jerusalem a chim a ni ta a, Judai ram pawh a chhia a ni ta e. Lalpa kalhin an ṭawng ṭhîn a, thil an ti ṭhîn, A ropuina an hmuhsit avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An hawiherah an thiam lohzia a lang a, Sodom mite angin an sual mualpho ta a, An inthup sêng ta lo. An chung a pik e, Mahni chhiatna an thlen a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi ṭhate hnênah chuan, “In ti ṭha e, In thil tih rah in sêng dâwn si,” ti ula;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi sualte chung chu a pik e, an chhe dâwn si, An tih chu an chungah pawh tih a ni dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka mite awpbettu chu naupang an ni a, Hmeichhiaten an chungah ro an rêl. Ka mite u, in hruaituten an hruai bo ta che a ni, Kalna tûr lam pawh hre lovin in buai tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A mite sual târlang tûrin Lalpa a inpeih a, An chungthu rêl tûrin a ding chhuak ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa chuan an upate leh an hruaitute chungthu a han rêl a. “Nangni hi grep huan ram zotu chu in ni, Mi retheite thil in lâk chu in inah in chhêk khâwm a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Engtizia nge ka mite hi hetia in rah beha, Mi retheite neih chhun in lâk zawh zêl?” Lalpa , Engkim Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpan heti hian a ti: “Jerusalem hmeichhiate chu an va chapo êm! An kal âwr âwr a, mi an melh hrâw hrâw a, Tengeng ri chhawng chhawngin an kal awh awh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Zion hmeichheho lu a tipân ang a, Lalpa chuan saruakin a awmtîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chumi ni-ah chuan Lalpan An incheina ṭhate a lâksak ang: tengeng te, luhrên te, ṭhimkual te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />bengbeh te, ngûn te, hmai khuhna te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />samhrên te, bânhrên te, kâwnghrên te, rimtui bâwm te, belmawi te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />zungbun te, hnârvuah te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />kawrfual ropui te, puan te, kawrchung te, khai nel nel te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />dârthlalang te, puan pan te, diar te, puan chei te a lâk bosak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Rimtui aiah rimchhia, Kâwnghrên aiah hruihrual, Sâm siam puk aiah chal kawlh, Awm bel mawi aiah saiip puan, Hmêlṭhat aiah hmêlchhiat, An chan tûr a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />I mite chu khandaiha sah hlum an ni ang a, I mi huaisente pawh indonaah an thi bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Khaw hotute ṭapin an rûm ang a, Khuaa mite saruakin an ṭhu ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi hunah chuan hmeichhe pasarihin mipa pakhat an man ang a, “Ei tûr leh silhfên kan intum ang a, Kan hmingchhe tûr chhilh nân I nupuiah min nei hrâm rawh,” an la ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chumi ni-ah chuan Lalpa aṭanga zâr chawr chhuak chu a duah hluah ang a, Israel rama la awmte tân chuan ṭha tak leh tuihnai takin a rah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zion-a thi bângte leh Jerusalem-a zuaha la awmte, Jerusalem-a nungdama awm tûra hming ziak zawng zawngte chu ‘mi thianghlim’ an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa thlarau chuan Zion mite chungchâng rêl felin an bawlhhlawhna chu a sil faisak ang a, mei kan angin a thlarau chuan Jerusalem-a thisen kai chu a tifai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Zion tlâng pum pui chungah leh chuta awm khâwmte chungah chuan chhûnah meikhu leh chhûm a dah ang a, zânah mei êng a dah bawk ang: Pathian ropuina chuan a khuh vek dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chu chu ni sensa laka zâr hlimtu, thlipui leh ruahpui laka humhimtu leh phen tûr a ni ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka duh tak tân hla ka han sa teh ang, A duat êm êm grep huan hla chu: “Ka duh tak chuan grep huan a nei ta a, Mualchêng, lei ṭha tak hmunah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thlûr a siam a, lung a chhar fai a, Grep ṭha ber chi a phun a, A laiah chuan vênbûk a sa a, Grep sâwr khur tûr a ker bawk a. A rah hlân a nghâkhlel êm êm a, A han rah chuan a suak a lo ni vek si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jerusalem leh Judai ram mite u, Ka grep huan nêna kan inkâr thu hi Han ngaihtuah ve teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka tih bâk hi ka grep huanah Eng nge ka tih leh chuan tawh ang? Grep ṭha ngei lawh tumin ka thlîr rêng a, A suak hlîrin a rah si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Engtin nge ka tih dâwn, ka sawisak dân tûr chu, Ka han hrilh ang che u, A pal ka sâm ang a, ka tiram ang, A lung palte ka tichhe vek ang a, Ramsate chuan an chîl thlu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka ma ang a, a ṭang ka sât no lo vang a, A hmun ka thlo fai hek lo vang. Hnimhlîngnei leh hlo harin a khat ang a, Chhûmte thu ka pe ang a, Ruah rêng ka sûrtîr tawh lo vang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa huan chu Israel chhûngte hi an ni a, Judai ram mite hi duat taka a phunte chu an ni. Dik takin ro an rêl a beisei a, Tual thah an chîng ta si, Thil dik an tih a beisei a, Mahse, manganga au a hmu ṭeuh si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi dang nêka, in zauh zêla, Huan zauh zêl chîngte u, in chung a pik e. Tu mah an leng ve lo vang a, Khawhar takin mahni chauhvin in la awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa chuan ka beng hriatah, “Hêng in lian pui pui leh mawi tak tak hi A ram ang a, luah tûr an awm lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Grep huan ṭîn sâwm hmunah Ṭîn hnih vêl chauh sâwr tûr a rah ang a, Phur sâwm chînnaah Phur khat lek chauh a haw bawk ang,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zîng tak taka zu hrût ṭana, Zân rei tak tak thlenga rui hnêp ṭhînte chu An chung a pik e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zu hmunah ṭingṭang leh perhkhuang nên, Dârbenchhek leh phênglâwng nên Zu nên an ri bûng bûng ṭhîn, Lalpa thiltih chu an en ṭha duh lo va, A kut hnathawh pawh chu an hmu duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka mite chuan an hriat duh loh avângin Salah an tâng ngei dâwn a ni. An miliante rilṭâmin an thi ang a, Mipui vântlângte pawh tuihâlin an thi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mitthi khua chuan lo dawlh a châk hle a, A kâ a âng huau mai. Jerusalem chhuangtu milian leh mitê Hlim taka awm ṭhînte chu a dawlh zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mitê leh milian tihhniam an ni ang a, Mi chapote an tlâwm bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Dik taka ro a rêl avângin Engkim Lalpa chu chawimawi a ni ang a, Thil dik taka tiin Pathian thianghlim chuan A thianghlimzia a lantîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, an tlatna phûlah berâm an tla angin, Hmun ramah chuan an tla ang a, Khaw rama hnimte chu kêlten an pet bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sual laka inthiarfihlîm thei lo, Sual sim thei lote chu an chung a pik e,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />‘Lo hmanhmawh se, kan hmuh atân, Han ti thuai thuai ang hmiang, Israel-ho Mi Thianghlima chuan a thiltum chu, Kan hriat theih nân han tithleng thuai rawh se,’ titute chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thil sual thil ṭha tia, thil ṭha thil sual tia, êng chu thima ngaia, Thim chu ênga ngai bawka, Thil thlum chu thil kha tia, Thil kha chu thil thlum titute chu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mahni ngaiha fing intia, Fel inti hlete chu an chung a pik e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zu ina pasalṭha, Zu chawhpawlha huaisente chu: An chung a pik e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Thamna lain mi sual thiam chantîr an chîng a, Mi ṭhate chu thiam loh an chantîr ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hemi avâng hian, meialhin buhpâwl a kâng ral ang leh Hnim ro a kâng ral ang mai hian An zungzâm a ṭawih ral ang a, An vânglaiin an boral ang; Engkim Lalpa Dân chu an hnâwl a, Israel-ho Mi Thianghlima chu an hmuhsit avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan a ni, Lalpa thinurna chu Mite chunga a lo thlen ni, A kut lekin a vuak tâk hi. Tichuan, tlângte chu a nghîng a, Mitthi ruang chu hnâwmhnawk angin Khawlaiahte a let rem rum, Chuti pawh chuan a thinur a la reh lo va, A kut a la thlâk ta cheu va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lalpan ram hla taka awmte tân chhinchhiahna a târ chhuak ta, Kâwlkila mi hamrîkin a ko va, Hmanhmawh takin an lo kal saw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hah rêng an hre lo va, an inchhuih bawk hek lo, Muthlu an awm lo va, an mut a chhuak hek lo, Kâwnghrên phelh dul tu mah an awm lo va, Pheikhawk hrui chat an awm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />An thalte chu a zum êm êm a, An thalngul chu kawih sa-in an keng; An sakawr tinte chu meilung hriam ang a ni a, An tawlailîr kete chu ṭhâwngaleivir angin a vir vut vut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />An au thâwm chu sakeibaknei hâhum ang hi a ni, Sakeibaknei vânglai angin an au hum hum a, An sa seh chu rûm ngul ngul chungin an pu bo va, Tu man an chhuh thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chumi ni chu a lo thlen chuan, Tuifinriat thâwm anga nasain Israel ram chhûngah an rawn ri hum hum ang. Ram han thlîr chuan thimna leh mangannain a khat a, Êng chu thimin a hliah zo ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lal Uzia thih kum khân Lalpa chu ka hmu a, a lalṭhutthlêng, sâng taka chawi kânah chuan a ṭhu a, a kawrfual hmâwr chuan Tempul chu a tikhat vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A kiang vêlah chuan Seraf-ho an awm a, chûng chuan thla paruk an nei ṭheuh va, an thla pahnihin an hmai an khuh a, an thla pahnihin an ke an tuam a, an thla pahnihin an thlâwk a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />‘Engkim Lalpa chu a thianghlim e, A thianghlim e, a thianghlim e, Lei pum puiah a ropuina a lo khat,’ tiin an inau tawn an inau tawn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An thâwmah chuan Tempul nghahchhan lungphûmte chu a nghîng dur dur a, Tempul chu meikhuin a khat ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kei chuan, “Che heu! Ka boral a nih tâk hi! Hmui bawlhhlawh pu, hmui bawlhhlawh pute zînga chêng hian, Lalber, Engkim Lalpa chu ka mitin ka hmu ta si a,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Seraf pakhat chu a lo thlâwk a, chaichehin maichâma meiling chu a rawn chep a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ka hmui a han dep a, “Hei hian i hmui a khawih ta a, I sualna lâk bo a ni ta a, I bawlhhlawh tihfai a ni ta e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Tu nge ka tirh ang a, tu nge kan tân kal ang?” tiin Lalpa aw ka hria a. Kei chuan, “Kei ka kal ang chu! Min tîr ta che,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka hnênah chuan, “Kal ta la, he hnam hi va hrilh rawh: Ngaithla reng mah ula, a ngaihna in hre lo vang, En reng mah ula, in hmu si lo vang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“He mite thinlung hi tichawlawl la, An beng tingawng la, An mit timalh bawk ang che. Chutilo zawng, an mitin an hmu ang a, An bengin an hria ang a, An thinlungin an hre bawk ang a, Hawi kîrin tihdam an ni dah ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kei chuan, “ Lalpa , eng chen nge chutianga an awm ang?” ka ti a. Ani chuan, “Khawpuite chu luahtu awm lova a ram veka, inte pawh urtu awm lova ram pum a ṭiau vek hma loh chuan!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpan mite chu hla takah a thawn bo vang a, ram pum chu a tiṭiau vek phawt ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Sâwma pakhat pawh châmbang sela tihboral an ni ang. Sasua leh ṭhîl kih hnua a bul la awm ang hi a ni ang; chu chu chi thianghlim bul chu a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Uzia fa Jothama fapa Ahaza, Judai rama a lal laiin Suria lal Rezina leh Israel lal Remalia fapa Peka chu Jerusalem rûn tûrin an chho va, mahse, an la mai thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Suria sipaiten Israel ram an lo thleng tawh tih Davida chhûngte an han hrilh chuan an hlau ta êm êm a, thliin ngaw thing a chhêm ang mai hian an khûr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpan Isaia hnênah, “I fapa Shear-jasuba hruai la, Ahaza va hmu rawh, dîl chhakta aṭanga tui lâkna kawng tâwp, puan su mite hmun panna kawngpuiah a awm e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A hnênah heti hian va ti rawh: Inring la, zâm mai suh, thlaphâng hauh suh. Suria lal Rezina leh Remalia fapa thinur hi thingthu bung khu ang lek an ni asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Suria leh Israel lal Remalia fapa chuan in chungah thil ṭha lo an rawt a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />‘Judai ramah han chho ila, tichiai ila, kan tiṭhen ang a, an lalah Tabeela fapa hi kan siam dâwn nia,’ an ti vei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Chutiang chu a ni hauh lo vang a, An hlawhtling bawk hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Suria lu chu Damaska a ni a, Damaska lu chu Rezina lek hi a ni si a. Kum sawmruk leh panga chhûngin, Efraim hnam chu an ral vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Efraim lu chu Samaria a ni a, Samaria lu chu Remalia fapa lek hi a ni si a. Min rin loh chuan in ding chhuak lo vang,’ tiin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Ahaza hnênah thu a sawi leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Leilâwt aṭangin emaw, vân aṭangin emaw chhinchhiahna entîr tûrin Lalpa , i Pathian dîl rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahaza chuan, “Ka dîl lo vang, Lalpa chu ka fiah duh hek lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Isaia chuan, “Davida thlahte u, ngaithla teh u, mi dang tihhah tâwk ti lovin kan Pathian leh zêl tihhah in duh elo?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa ngei chuan chhinchhiahna a hmuhtîr ang che: Ngai teh, nula chuan nau a pai ang a, fapa a hring ang a, a hmingah, ‘Imanuela’ a sa ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A chhia a ṭha a thliar theih hma pawhin mite chuan hnutetui leh khawizu an ring ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chu nau chuan a chhia a hnâwl a, a ṭha a thlan theih hma pawhin i hlauh êm êmte ram chu a ṭiau vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“ Lalpa chuan nang leh i mite leh i pa chhûngte chungah, Efraim-ho kha Judai ram aṭanga an intihhran china la thleng ngai lo hrehawm nasa tak a tithleng dâwn a ni: Asuria lal chu a rawn hruai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chûng ni-ahte chuan Lalpan Aigupta rama lui, Nail hnâr aṭangte chuan faifûkin tho rual a ko vang, Asuria ram aṭang pawhin khuai rual a ko bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />An lo thlâwk chiam ang a, luikawr kam khâmah te, Tlângram khâm kârah te, Hlîng buk leh ran tlatna hmunah te an lo fu sup sup ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan Eufretis lui kama awm, Mi lu mehsak chîng Asuria lal chu, Lalpan a ruai ang a, In sam leh in hmul zawng zawng, In khabehmulte nên lam a ziat fai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chumi ni chu a lo thlen chuan, Bâwngpui leh kêlpui pahnih an la vulh hrâm ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hnutetui an ngah hle ang, Khawizu nên an ring ang. Rama la awm chhunte pawhin khawizu leh hnutetui an ring bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chumi ni chu a lo thlen chuan, Tangka bûk sâng man, Grep kûng sâng awmna zawng zawng pawh chu hlo har leh hnimhlîngneiin a bawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tah chuan thalngul kengin thal nên an ramvâk ang. Ram pum puiah hnimhlîngnei leh hlohar a khat dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuthlawha an thlawh fai ṭhin mual zawng zawng chu, Hlohar leh hnimhlîngneia a khah avângin Tu mah an kal ngam lo vang, Bâwng rual an tla ang a, Berâm rual tlatna hmun a ni bawk ang.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka hnênah, “Ziakna tûr phêk hlai tak la la, mi tin chhiar theih tûrin, ‘Maher-salal-khas-Baza’ tân, tih thîr zumin ziak kuau rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thuhretu atân mi rinawm tak pahnih, puithiam Uria leh Jeberakia fapa Zakaria ka sâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, ka nupui bulah ka awm a, nau a pai a, fapa a hring a. Lalpa chuan, “A hmingah, ‘Maher-salal-khas-baza’ sa rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nausên chuan, ‘Ka nu, ka pa,’ a tih theih hmain Damaska hausakna leh Samaria khua ata râllâk sum an lâk tûr chu Asuria lal hnênah an thlen ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa chuan mi hrilh leh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />He mite hian Silo lui dam tui chu an duh lo va, Rezina leh Remalia fapa an lo lâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kei Lalpa hian Asuria lal leh a sipaite chu Tui lian angin ka lêntîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A kuang a khat ang a, a kamah chuan a luang liam dûl dûl ang, Judai ram chu a rawn pan ang a, a rawn hrût zêl ang a, Nghâwng thleng zawkin ram pum a rawn chîm ang, I ram chungah a thla a zâr duai dâwn, Aw! Imanuel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mite u, hre rawh u, in chau dâwn e, Ram hla taka awmte u, bengchhi rawh u, A ni, inpeih ula, hlau viau rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Râl rêl ula, a hlawhtling chuang lo vang, In duh tâwkin sawi ula, a sâwt bawk hek lo vang, Kan Pathian kan hnênah a awm si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />He mite kawng zawh lai hi zawh ve lo tûrin Lalpan khauh takin min hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />‘Hêng mite hi thurualpui suh, an hlauh ang chu hlau ve hek suh la, ṭih bawk hek suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa hi a ni in zah tûr chu. Ani chauh hi a ni in hlauhva in ṭih tûr chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A thianghlim êm avângin Israel chhûng hnihte tân inchhuihna tûr lung, chhuiha tlûkna tûr chu a ni. Jerusalem-a chêngte tân tlâkna tûr hum leh awhna tûr thang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi tam tak an inchhuih ang a, an âwk ang a, an tâng tlat ang,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka zirtîrte u, in thu zir, ka hrilh che u kha, vawng ṭha ula, kawl tlat rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kei chuan Lalpa hi ka nghâk reng ang a, Jakoba thlahte lakah a biru rih a nih hi; kei chuan ka beiseina chu amahah ka nghat tlat ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />En teh, kei leh Lalpa min pêk naupangte hi, Zion tlânga chêng Engkim Lalpan Jerusalem mite tân chhinchhiahna, thil mak tak ni tûrin min ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mitthi thlûk thiam te, eng emaw zâwla chiap chiapa phun bul bul te chu râwn tûrin an ti ang che u. Anni chuan, ‘Thlaraute hi râwn tûr a ni a, thi tawhte pawh la damte tân râwn tûr an ni,’ an lo ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zirtîrna thu, ka hrilh che u mawlh kha, ngai ngun rawh u; anni thu sawi chuan awmzia a nei lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mangang tak leh rilṭâm takin ram chu an fang ang a. An rilṭâm thinur chuan vân lam enin an lal leh an Pathian chu ânchhia an lawh bawrh bawrh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lei lam an hawi chuan manganna leh thim, thim râpthlâk tak, an tawn ngei tûr thim chu an hmu ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangang taka awm ṭhînte tân thim a awm tawh lo vang, Tûn hma lam khân Zebulun leh Naftali ram chu Hmusitawm tak a ni a, Hun hnuhnûngahte erawh chuan a la tiropui hle ang, Tuipui kam aṭanga Jordan lui râl Galili ram, Jentail-te chênna ram chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thim hnuaia khawsa ṭhîn hnamte chuan êng ropui tak an hmu ta a, Ram thim taka chêngte tân chuan khua a lo vâr ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chûng hnamte chu i tipung a, An hlimna pawh i tihpunsak ta a, Buh seng leh râllâk sum insem laia an hlim ang hian, I hmaah chuan an hlim a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An rit phurhna nghâwngkawlte leh an thil kawh fungte chu, Chhawrtuin a vuakna tiangte nên chuan Midian-ho hneh ni ang khân, I tihtliahsak ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sipai lo kal ṭhup ṭhupna pheikhawk te, An thuam thisen kai hniang hnuang te, Hâl a ni a, a kâng zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kan tân nau a lo piang a, Fapa min pe ta a. Sawrkârna chu a kovah a innghat a, A hmingah chuan: Remruattua, Maka, Pathian Chaka, Chatuan Pa, Remna Lal an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A sawrkârna a nghet tulh tulh ang a, A ram chhûngah remnain tâwpintai a nei lo vang. Thu dik hmanga dik taka rorêlin Davida lalṭhutthlêngah a ṭhu ang a, a tinghet ang, Tûn aṭanga kumkhuain Lalpa ṭhahnemngaihna chuan Chûng chu a ti ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpan Jakoba thlahte demin thu a sawi a, Israel mite pawh a huap a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />‘Efraim mi leh Samaria mi zawng zawng chuan Hêng hi a tih a nih an hria ang; An chapovin an inchhuang vei hle a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Leirawhchan bang chim mah se, Lungchher kan rem mai ang, Lungli khanchhuk min tansak a, Sidar thing ṭha kan hmang hlauh vang,’ an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpan hmêlma a chawk tho ta, Anmahni hualtu tûrte chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khawchhak lamah Suria, khawthlang lamah Filistia, Israel chu dawlh tumin an kâ an âng huau mai. Chuti pawhin Lalpa thinur a reh lo va, A kut a la lek cheu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel mite chu anmahni hremtu lamah an kîr lo va, Engkim Lalpa lam chu an hawi duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chuvâng alâwm Israel-te lu leh mei chu Ni khat thilah Lalpan a tansak ni, An tûmkau leh aidûte pawh a sâmsak bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An lu chu an upa chhuante an ni a, An mei chu zâwlnei dâwt hehte hi an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An hnam hruaitute hian an hruai bo va, An hruaite chu an bo zo ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathian pawisa lovin thil sual an ti vek a, An thu chhâkchhuahte lah a nikhua bawk hek lo; Chuvângin, Lalpan an tlangvâlte a zuah lo va, Fahrahte leh hmeithaite pawh a khawngaih lo, Chutiang a nih pawhin Lalpa thinur a reh lo va, A kut a la lek cheu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sual hi hlohar leh hnimhlîngnei kângtu mei ang a ni, Ngaw hnuaia hnimte pawh a tikâng a, A khu chho hluah hluah ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa thinurna chuan ram chu a tikâng a, Mihringte chu hâl tûr chheh khâwm ang mai an ni. Tu man mahni unau ngei pawh an zuah si lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />An ding lama mi hlepin an ei a, An ril a la ṭâm tho, An vei lama mi pawh an ei a, An puar chuang lo, mahni fate ngei pawh an ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Manase leh Efraim mi an inbei a, Juda thlahte an beihrawn a, Chutiang a nih pawhin Lalpa thinur a reh lo va, A kut a la lek cheu a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Dân chimawm tak siama, Thupêk khirh tak tak tichhuak ṭhînte u, In chung a pik e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chutin rethei ṭhat vena tûr in dang tlat a, Dik taka ro rêlsak an ni ngai lo; Hmeithaite in suam a, fahrahte in rawk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ram hla tak aṭanga chhiatna a lo thlen hun, Thungrulhna ni-ah chuan eng nge in tih tâk ang? Tu hnênah nge ṭanpui in dîl ang a, Khawiah nge in rote in thuhrûk ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sala an man zîngah in tel ang a, A nih loh leh an thah zîngah in tel ve ang. Chutiang a nih pawhin Lalpa thinur a reh lo va, A kut a la lek cheu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A! Asuria lal chu ka thinur talhtum a ni, Ka thinrim hrîk thlâk nân ka tiang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian pawisa lo hnam bei tûrin ka tîr a, Min tithinurtute nuai nek tûrin thu ka pe a, Anni chu va suama, va rawk tûr leh Kawtthlêr chirhdiak anga chîl hrep tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chu mai chu a lo duh tâwk lo va, Hnam dangte chu tihmang a lo tum a, Chin lêm nei hlek lova râwt vek a lo rilrûk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Ka miliante hi lal tluk ṭhalh an ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Karkhemis khua angin Kalno khua pawh ka hneh a ni lâwm ni? Hamath khua angin Arpad khua pawh? Samari khua chu Damaska khua angin ka sawisak kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Milem biakna ramah ka kut ka lek zêl a, Samari khua leh Jerusalem khua aia milem tamnaah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Samari khua leh an milem biakte chu ka tichhe vek tawh a, Jerusalem khua leh an milem biakte pawh ka sawisa lo vang maw?” a ti vei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Zion tlâng leh Jerusalem khaw chunga thil tih ka tum chu ka tih zawh hun chuan Asuria chu a chapo leh a inchhuan êm avângin ka hrem dâwn a ni.” Asuria lal chuan:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Ka chak avâng leh ka fin thiam avângin Keimah ngeiin ka tih a ni. Hnam tin ramri ka sawn kual a, An ro khâwlte ka chhuhsak a, Bâwng kawlh angin lalte ka chîl nek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sava awm loh hlâna a tui an la ang hian, Ram tinrênga kalin an buzâwl chu Ka zensak a, an rote chu ka la zêl a, Thla min khawn khum an awm lo va, Min khak ngam rêng an awm lo ve,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hrei hi a chêktu aiin a ropui zâwk em ni? Thingzaina pawh a hrûttute aiin a ṭangkai zâwk em ni? Talhtum pawh hian a lektu chu a lek thei em ni? Talhfiak pawhin a kengtu chu a lek thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa , Engkim Lalpa ngei chuan, Mi thau tak takte chu chêr hri a veitîr ang a, Mei angin an kawchhûng chu a lum vut vut bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel-te êntu chu meiah a chang ang a, Mi Thianghlima chu meialhah a chang ang. Ni khat thilah engkim a kâng ral ang a, Hlohar leh hnimhlîngnei lam a kâng fai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A ngawpui leh ram ṭha hlutna chu A chhe vek dâwn a ni; Ngawrte an râwp ral ang mai hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ngaw thing la ding pheuh pheuhte chu Naupang chhiar tham lek a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chumi hun chuan Israel la dam chhunte leh Jakoba thlah thi bâng la awmte chuan anmahni sawisatu an rin chhan tawh lo vang a, Lalpa , Israel Mi Thianghlima chu an ring takmeuh tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jakoba thlah thi bâng la awm chhun chu an Pathian chak tak hnênah chuan an lo kîr leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Israel mite chu tuifinriat kama ṭiau zâtin tam mah sela, tlêm tê chauh an lo kîr leh ang: boral tûra ruat an ni a, an phu rêng si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa , Pathian chuan a ruat tawh angin ram pumah chhiatna a thlentîr dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chuvângin, Engkim Lalpa , Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: “Zion-a chêng, ka mite u, Aigupta mite tih angin Asuria chuan tiang lekin vua che u mah sela, hlau suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Rei lo tê-ah, in chunga ka thinur chu a reh ang a, an chungah ka ṭuan thung ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Engkim Lalpa chuan Horeb lungpui hmuna Midian mite chunga a tih ang khân an chungah pawh a vuakfung chu a lek ang a, tuipuia Aigupta mite a tih ang khân Asuria chu a vaw hrep ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Chumi hun chuan Asuria thuhnuaia in kûn chu ka chhuah ang che u a, in nghâwng ata a nghâwngkawl chu ka titliak ang,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aiath khua an lo thleng ta, Migron khua pawh an rawn pêl a, Mikmas khuaah an rawn inchhêk ta e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kalkhân an pêl tawh a, Geba khuaah an riak ta e, Rama khaw mite chu hlauvin an khûr. Lal Saula khua Gibea mite an tlânchhia e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Galim khaw mite u, hlauvin au vak ula, Laisa khaw mite u, ngaithla ula, Anathoth mite u, lo chhâwn rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Madmena mite chu an tlânchhia a, Gebim khuaa chêngte chu biru tûrin an tlân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Vawiin hian Nob khuaah chuan a ding ta a, Zion tlâng, Jerusalem khua chu kuttum a thin khum e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ngai teh, Lalpa , Engkim Lalpa chuan Thingzâr thlâk ang maiin a thlâk duai duai ang a, A sâng sâng chu a râwt ang a, A titlâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hreiin ngawpui an ṭhiat a, Lebanon tlânga thing lian pui pui an kit ang hian Asuria chu a kit ve ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thing kih bul chu a lo chawr leh ṭhîn ang hian, Jesaia thlah aṭangin lal thar a lo chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpan a thlarauvin a awmpui ang a, Finna leh hriatthiamna te, Remruat thiamna leh huaisenna te, Lalpa ṭihna leh hriat theihna thlarau te a neihtîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa ṭih hi a lawmzâwng tak a ni ang a, A lan dân ang maiin ro a rêl lo vang a, Benga a hriat satliah aṭang maiin thu a pawtchat hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Retheite chu dik takin ro a rêlsak ang a, Ram chhûnga mi tlâwmte pawh a chawikâng ang. A thu, a talhtum chuan lei hi a vua ang a, Mi sualte chu a chhêm hlum ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Dikna a taihrênah a hmang ang a, Rinawmna chuan a kâwng a hrêng bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chinghniate chu berâm zîngah an tla ang a, Keitê leh kêl pawh an bawk dûn ang. Bâwng no leh sakeibaknei no chu Ran châwm thau nên an awm ho vang a, Naupang têin a hruai duah duah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bâwngpui leh savawm chu an tla dûn ang a, An note pawh an bawk za dial dial ang. Sakeibakneite chuan bâwng ang maiin buhpâwl an ei tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hnute hne laite chu chawngkawr kaw bulah an tualchai ang. Hnute hnêk bâng hlimten rûlngân tawmkûkah kut an dah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka tlâng thianghlimah rêng rêng chuan Tu mah an intina tawh lo vang a, An intichhe hek lo vang; Tuifinriat hi tuia a khat angin, Lalpa an hriatna chuan ram hi a khat tawh dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chumi hun chuan Jesaia thlah aṭanga lal lo chhuak chu hnam tin tân chhinchhiahna a ni ang a, a chawlhhmun chu an rawn pan ang a, an chawimawi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan Lalpan a bân a phar leh ang a, ama mite thi bâng, Asuria leh Aigupta ram te, Pathros ram te, Sudan ram te, Elam ram te, Babulon ram te, Hamath ram te, tuifinriat kam leh thliarkâra la awmte chu a hruai kîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hnam tinrêng hmuhah puanzâr a zâr ang a, Israel hnam hnawh darhte leh Juda tlân darhte chu Kâwlkil li aṭangin a hruai khâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Efraim thîkthuchhiatna a reh ang a, Juda dotute chu an bo tawh ang. Efraim chuan Juda chu a thîk tawh lo vang a, Juda lahin Efraim chu a tibuai hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khawthlanga awm Filistia chu an beih rawn ang a, Khawchhak lam mite pawh an rawk ho vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpan Suez litengsâwl chu a tikang ang a, Eufretis luipui pawh thli lum hmangin a kangchahtîr ang a, Lui tê pasarihah a chantîr ang a, Kephah pawh huh lovin an kai thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aigupta ram ata Israel-te an lo chhuahna tûr Lamlian a awm ang khân, A mi la bângte tân Asuria ram aṭang pawhin Lamlian a awm ruah ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan heti hiani ti ang: “Aw Lalpa , ka fak a che. Ka chungah hian i thinur a, Mahse, i thinur chu i la kiang a, Min tihthlamuan tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka Pathian chu min chhandamtu a ni; Amah ka ring ang a, ka hlau lo vang. Lalpa , ka Pathian chu mi tichaktu, ka hla a ni. Min chhandamtu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chhandamna tuikhur aṭangin hlim takin tui chawi rawh u.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan heti hian in ti ang: “ Lalpa chu fak ula, a hming chawimawi rawh u, A thiltih chu a mite hrilh ula, A hming ropuizia hi puang darh rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A thiltih ropui tak avâng hian Lalpa chu fak ula, Khawvêl ram pum pui hi hriattîr rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zion tlânga awmhmun khuarte u, Hlim takin zai ula, au chiam rawh u; In zînga awm, Israel Mi Thianghlima chu A ropui êm asin.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babulon chungthu Amoza fapa Isaian a dawn chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tlâng kawlh chhîpah puanzâr târ ula, Sipaite chu au khâwm ula, Khaw chapo tak kulh kawngkhâr chu Bei tûrin in kutin hawi rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keimah ngeiin ka mi ruatte thu ka pe a, Ka mi chhuanawm, huaisen tak takte chu, Ka thinur hrîkthlâk nân ka ko va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tlânga ri mur mur chu ngaithla teh u, Ram tin ata hnam tinrêng lo kal khâwm, Thâwm ri a nih chu; Engkim Lalpan a sipaite râl bei tûrin a khâwm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kâwlkil ata an lo kal a, Vân tâwp ata an lo pung khâwm a ni, Lalpan a thinur hriamhreiin ram pum pui chu a tichhe dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chiau vawng vawng rawh u, Lalpa ni chu a lo hnai ta, Engkimtitheia chuan chhiatna a thlentîr dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuvângin, mi zawng zawng bân a zâwi ang a, An zâm vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thlaphâng takin hrehawm leh na an tuar ang a, Nau vei angin an vial an vial bawk ang; An zâm hmêl chu an inhmuhin an zak hle ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa ni chu a lo thleng dâwn, A thinur râpthlâk tak a lo lan hunah chuan, Ram chu tihṭiau a ni ang a, A chhûnga awm mi sualte chu an boral ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Vân arsi leh chhohreivûngte khi An êng a reh tawh ang. Ni chhuak hlim pawh a thim ang a, Thla pawh a êng tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lei hi a sual avângin ka sawisa ang a, Mi sualte pawh an sual avângin ka hrem bawk ang; Mi chapote inchhuanna chu ka titâwp ang a, Mi nunrâwng leh induhte chu ka titlâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Rangkachak hlu a vâng angin thi bâng an vâng ang a, Ofir rangkachak a tlêm angin mihring ka titlêm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A thinur ni a thlen hun chuan Engkim Lalpan vân khi a tikhûr ang. Lei pawh a sawi ang a, A awmna hmun ata a per chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sakhi tlânchhia leh berâm vên loh an darh angin, Mahni mite an pan ang a, Mahni ramah an tlân haw zut zut ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An hmuh apiang an vit ang a, An man apiang khandaihin an that ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An nausênte an mit hmuhah an vuak hlumsak ang a, An inte pawh an ramsak ang a, An nupuite an pâwngsualsak bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Babulon bei tûrin Media mite ka chawk tho va, Tangka an awt lo va, Rangkachaka tham theih an ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />An thalin tlangvâlte an kâp hlum ang a, Nausên an lainat lo vang a, Naupang pawh an khawngaih hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lal ram khuaa ropui ber, Babulon khaw mawi tak, Kaldai-ho chhuan êm êm chu Lalpan a titlâwm ang, Sodom leh Gomora khua ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tu mah an chêng tawh lo vang a, Ṭhang lo thar zêl mah se tu mah an pêm lût lo vang. Arab zin vêlte chuan puan in an zâr lo vang a, Berâmpu tu mahin an berâmte an chawlhpui hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thlalêr ramsa an chêng ang a, Chhimbukin bu a chhep bawk ang. Chingpirinute an awm ang a, In chim bângah sathâr an tualchai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kulh bîngahte chuan sihal an û ang a, Lal in nuamahte chuan chinghnia an hrâm bawk ang. Babulon chhiat hun chu a lo thleng dâwn, A nite chu a ral ṭêp tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Jakoba chungah ngil a nei ang a, a mi Israela chu a thlang leh ang. An ramah chuan a awmtîr leh ang a, hnam dang pawhin an rawn pan ang a, Jakoba chhûngte chu an rawn bêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpan a pêk rama haw tûrin hnam dangten an hruai ang a, Israel-te chuan Lalpa ramah chûng mite chu, a hmei a pa, bawihah an nei ang a, anmahni mantute chu an man ve thung ang a, awpbettute pawh chu an awp thung ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na in tuar te, in mangannate leh rim taka an chhawr luih che u lak ata Lalpan a hahchawlhtîr hunah che u chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />He cheksawlhna hla hian Babulon chu in au khum dâwn nia: Tiduhdahtua chu a tlâwm ta elo? Hlauhawma kha a va reh ta êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpan mi sualte tiang a titliak a, Lal sualte vuakfung chu a tibung ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A thinrim a, mite a hlap nek ṭhîn, A tihtlâwm tawhte pawh thinrim takin sawisak a bâng chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ram tin thlamuang takin an awm ta hiai hiai a, Lâwm hla sa-in an au chûl mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nangmah vângin fâr thingte chu an lâwm ta e, Lebanon tlâng sidarte chuan, “I tlâwm tâk hnu hi chuan min kit tûr pawh lo kal an awm ta lo,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hnuai lam mitthi khua chu hmuak tûr chein A lo buai êm êm a, I zuk thlen hlân a nghâkhlel hle a ni. Hnam tinrêng lalte leh hruaitute thlarau chu an lalṭhutthlêng Ata a kaitho chung mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An zavaiin an lo hmuak ang che a, “Keiniho ang maiin i chau ta a, Keini ang lek i nih tâk hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />I ropuina mitthi khuaah i rawn chhukpui ta a, I ṭingṭang thâwm rimawite nên, I âwngphah chu changpât a ni ta a, Thil lung puanah i sin tâk hi,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw nang, Babulon lal, “Zîng êng, Vârparh Arsi inti,” Vân aṭangin i va tlahniam ta êm! Hnam dang titlâwm ṭhîntu Tihtlâwm i nih ve tâk hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Vânah ka lâwn ang a, Pathian arsi chung lamah khian hmâr tâwpa Pathian tlângah lalṭhutthlêng ka hûng ang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chhûm chung lamah ka han chho zêl ang a, Chungnungbera tlukah ka insiam ang,” i ti vei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mitthi khuaah an namthla ta a che, A khuar thûk laiah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A hmu che chuan an en vawng vawng ang che a, ‘He mi hi maw lei pum tinghînga, Lalram sâwi nghîng ṭhîntu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thlalêr anga ram tin tiṭiauva, Khawpui kulh neite la ṭhîntu chu? A sal mante chhuah ngai lova, Hâwntîr duh lotu chu?’ tiin I chanchin an chhui ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hnam dang lal zawng zawngte, Ropui takin mahni thlânah an zalh ṭhîn a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nang erawh chuan phûm i hlawh lo vang a, I ruang chu nausên thisâwn angin tualah an paih ang a, Khuarkhurumah an paih ang a, an chîl nek ang, Mi dang ruangte chuan a delh bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />I ram i tichhe hneh hle a, I mite pawh i thah avângin Lal dang anga phûm ve i ni lo vang, Mi sualte thlah hming chu bo hlen rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />An pate sual avângin an fate chu that zêl ula, An zînga mi tu mah lal tawh suh se, Leiah hian khawpuite an din leh dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa thuchhuak chuan heti hian a ti: “Babulon chu ka bei ang a, A hming ka tibo daih ang a, Eng mah ka zuah lo vang. A tu leh fa chenin ka tiboral vek ang,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Ka phiat chhe vek ang a, Sakuh chênna hmun leh chirhdûmah ka siam ang,” Engkim Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Engkim Lalpan hming chhâl meuhvin heti hian a ti: “Tih ka tum chu ka ti ang a, Rem ka ruat chu a tlang bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Asuria chu ka ram chhûngah ka lo titlâwm ang a, Ka tlângahte chuan ka chîl nek ang. A nghâwngkawl chu ka mite nghâwng ata ka hlîp ang a, Thil rit tak tak a phurhtîr ṭhinte chu ka la bo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Khawvêl pum tân hei hi ka tih tum chu a ni, Hnam tinrêng chungah ka kut ka lek tâk hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Engkim Lalpan tih a tum ta, Tu nge sûtsak thei ang? Hrem tûrin kut a lek ta a, Tu nge lo dang thei ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Lal Ahaza thih kumin he thu hi a lo thleng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Filistia mite u, An vuakna che u tiang a tliak ta a, hlim mai suh u, Rûl chu thi mah sela chawngkawr a lo chhuak ang, A tui aṭangte chuan rûlpui thlâwk thei a lo keu vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Lalpan a mi, rethei chanhaite chu a châwm ang a, Mangangte chu thlamuang takin an hahchâwl ang. Nangni erawh chu ṭâmin in fate ka tihlum ang a, Thi bângte chu ka sât hlum ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Filistia rama khaw tin hotute u, Chiau vawng vawng ula, In vaiin hlau hle rawh u. Hmâr lam aṭangin vaivut a lo khu e, Chau fâl awm lo sipai rual pal khûk chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Filistia ram palaite chu Engtin nge kan chhân ang? “Zion chu Lalpa din a ni a, Tah chuan tihduhdah tuar, a mite chu an tlu lût ang,” Tiin a ni ang chu.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Moab chungthu: Zan khat thilah Ar khua sawisak nek a ni a, Moab a tlâwm ta e. Zan khat thilah Kir khua sawisak nek a ni a, Moab a tlâwm ta e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Dibon mite, an pathian biakna hmunsângah Ṭap tûrin an chho va, Moab miten an lu an mêt kawlh a, Khabehmul an ziat fai a, Nebo leh Medeba khua chu an ṭah vawng vawng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kawtthlêrahte saiip puan an veng a, In chung zâwlahte leh tual zau laiah te, Lungchhe takin an ṭap tlawk tlawk mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hesbon leh Elealeh mite thlabârin an au va, Jahaz aṭang pawhin an hre phâk hial a ni. Moab sipaite pawh thlaphâng takin an au va, An zâm zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Moab vângin ka thinlung a na a, Zoar leh Eglath-selisia thleng thlengin An râl hlau chu an tlânchhia a, Ṭhenkhatte chu Luhit chhovah ṭap chungin an chho va, Ṭhenkhat phei chu Honoraim-ah an tlân a, Mangang takin an ṭap zêl a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nimrim lui a kang ta a, A kam hnimte a uai zo ta. Chawrno leh tûr a awm lo va, Hnimhring rêng rêng a awm ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuipuisuthlah ruam pêlin An neih zawng zawng an tlânchhiatpui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Moab ram kil tinah an au chuah chuah mai a, An au thâwm chuan Eglaim a thleng hial a, Beer-elim aṭang pawhin an ṭap thâwm chu an hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Dibon khaw tuite chu thisenin a sen khuih mai, Chûng aia râpthlâk chu a la awm dâwn, Moab ram aṭanga râltlânte leh Ram chhûnga thi bângte tân sakeibaknei ka tîr ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thlalêra awm Sela khua aṭangin Moab hotute chuan berâmno chum Zion tlânga rorêltu chu an han pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A bu lâksak sava thlâwk ruai angin Arnon kaiah mumal nei lovin Moab hotute chu an tei an tei mai e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Engtin nge kan awm ang, min ngaihtuah teh u, Chhûn ni sâa thingbuk hlim angin, In hlimah chuan kan lo châwl ang e. Râltlânte hi min lo humhim ula, Hmêlma kutah min hlân suh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Moab vâkvaite hi in zîngah chêng ila, Min tihboral tumtute lakah min hum rawh u. Min tihduhdahna hi a reh mai ang, Min rapbettute hi kan ram ata an kîr hunah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Davida thlah lalah kan neih ang a, Rinawm takin khawngaihna nên ro a rêl ang, Thil dik tihah a ṭuan a ṭha ang a, Dik taka rêl a tum ngei ang,” an han ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Moab chapo ṭhinzia kan hria, An va chapo ṭhîn êm! An induh a, an inchhuang a, an intivei êm êm; Mahse, an uang mai mai a ni,” an lo ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Moab mite chu ṭap ṭap teh se, Mi tin chiau vawng vawng mai rawh se, Kir-hareset grep pho vuai hlâwm chu Châkin rûm rûm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hesbon huan a chhe ta a, Sibna grep huante chu a chul zo ta. Hnam tin hotuten chuta uain chu an rui ṭhîn a, An grep hruite chu Jazer a zâm thleng a, Khawchhak lamah thlalêr a thleng bawk a, Khawthlang lamah Tuipui Thi pawh a zâm kai bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuvângin, Jazer tân ka ṭap ang a, Sibna grep tân ka ṭap vak dâwn, Hesbon leh Elealeh tân ka mittui a luang a, Inbeihna hmun a nih avângin thei lawh tûrte a ram zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huanahte chuan lâwma hlim thâwm a reh ta a, Grep huanahte hlimin an au ta lo, Grep rap sâwr tûr an awm hek lo, Lâwma au thâwm a reh duk mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ṭingṭang ri kuai ruai angin Moab avângin ka thinlung pawh a hnîm, Kir-hareset chu ka lainat êm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Moab mite, an Pathian biakna hmunsângah ṭawngṭai tûrin an inhmang chau zo ta. An tân a sâwt si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chu chu Moab chungchânga Lalpa thu sawi tawh chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpan tûnah a sawi leh ta. “Kum thumah, kum thum chhûng inhlawhfa angin, Moab hausakna chu a tâwp ang. Mi an tam hle na a, tlêm tê chauh thi bâng an awm ang a, chûngte pawh chu an chau hle ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Damaska chungthu: “Damaska chu khua pawh a ni tawh lo vang, Thil chhe awm khâwm mai a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aroer khuate chu an rauhsan vek ang a, Ran rual tlatna hmun a ni ang. Thlamuang takin an bawk ang a, Tu man an hnawt lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Efraim ramah kulh rêng a awm lo vang a, Damaska ram pawh a ṭiau vek ang, Suria rama la dam chhunte chu Israel-te ropuina chuai ta ang an ni ang,” Engkim Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Chumi ni chuan Jakoba ropuina a ral ang a, A hausa a, mahse, a pachhe hle tawh dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Buh sengtuin Refaim phai buh an seng zawha, Lâk hmaih la awm pheuh pheuh ang hi an la ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Oliv rah sâwi ṭilh tawh, A lêr sânga pahnih khat rah veu veu, A zâr sei deuh hmâwra pali panga la awm ang hi an la ni ang,” Israel-te Pathian, Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutih hunah chuan miten anmahni siamtu lam an hawi ang a, Israel Mi Thianghlima chu an thlîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kuta an siam maichâmte chu an ngaihsak lo vang a, anmahni siam Aseri-te leh rimtui hâlna maichâmte chu an melh duh tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel-te hmaa Hiv mite leh Amor mite khawpui rauhsan ang mai khân an khawpui kulh ṭha tak takte chu an tlânsan ang a, a ram hun a lo thleng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />In chhandamtu Pathian chu in theihnghilh a, In himna lungpui chu in hre duh ta si lo. Mawi tak takin huan serh in siam zâwk a, Hnam dang pathian biak chu in thlang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />In phun tûk lawkah chuan In thil phunte nungin pâr mah sela, A rah lawh tûr a awm hauh lo vang, Buai leh na reh thei lo a lo thlen ni-ah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chei! Tuifinriat fâwn angin Hnam liante chu an lo ri hum hum a, Tuifâwn buan buan angin An che buan buan a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chûng mite chu lo fâwn buan buan mah se, Lalpan a hau vang a, an reh duak ang, Tlângah thliin buhsi a chhêm lên leh, Thlipui chhêm lên vaivut ang hian an bo duak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tlai lamah chuan an hlauhawm êm êm a, Zîng lamah chuan hlauh tûr an awm ta lo, Chu chu min rawk tumtu, min ram tumte chanvo tûr chu a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ethiopia lui râlah, thlâwk sup sup tamna ram a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chûng mite chuan Nail luidung rawn hrûtin, Phairuang lawnglêng hmangin palai an rawn tîr chhuak, “In ramah kîr rawh u, palai viak ṭhate u, Hnam chak leh thiltithei tak, Mi dawlhkai ṭha, sa mâm thel thawl, Hmânlai ata mi tin hlauhte awmna, Lui tam tak luan tlangna ramah chuan.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khawvêla awm zawng zawng, leilung luahtute u, Tlângchhîpa puanzâr an zâr lo thlîr ula, Tawtawrâwt ri lo ngaithla ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian ka hnênah a ti: Buh seng, khaw lum lai dai tla ang leh, Chhûn lai ni sa ang hian, Ngawi rengin ka awmna aṭang hian ka rawn thlîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Grep pâr a han rêm a, a lo rah a, Mahse, a hmin lawh tûr a awm hmaa sâm ang maiin, Hmêlmaten Ethiopia mite chu an rawn sâm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An ruangte chu tlângrama mu leh ramsa eiah an hnutchhiah ang, Nipui laiin mu rualin an tlân ang a, Thlasik laiin ramsate chuan an tlân thung ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hnam chak leh thiltithei tak, Mi dawlhkai ṭha, sa mâm thel thawl, Hmânlai ata mi tin hlauhte awmna, Lui tam tak luan tlangna ram aṭangin Engkim Lalpa hming chawia sak, A chênna tlâng Zion-ah chuan Thilpêk kengin an lo kal ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aigupta ram chungthu: Chhûm chak tak chunga chuangin Lalpa chuan Aigupta ram a pan. A hmaah chuan Aigupta ram milemte chu an khûr ang a, Aigupta mite chu an zâm zo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Aigupta mite chu, Aigupta mite vêk ka beihtîr ang a, Unau an inbitum ang a, ṭhenawm an inbei ang. Khua leh khua te, bial leh bialte an indo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aigupta mite chu ka tizâm vek ang a, An remruat sate chu ka tichingpen vek ang. Milem te, dawithiam te, mitthi thlûk thiam te, Aien thiamte an râwn chung ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aigupta mite chu hotu râwng tak kutah ka pe ang a, Lal sual takin an chungah ro a rêl ang,” Lalpa , Engkim Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nail luipui chu a kang ang a, Li mawngte pawh a ro vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lui pêngte leh an tui kawngte a kang ang a, A uih vut vut bawk ang, Phairuang leh pumphîrte chu a vuai zo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Luipui kam chu a kawlh rel rul ang a, Thil phunte pawh a thi ang a, Thliin a lên bo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sanghamantute chu rûmin an ṭap ang a, Nail luia nghakuai chiahte leh lên dêng ṭhînte chu An hlawhchham ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />La zai sîn kaia khuihtute chu an buai ang a, Puan zai sîn tah thiamte pawh an mangang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Puantah thiamte chu an chau vang a, Inhlawhfate an lungngai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zoan khaw hruaitute chu an va â êm! Farawa mi fingte remruat pawh â tak a ni; ‘Hmânlai mi fingte leh lalte thu dawng chhâwngtu kan ni,’ tiin. Engtin nge Farawa hnênah an sawi theih ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khawi lamah nge i mi fingte an awm? Aigupta tân Engkim Lalpa thil tih tum hi, Sawi fiah sela, hrilh che rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zoan khaw hruaitute chu mi â an ni, Nof khaw hotute pawh bum an ni. An hruaituten an hruai bo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpan an rilru ngaihtuahna a tichiai ta a, Aigupta mite chuan eng mah tihdik theih an nei lo; An pai an pai ta a, Zu rui ama luaka a tlu ang hi an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Milian leh mitê, hausa leh rethei, Tu mah Aigupta ram tân tih theih nei an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chumi hun chuan Aigupta mite chu hmeichhia ang maia dawih an la ni ang; Engkim Lalpan anmahni hrem tûra kut a han lek chuan hlauvin an khûr zawih zawih ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Engkim Lalpan Aigupta a hrem dân tûr a puahchah chu sawi rîk hlek an hriat pawhin Judai ram chu an hlau êm êm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chumi hun chuan Aigupta ram khaw ngaah Hebrai ṭawng an hmang ang a, Engkim Lalpa hming chhâlin thu an tiam ṭhîn ang. Chûng khaw zînga pakhat chu, ‘Haheres’ an vuah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chumi hun chuan Aigupta ram chhûngah Lalpa tân maichâm an siam ang a, Aigupta ramriah a tân lungphun a ding bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chûng chu Aigupta ramah Engkim Lalpa a awm tih hriat nân leh chhinchhiah nân a ni; tihduhdah an niha, Lalpa an auh veleh chhantu tûr tîrin a hum ang a, a chhan chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lalpa chu Aigupta mite hnênah a inlan ang a, hâlral thilhlante leh inthawinate hlânin chibai an bûk ang a, Lalpa hnênah thute an tiam ang a, an hlen bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Aigupta mite chu a hrem ang a; mahse, a tidam leh nghâl bawk ang. Lalpa lam an hawi ang a, an ṭawngṭainate a chhâng ang a, a tidam tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chumi hun chuan Aigupta ram aṭangin Asuria ram thlengin lamlian a kal ruah ang a, Asuria leh Aigupta mite chu an intlawh tawn chhên tawh ang. Pathian chibai an bûk tlâng bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chumi hun chuan Israel chu Asuria leh Aigupta tlukpui a ni ang a, chûng hnam thumte chu khawvêl tân malsâwmna an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa chuan mal a sâwm ang a, “Ka mi, Aigupta mite, ka kut chhuak, nangni Asuria mite, ka thlan, nangni Israel mite u, mal ka sâwm ang che u,” a la ti ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Asuria lal Sargona thupêk angin an sipai hotu ber chuan Filistia mite khua Asdod chu a bei a, a la ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hemi hma kum thum kal ta khân Amoza fapa Isaia chu a pheikhawk phelha, a saiip puan ven chu hlîp tûrin Lalpan thu a pe a, chutiang chuan a ti a; saruakin, pheikhawk pawh bun lovin a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Asdod khua an lâk kum chuan Lalpan , “Ka chhiahhlawh Isaia chu kum thum chhûng pheikhawk bun lo leh saruakin a awm a, hei hi Aigupta leh Ethiopia chungchâng chhinchhiahna leh entîrna a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hetiang hian Asuria lal chuan Aigupta mi an mante leh Ethiopia mi sala an hruaite chu, naupang pawh, upa pawh, saruak leh pheikhawk bun lovin mawngtam lang rengin an kawi duah duah ang. Aigupta ram an mualpho hle dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ethiopia lo ring viau va, Aigupta lo chhuang ṭhînte chu beidawngin an mangang hle ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chumi hun a lo thlen chuan hêng tuipui kama chêngte hian, “Kan lo rin viau, Asuria lal laka min chhan tûr leh min hum tûra kan lo belhte heti mai hi an nih tâk hi! Keini tehlul hi mahni maiin engtin nge kan inhum theih ang?” an ti ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babulon chungthu: Ṭhâwngaleivirin thlalêra hrût angin, Ram hlauhawm tak aṭangin chhiatna a lo thleng dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zêl râpthlâk tak mi hmuhtîr a, Rawktuin a rawn rawk bawrh bawrh a, Suamtuin a rawn suam buan buan a. Elam sipaite u, bawh ta che u, Media sipaite u, kulhte chu bei rawh u, Mi dang tithlabârtu chu ka timang dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chumi avâng chuan ka khûr a, Nauvei na ang maiin ka kâwngte a na a, Ka kûn reng a, eng mah ka hre thei lo, Min râp êm a, eng mah ka hmu thei bawk hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka lu a hai zo ta, hlauvin ka buai ta e, Ka nghahhlelh ṭhin tlai ni nêm chu Ka tân khurh hun a ni ta zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ruai an lo buatsaih a, ṭhut nân pherte an lo phah a, Eiin an in ta a. “Tho thuai teh u, hruaitute u, In phâwte kha peih fel teh u,”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka hnênah heti hian a ti: “Kal la, râl vêng tûr mi dah rawh, A hmuh apiang sawi zêl rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sakawr chungchuang, a kawpa lo kal te, Sabengtunga chuang te, Ngun takin en rawh se.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Râlvêngtu chu a au va, “Ka pu, vênbûk sângah ka ding reng a, A chhûn a zân mu hauh lovin ka thlîr reng e,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sakawr chungchuang, a kawpa lo kalte, An lo thleng thut mai le! “Babulon khua a chhe ta, a chhe ta, An milem pathiante a tlu bung rem rum mai,” Râlvêngtu chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka mi, Israel, hruiha chîl nek tawh hnute u, Israel-te Pathian, Engkim Lalpan chanchin min hrilh tâk hi, In hnênah pawh ka rawn puang ve a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Duma chungthu: Edom ram aṭangin min rawn au va, “Râlvêngtu, zân a rei tawh em?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Râlvêngtu chuan, “Khua a vâr dâwn tawh a, Zân a lo thleng leh mai ang, Hriat i duh chuan lo kal leh la, Min rawn zâwt leh ang che,” a lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Arabia chungthu: Dedan mi ran rual nêna Arabia ram phûla riakte chu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tema khaw mite u, Tuihâlte tân tuisik han la ula, Râltlânte hi chaw nên lo hmuak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khandaih te, khandaih phawi sa te, Thalngul kawih sa te, Indona râpthlâk tak ata te tlânchhia an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka hnênah heti hian a ti: “Inhlawhfa kum chhiara kum khat a tlin veleh Kedar ropuina chu a tawp ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kedar mi huaisen, thal kâp mite chu, tlêm tê chauh thi bâng an awm ang,” Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Inlârna ruam chungthu: Eng in ti nge in chung zâwla in lâwn tâk ṭheuh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khawpui chhûng a ri ta mur mur mai, An au chûl a, an sâhâwk ta, In mitthite khandaiha thah an ni lo va, Inkahnaa thi lah an ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />In hotute an tlânchhia a, Thal khat mah thlah lovin an man, An hmuh apiang an man che u, Thui tak tlânchhe tawh mah ula.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Min kalsan vek teh u, Ka mi thi tate hi ka ṭah tlawk tlawk dâwn e, Min hnem pawh tum suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Inlârna ruamah hian manganna ni, Inrahbeh leh chiaina ni, Lalpa , Engkim Lalpan a rawn thlentîr tâk hi. Khaw kulh bang chu an chhu chhia a, Mangang au thâwm chuan tlâng tin a nghawr ta e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Elam sipaite chu thal bâwm paiin Sakawr tawlailîrah an lo chuang a, Kir mite chuan an phaw an phawrh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />In ram phaizâwl ṭha laiah chuan, An tawlailîr a awm khup a, Sakawr chungchuang mite pawh Kulh kawngkhâr bulah an ding hmur mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Judai ram inhumhimna an ṭhiat zo ta. Chumi hun chuan thuam dahna ata râlthuam in la chhuak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Davida khaw kulh bang chim laite chu in en vek a, Dîl thlangta zâwka tui chu in chawi khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jerusalem khuaa inte pawh in en vek a, a ṭhente chu kulh bang chhe thawm nân in ṭhiat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khaw kulh chhûngah tuikhuah in siam a; Dîl hlui aṭanga tui lo luang chhêk khâwm nân in hmang a. Hmasâng ata hetiang thil lo ruat lâwka, Tithlengtu chu in ngaihsak si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan, Lalpa , Engkim Lalpan ṭapa chiau vawng vawng tûr lehlu mêt kawlha, saiip puan sin tûrin a ti che u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mahse, nuiin in hlim viau va, Bâwng leh berâm talhin ruai in ṭheh a, Zu in chên a, “I eiin i in ang u, Naktûkah chuan kan thi mai ang,” in ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Engkim Lalpan ka hnênah ngei a sawi, “An dam chhûng chu he an thil sual tih avâng hian, Ka ngaidam hauh lo vang, Kei, Lalpa , Engkim Lalpan ka sawi tawh hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa , Engkim Lalpa chuan heti hian ka hnênah a ti: “Hawh teh, lal sum enkawltu Sebna hnênah va kal la, heti hian va ti rawh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />‘Tu nge maw i niha, i thlân tûr i ker vei le? Tlângpang lungah an zalhna tûr che i ker vei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ngai teh, mi pawimawh tak ni mah la, Lalpa chuan a lên lawp ang che a, a vawrh daih ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bâwl angin a la ang che a, ram zau takah a lum nek ang che; tah chuan, i chhuan êm êm, i tawlailîr bulah i thi ang; i pu chhûngte i tizak hle dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />I hna ata ka bân ang che a, hotu i nihna ata i tla ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chumi hun chuan ka chhiahhlawh, Eliakima, Hilkia fapa chu, ka ko vang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />i kawrfual ropui chu ka hâktîr ang a, i kâwnghrên pawh ka hrêntîr ang. I thuneihna zawng zawng a hnênah ka hlân ang a, Jerusalem-a chêngte leh Judai rama mite tân pa a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Davida chhûngte chabi chu a kutah ka dah ang a, a hawn tawh chu tu man an khâr lo vang a, a khâr tawh chu tu man an hawng hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Leichâra ban angin nghet takin ka phun ang a, a chhûngte tân a chhuanawm êm êm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A laichînte leh a tu leh fate chuan an bêl ang a, an chhûngkaw mamawh zawng zawng, bungbêl leh no chenin amahah a innghat vek ang.’ ”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa thuchhuak chuan heti hian a ti: “Chutih hunah chuan leichâra nghet taka ban phun chu a nghîng ang a, a phawng ang. Amah bêltu zawng zawng tâwpna a ni ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tura khaw chungthu: Tarsis lawngpute u, chiau vawng vawng rawh u, Inte chu lawngchawlhna chenin a chhe zo ta, Kupra thliarkâr in thlen hunah chauh chu chu in hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuifinriat kama awmte u, ngawi ṭhiap rawh u, Sidon khuaa sumdâwngte u, Tuipui zau tak kânin in sumdâwng a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sihor phai buh, Nail lui kama thar chu in zu lei a, ram dangahte in hralh leh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw, Sidon khawpui, i mualpho ta e, Tuifinriat thûk tak chuan “Nau ka vei ngai lo va, ka hring ngai hek lo, Fanu fapa ka châwm lian bawk hek lo,” A tihsan tâk che hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tura chhiat tâk thu hi Aigupta miten an hriatin pawi an ti a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuifinriat kama mite u, chiau vawng vawngin Tarsis lamah kal kai rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hei hi maw hmânlai ata khaw hlun, Khaw inchhuang tak ṭhîn chu? Tuipui râla khaw thar din tûr, He khua aṭang hian maw chhuak ṭhîn?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lallukhum, mite an khumtîr a, An sumdâwng mite chu mi ropui tak tak an ni a, An dâwrkaite ram tin ngaihsân an ni bawk a. Tura chunga thil thleng ta chu tu tih nge ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Engkim Lalpan a tih a ni, An chhuan êm êm an ropuina a titâwp a, An mi zahawmte chu a timualpho ta e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nail lui kam angin in ram chu let ula, Tarsis mite u, lawng chawlhna tûr in nei ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpan tuifinriat chungah pawh kut a lek a, Lalram tam tak a sâwi chhe ta, Kanan mite hmunpui Nuai bo tûrin Lalpan thu a pe e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sidon nula thianghlim, mi sawisak hnu, I uang tawh ngai lo vang. Kupra thliarkâr lamah tlân vei mah la, I him chuang hauh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tura khua, ram sakawlh tlat nâna siamtu chu, Asuria ni lovin Babulon hi a ni; khaw hual nân in sâng an sa a, a kulhte chu an ṭhiat a, khua chu a chim chhe ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tarsis lawngpute u, chiau vawng vawng rawh u, In hmunpui chu a chhiat tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutih hunah chuan lal pakhat lal hun chhûng, kum sawmsarih chhûng chu, Tura khua hi tu man an hre lo vang. Kum sawmsarih a ral hnuah Tura chu he hlaa nawhchizuar ang hi a ni ang:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tu man an hriat tawh loh, nang nawhchizuar, Perhkhuang kengin khua fang leh la, Ṭingṭang perhin hla mawi tak tak sa rawh, An hriat leh theih nân che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kum sawmsarih a ral hnu chuan Lalpan Tura khua chu a kan ang a, a tih ngai a tihtîr leh ang; khawvêl ram tinah a inzuar leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A deh chhuah chu Lalpa tâna hlan a ni ang. A thukru lo vang a, a kawl ru hek lo vang. Lalpa hmaa chêngten hnianghnâra ei tûr leh silhfên ṭha ṭha lei nân an hmang ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpan lei hi a tiṭiau dâwn, a ram dêr ang, A khaikhup thawk ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A chhûnga chêngte chu a theh chhuak vek bawk ang. Mi narân leh puithiam, chhiahhlawh leh a pu, Chhiahhlawhnu leh a pi, thil leitu leh hralhtu, Pûktîrtu leh pûktu, battîrtu leh batu, An tuar a inang vek bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lei chu bun ruah a ni ang a, A ruak vek ang. He thu hi Lalpa sawi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lei chuan a sûn ang a, a nguai ruai ang, Khawvêl chu lungngaiin a chau vang a, Lei leh vân pawh a dul ruih ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A chhûnga chêngte chuan lei hi an tibawrhbâng ta a, Dân chu an bawhchhia a, thupêk an awih lo va, Kumkhaw thuthlung an pawisa lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuvângin, leiin ânchhia a dawng ta a, A chhûnga chêngte chuan sual man an têl, Leia mite chu an kâng chiam a, Thi bâng an tlêm hle mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Grep hrui a vuai zo va, Uain pawh a vâng tial tial, Hlim taka awm ṭhînte an ngui zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Benchhek bênga an hlim leh lâm, Au thâwm a dai zo ta. Perhkhuang perh ri hriat tûr a awm ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zaiin uain an in tawh lo va, Zu thlum an in pawhin kha an ti zêl,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khawpui chu a chhiain a buai zo ta, In zawng zawng chu an kalh vek a, luh theih a ni lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mangang takin kawtthlêrahte an au, Uain in tûr a awm tâk loh avângin Hlimna tûr rêng a awm ta lo, Lei lâwmna pawh a bo zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khawpuite chu a chhe zo va, Kulh kawngkhârte pawh chhut chhiat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A rah an sâwi tlâk hnu oliv kûng leh, An lawh nawn tawh grep hrui ang hi Khawvêla chêng hnam tin an la ni dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />La damte chu lâwmin an au vang a, Khawthlang aṭangin Lalpa ropuizia chu an aupui ang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khawchhak lamah pawh Lalpa an chawimawi ang a, Israel-te Pathian, Lalpa hming chu, Tuipui kama chêngte pawhin an fak bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kâwlkil aṭangin, “Mi Dika chu chawimawi rawh u,” Ti-a hla sa kan hre bawk ang. Ka chau ta, ka chau ta, ka chung a va pik êm! Min phattu chuan min phat zêl e, Min phat dân pawh a râpthlâk tial tial mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lei mite u, thil râpthlâk tak a lo thleng dâwn, Leilâwta tlâk leh fala delh in hmabâk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thil râpthlâk hlauva tlânchhia chu, Leilâwtah an tla ang, Leilâwt ata lo vâk chhuak chu falin a delh dâwn si. Vân tukverh inhawngah ruahpui a lo sûr chiam ang a, Lei nghahchhan pawh a nghîng bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lei hi a khi ang a, a kak phawk ang, A phel ruah bawk ang a, a nghîng dur dur ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zu rui angin a thle a thle ang a, Thlâm sâwi del del ang hi a ni bawk ang. Suahsualna chu a nasa êm a, A tlûk phah ang a, a tho leh tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chutih hunah chuan, Chung lam thiltihtheihnate leh Leia lalte Lalpan a hrem dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tângho khuarkhuruma dah khâwm angin Lalhote chu a khung khâwm ang a, Nakin hnua hrem tûrin a tântîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Thla a zak ang a, Ni a zak bawk ang, Zion tlângah, Jerusalem-ah chuan Engkim Lalpa chu lalah a ṭhu ang a, Upate chuan a ropuizia an hmu ṭhîn ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , ka Pathian i ni, I hming chawimawiin ka fak ang che, Thil mak tam tak i ti ṭhîn a, Hmânlai aṭanga i remruatte Rinawm takin i tihlawhtling ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khawpuite chu i tichhia a, A kulhte chu i tichim a, Hnam dang khawpuite chu a ram ang a, Sak ṭhat a ni tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, hnam chak tak takten an fak ang che a, Hnam râwng tak tak khuate pawhin an ṭih ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Rethei leh ṭanpui ngaite tân kulh i ni a, An mangang chu an lo tlân ṭhîn, Thlipui lakah i lo hum a, Chhûn ni sâah i daihlimah an biru ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thlipuiin bangte a nem sawk sawk ang hian Mi nunrâwngten an rawn bei ṭhîn. Ram ro taka mei sa ang hi an ni. Mahse, nang chuan hnam dangte thâwm i tidai a, Chhûm zîngin khaw lum a tidai ta ang hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />He tlângah hian Engkim Lalpan mi zawng zawng tân ruai tui tak a ṭheh dâwn, uain thlum ṭha ṭha, a tuitlingte nên, sa tui tui, a thlîngte nên ruai a buatsaih dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka tlângah hian mi zawng zawng tuamtu, hnam tin khuh ṭhîntu, lungngaihna chu, a hlîp daih ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan thihna chu a hneh ang a, a mite mittui chu a hru hul ang; miten khawvêl puma a mite an hnehchhiahna chu a tireh bawk ang; Lalpan chu chu a sawi tawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chumi hun chuan “En teh u, hei hi kan Pathian chu a ni. Amah kan ring a, min rawn chhan ta a nih hi. Ani hi Lalpa chu a ni a, amah kan ring a, min chhandam avângin i hlim ang u,” an la ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpan Zion tlâng hi a hum ang a, Moab erawh chu buhpâwl, êk khura an chîl pil ang hian a chîl pil ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tui hleuh tum angin an bân an phar ang a; mahse, Lalpan an chapona chu a tihhniamsak ang a, an kut themthiamnate pawh a tihbosak bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An kulh bang sâng tak takte chu a tichim ang a, lei vaivutah a let rum ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan Judai ramah he hla hi an sa ang: “Khawpui rinawm takah kan chêng a, Kan inhum nân kulh bang min siamsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kulh kawngkhârte chu hawng ula, Hnam rinawmte lo lût rawh se, Thil dik ti ṭhîn hnam chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nghet taka nangmaha innghatte chu Thlamuang takin i awmtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa chu kumkhuain ring tlat rawh u, Lalpa chu chatuan himna lungpui a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sâng taka awmte chu a hnûk thla a, An chênna khaw rinawmte a tichhia a, An kulh bangte vaivutah a chantîr ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tah chuan baihvaite pawh duh duhin an kal a, An duh duhnaah chuan an vâk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi dikte kawng i siam nuam a, An kalna chu i titluang ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A ni, Lalpa , i duhzâwng kawng zawngin ka nghâk a che, I hming hriat reng hi ka duhzâwng ber a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zân a lo ni a, ka ngai êm êm che a, A ni, ka thlarau hian a zawng chiam ṭhîn a che, Lei chunga ro i rêl hun chuan A chhûnga awmte chuan rorêlna dik an hre tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi sualte chuan khawngaih hlawh mah sela, Thil dik tih zir an tum chuang lo, Dikna ramah pawh hian thil sual an ti zêl a, Lalpa ropuina chu an hmu duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />I kut i lek pawhin an hmu duh lo, I mite hi i duat ṭhinzia hmuhtîr ang che. Hmu se, mualpho rawh se, I hmêlmate tâna i buatsaih meiah chuan kâng ral rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa , râlmuanna min pe a, Kan thil tih vete pawh nangma min tihsak vek a ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , kan Pathian, lal dang kan chungah hian an lal ṭhîn a, Mahse, nang chauh hi kan lal chu i ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An thi mai a, an nung leh dâwn tawh lo, An thlarau pawh a tho leh tawh lo vang. Anni chu i hrem a, hriat zui tûr an awm lo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa , kan hnam min tipung a, min tilian a, Kan ramrite min zauhsak a, Nangmah i inchawimawi ta zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa , an manganin an pan che a, Anni chu i hrem a; mahse, an au lawm lawm ṭhîn che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hmeichhe nau vei na tuar rûm rûm angin, Lalpa , i hmaah kan awm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nau pai angin kan vei na a, Eng mah kan hring si lo; Kan ram pawh kan chhan thei lo va, Tih theih eng mah kan nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />I mi, thi tate chu an nung leh ang a, An ruangte chu a tho leh ang. Vaivuta mu tawhte an lo ṭhangharh ang a, Hlim takin an zai ang. Hnah vuai, daifîmin a tiharh leh ang hian Thi tawhte pawh Lalpan a rawn tiharh leh ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka mite u, in pindan chhûngrila lûtin, Kawng inkhâr khum ula, Pathian thinur a kian hma chu lo biru rih teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A chênna vân ata Lalpa a lo kal ang a, An sual avângin lei mite chu a rawn hrem ang. Tual thah rûkte an puang ang a, An ruangte pawh leiin a khuh bo tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi hun chuan Lalpan a khandaih lian pui, hriam tak chu tuipuia Leviathan, rûlpui tlânchhia, Dragon tleng nghuat nghuat hrem nân a lek ang a, a that ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chumi hun chuan Lalpan a grep huan duhawm tak thu chu heti hian a sawi ang:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Kei Lalpa hi a vêngtu ka ni a, Eng lai pawhin tui ka leih a, Tu man an khawih loh nân chhûn leh zân ka vêng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A chungah chuan ka thinur tawh lo va, Thlawh fai tûr hlîng leh hlohar lo awm mah se, Ka hâl ral zêl bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An hmêlmaten ka vên an duh ve chuan, Min rawn rem sela, Kei hi min rawn rem mai rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Engtik hunah emaw Jakoba thlahte chuan zung an thlâk leh ang a, Israel chu a chawrnovin a pâr leh ang. Leiah an rah a khat vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel-te chu anmahni vawtu a vuak tlukin a vaw lo va, Anmahni thattute a that tam zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Saltâng tûrin a tîr chhuak a, Khawchhak thli hrâng a lâktîr ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hnam dang maichâm lungte, Chinai lung ang maiin an râwt dip a, Aseri lim leh inthawina lung an paih fai vek hunah, Israel-te sual chu ngaihdam a ni ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khawpui kulh neite chu a chim zo ta, Khaw ram a ni ta a, thlalêr ang mai a ni. Tah chuan ran rualte an tla a, An riahna hmun, an tâl vêlna a lo ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thingzârte chu rovin a tliak ta a, Thingtuah atân hmeichhiaten an fawm ta, Eng mah hre hlei thei lo hnam an nih hi, An siamtu chuan a khawngaih lo vang a, Anmahni dintu chuan a lainat hek lo vang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chumi hunah chuan Lalpan Eufretis lui aṭanga Aigupta lui thlengin, buh seng angin a mi, Israel-te chu pakhat khatin a lâwr khâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chumi hun chuan tawtawrâwt lian pui an hâm ang a, Asuria rama pil bote leh Aigupta-a hnawh thlâkte chu an lo kîr ang a, Jerusalem tlâng thianghlimah chuan Lalpa chibai an bûk ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ruam ram ṭha tak bula awm, Efraim rui thal dêr chung chu a pik e. Zu rui pârṭhi awrh a vuai angin, An chhuan khawpui, lallukhum mawi chu, A chuai mai dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Anmahni bei tûrin mi chak leh huai Lalpan a hual tawh a, Thli hrâng lo thawk, rial tla chum chum, Ruahpuivânâwn lo sûr, tui lian bulh bulh angin, An ram a rawn nuai nek dâwn e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Efraim hotu rui bûr, chapo takte chu, A rawn raphrual zêk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ruam ram ṭha tak bula awm ropui leh mawi tak chul ta chu, Nipui a thâwk hlima theipui lo hmin hmasa hmutuin, A lova a hmawm nghâl mai ang hi a la ni dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chumi hun chuan Engkim Lalpa ngei chu, Thi bâng la awm, a mite tân Lallukhum ropui leh diar mawi tak a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Rorêltu chu rorêl thiamna a pe ang a, Khaw vêngtu chu râl dang tûra huaina a pe bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zâwlnei leh puithiamte meuh pawh, Uain ruiin an pai an pai tâk saw, Uain leh rakzu an in tam a, An rui buai a, an thle an thle a ni. Zâwlneite chu inlârna an hmuh Dawngsawng thei lo khawpin an rui a. Puithiamte pawh an hnêna thu an rawn thlen Rêl thei lovin an rui bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Dawhkânahte an luak niai nuai a, Bawlhhlawh hlîrin a khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Hriat tûr tu nge zirtîr a tum veia, A thu tu tân nge ngaihthlâk tham awm ang? Hnute nghei tîr naupangchhe tân em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thupêkte chu a hawrawp mal malin, A tlar tê tê, eng emaw hlek hlek Min zirtîr a tum hi!” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hnam dang ṭawng, lam rîk har tak hmangin Ka mite hi Lalpan thu a hrilh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hahdam taka châwl der der tûrin a sâwm ṭhîn a, Mahse, an ngaithla duh si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa thu chu an tân, A hawrawp mal malin, a tlar tê têin, Eng emaw hlek hlek chauh a lo thleng ang. Tichuan, in kalkawngah in tlu ang a, Hliam in tuar ang a, man in ni ang, An hruai bo daih ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jerusalem-a chêng, Ka mite chunga rorêltu chapote u, Lalpa thu hi ngaithla rawh u:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Thihna nên thu kan thlung tawh a, Mitthi khua nên thu kan intiam tawh e, Hremna luipui lo lian mah se, Min chîm ve tawp lo vang. Inphen nân bumna kan hmang a, Inhumhim nân dâwt kan ruai ta,” in ti vei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: Ngai teh, Zion-ah chuan lung ka phûm ta, Lung him rinawm tak chu, A kil lung ṭangkai leh hlu tak chu ka dah ta, A ring ngam chu an nghîng lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A tihngîlna hrui atân rorêlna dik leh A sahâl khai atân dikna ka hmang a ni. Dâwta an inhumhimna chu rialin a chhu chhia ang, An inphenna pawh chu tuilianin a la ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thihna nêna in thuthlung chu sût a ni ang a, Mitthi khua nêna in thutiam pawh chu ṭhiat a ni ang. Hremna lui lo lian chuan, Nangni pawh a chîm pil ngei ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A lo thlen chuan a la ngei dâwn si che u a, A tûk têlin a lo liam zêl ang a, Chhûn zân zawmin a lian reng dâwn si a, A thu awmzia hi hria ula, In va thlaphâng dâwn êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />‘Thluanna tham loh khum tawi lutuk, Inkhuh dâwna puan tawngchham lutuk’ tih ang hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Perazim tlâng chungah leh Gibeon ram ruama a che ang khân, A thil tih tum mak tak tak leh A thawh tum ril tak tak chu Lalpan a rawn ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Min nuihzat teh suh u, Chutilo zawng, in chan a chau sauh ang, Lalpa , Engkim Lalpan ram pum tihchhiat a tum a ni, Thu a peih fel tawh tih ka hria e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka aw hi hria ula, beng chhi rawh u, Ka thu sawi hi ngaithla ula, ngaihven rawh u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lo neitu chuan thlai chin nân lei letin A rît phut kumkhua dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lei chu a han chûl rual a, Par di a han theh a, Zîra a chîng ta mai a ni lom ni? A tlarin huit a chîng a, A hmun tûrah barli a theh; Vau hrûlah mîm a chîng bawk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Pathianin an tih tûr a hrilh a, A zirtîr ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Talhtum lianin zîra an vaw lo va, Tawlailîrin pardi an chîl ngai bawk hek lo. Talhfiak hmangin zîra an vaw ṭil a, Hmawlhte nên pardi an khâwng bawk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A fang keh sawm khawpin huit chu an chîl lo va, Keh lo tâwka sakawr-tawlailîr chiltîr dân an thiam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hêng finna hi Engkim Lalpa pêk vek a ni, Pathian thil rêlte chu a fing êm êm a, A puitling ngei ngei ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw, Jerusalem, Jerusalem, Pathian maichâm, Davida awmhmun khuarna khawpui! I va khawngaihthlâk êm! Kum hnih khat chu lo veiin, Kûtte lo hmang leh pawh ni ula.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tah chuan, Jerusalem chu ka rawn hual ang, Ṭapin an chiau vawng vawng ang, Khuaah thisen a luang ang a, ‘Pathian maichâm’ ang hian a sen hnuang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bei tûr chein ka hual tlat dâwn a che, I vêlin lei ka chhûng pâwng ang a, Palin ka theu hnan ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I tlu zangthal dêr ang a, Vaivutin a khuh ang che a, Aikaih thiamte an phun ser ser angin Vaivut aṭangin i phun se se chauh vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ram beitu, hnam dang rualte chu, Vaivut dip ang maiin an darh ang a, Mi râwng pui puite pawh thli len buhsi angin, Len bo an ni bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khawpui leh lîrnghîng nên, thâwm nasa tak, Thlipui leh ṭhâwngaleivir nên, Kan ral hmang mei alh hluah hluah nên chuan, Engkim Lalpa chu a lo thawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jerusalem beitu hnam dang sipai rualte, A kulh huala tihrehawmtute chu Zâna thil hmuh, mumang ang hian an ral duak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Rilṭâm takin mumang lamah chaw a lo ei a, A lo harh a, a puar si lo ang leh, Tuihâl takin mumang lamah tui a lo ina, A lo harh a, a tui a la hâl fo ang hi, Zion tlâng hualtu, hnam dang sipaite chu an la ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A ngaihna hre lovin hawihai ula, In mitte pawh tidel law law rawh u, Uain in si lovin rui hnêp ula, Rakzu tem si lovin pai pai rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpan mutchhuahna thliin a chhêmtîr che u a, Zâwlneite mit a tuamsak a, Hmutute lu a khuhsak ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nangni tân zawng hêng inlârna thute hi lehkhabu châr tlat chhûnga thu ang hi a ni. Lehkha chhiar thiam hnênah, ‘Han chhiar teh,’ tiin an pe a, anin, ‘Châr tlat a ni a, ka chhiar thei lo,’ a lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lehkha chhiar thiam lo hnênah, ‘Han chhiar hrâm teh,’ an tih lahin, ‘Lehkha ka chhiar thiam hlei nêm,’ a lo ti bawk si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “He mite hian an kâ chauhvin min hnaih ṭhîn a, An hmui chauhvin min chawimawi a, Thinlung tak erawh chuan min hlat si. Mihring thupêk bel taka vawn chauh hi, Min ṭih dân chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />He mite chungah hian rin loh tak thil, Thil mak danglam tak chu ka ti ang a, An mi fingte finna a bo vang a, An mi thiamte thiamna a reh tawh ang. ”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa laka an thil tih tum thuptute chu An va la chawh dâwn êm! A rûkin thil an ti emaw tiin “Tu nge hmu ang a, tu nge hria ang?” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A letling zâwngin thu an la a ni, Bellei hian a vawtu a tluk thei dâwn em ni? Thil siam hian a siamtu hnênah, “I siam ka ni lo ve,” a ti thei dâwn em ni? Thil din pawh chuan a dintu chu, “I va â êm!” a ti thei dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Rei lo tê-ah Lebanon ngaw chu lo ṭha a ni ang a, Lo ṭha pawh chu ngawah a chang thuai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chumi hun chuan bengngawngte chuan Lehkha Thu chhiar ri an hria ang a, Thim zînga awm mitdelte chu An mit a meng ang a, an hmu thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Retheite chu Lalpa -ah chuan an lâwm ang a, Pachhiate pawh Israel Mi Thianghlima hmaah an hlim bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi nunrâwngte an ral ang a, Pathian hmusittute an boral ang. Thil sual tih tum zawng zawng pawh tihbo an ni bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi dang mi suala puh chînga, Rorêltute rêl sualtîra, Thu lawilova mi dik tuartîrtute chu An ral vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Abrahama chhantu chuan Jakoba thlahte chungthu hetiang hian a sawi: Jakoba chu a mualpho tawh ngai lo vang a, A hmêl a dâng tawh ngai hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka pêk, an fate chu, an zînga awm an hmuh hun chuan, Ka hming an chawimawi tawh ang a, Jakoba Mi Thianghlima chu an zah ang a, Israel-te Pathian chu an ṭih bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thlarau lama bote chuan an hrethiam tawh ang a, Phunnawi chîngte pawhin an zir châk hle tawh ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa thuchhuak chuan heti hian a ti: “Hel hmang fate tak hi aw! Ka remruat loh angin thil an ti a, Ka thu lovin an inbe rem a, An sual chungah sual an belh ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Min râwn lovin Aigupta-ah an chhuk thla a, Farawa chu inhumhim nân phen an tum a, Aigupta hlim chu bêl tûrin an kal ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Farawa hum nih chu an zahna tûr a la ni ang a, Aigupta hlim an bêl chu an mualphona a la ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An hotute Zoan an thleng thla tawh, An palaiten Hannes an thleng ta e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An hnemhnânpui loh tûr hnam avâng chuan zah an la tuar ang. Ṭanpui thei lo, chhenfakawm lote avâng chuan Zakin an mualpho vang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chhim lam ramsa chungthu: Ram hrehawm leh hlauhawm Sakeibakneinu leh a pa chênna, Rûlngân leh rûl thlâwk thei tamna ramah An rote chu sabengtung an phurhtîr a, An sumte chu sanghâwngsei thlukvûmah an hlâng, Hnemhnânpui loh tûr hnam an pe dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aigupta chu eng mah a ni lo va, Ṭanpui theih rêng a nei lo va, Chuvângin, “Rulpui awm hle hle-i,” ka ti mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kal la, an hmuh ngeiah chûng chu ziakna phêkah ziak rawh: Kumkhuaa hriat reng tûrin lehkhabu-ah ziak lût ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hel chîng hnam an ni a, Fa dawthei tak an ni, Lalpa thupek ngaithla duh lo fa an nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hmutute hnênah, “Hmu vet teh suh u,” an ti a, Zâwlneite chu, “In hmuh ang thil dikte chu min hrilh suh u, Ngaihthlâk nuam min hrilh zâwk ula, Ngaihngam taka kan awm theihna tûrin bumna thu min hrilh zâwk rawh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Min kiansan ula, insaseng daih rawh u, Israel Mi Thianghlima thu hi sawi tei vet suh u,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuvângin, Israel Mi Thianghlima chuan heti hian a ti: “Ka thu in hnâwl a. Tharum thawha vervêk taka tih hi in thlang ta a, Rin chhan berah in neih tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />He thil sual hi in tih avângin Lungbang sâng tak, khi chat, chim ṭêp, Puar pup, chim phut tûr ang hi in ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Dîm hlek lova hlumbêl vuak keh, Meiling chawina khawpa lampei hlai tâwk, Tui thâlna pawh awm lo khawpa, Vuak sawm ang hi in ni ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa , Engkim Lalpa , Israel Mi Thianghlima chuan heti hian a ti: “Lo kîr ula, awm hle hle mai rawh u; Tichuan, chhandam in ni ang a, Thlaphâng lovin ring mai ula, Chu chu in chakna tûr a ni.” Mahse, in duh si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />‘Kan duh lo ve, sakawrah kan chuang ang,’ in ti vei a; Chuang tak ula, tlânchhe rawh u, ‘Sakawr tlân chak chungah kan chuang mai ang’ in ti vei maw? Chak zâwk daihin an ûm dâwn a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pakhat hrâwkah sâng rual in tlânchhia ang, Panga lakah phei chuan in vai tlân ang. Tlâng chhîp pâwng laia puanzâr in zâr te chu In tlânchhiatsan vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nimahsela, Lalpan a khawngaihin a la nghâk a che u, A ngilneihna a la târlang reng a ni. Lalpan dik takin ro a rêl ṭhîn, Amah nghâktute chu an nihlawh e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nangni, Zion tlânga mi, Jerusalem khuaa chêngte u, in ṭap leh tawh lo vang; ṭanpui dîla in au thâwm a hriat chuan a lainat ngei ang che u a, a chhâng ngei ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa chuan hrehawmna leh manganna tuartîr che u mah sela, in zirtîrtu chu a hla lo vang a, in hmuh phâk rengah a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ding lamah emaw, vei lamah emaw in pên dâwn chuan, “Hei hi kawng dik chu a ni, tah hian kal rawh u,” in hnungah a rawn ti zêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />In tangkarua tuam leh rangkachaka luan milem chherte chu bawlhhlawh in ti ang a, ‘tenawm’ tiin i paih darh ang a, “Daih mai a!” in la ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lova in thlai chi thlâk chu ruah a nantîr ang a, ṭha tak tak hlirin a rah tiar tuar ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chumi hun chuan in ran rualte chu hnimhring awm duainaah an tla ang a, bâwngpa leh sabengtung, leileta in chhawrte chuan buhpâwl then fai, chi al an tlân ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />In hmêlmate sâm an niha, an kulhte a chim zawh hun chuan tlâng sângah leh mual pâwnga tui luannaahte chuan tui a luang dur dur ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A mite vuakna hliam a tuamsak a, an pemte a tihdam hunah chuan thla chu ni tlukin a êng ang a, ni pawh a lêt sarihin, ni sarih chhûnga a êng tlukin a êng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hla tak aṭang pawhin a hmuh theih, en rû, Lalpa thiltihtheihna a lo lan saw, A thinur mei a khu chho ngun ngun a, Lungawi lovin a hnûr nasa mai. A thuchhuak chu meialh kan ral hmang ang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A thaw chhuak chu lui lian luang liam, Nghâwng thleng zawk ang mai hi a ni. Hnam tin thliarin a tichhia ang, An kâah chuan sakawr lakam a barh ang a, A hruai bo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nangni zawng, kût thianghlim hman tirh zân angin lâwmin in zai ang a; Israel-te lungpui, Lalpa tlâng pan, baja awih, An kal theuh theuh ang hian hlim takin in awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a aw ropui tak chu a chhuah ang a, a kutthlâk chu mi tinin an hmu ang. A thinur meialh chu kan ral hmang mei alh puat puat ang leh thlipui leh ruahpuivânâwn sûr leh rial tla dur dur angin a lo thleng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Asuri-hovin Lalpa aw an hriat chuan hlauvin an khûr ang a, a talhfiak chu an tuar ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Châwl lêk lova Lalpan a talhfiak a vaia Asuria a hlap apiangin a mite chuan benchhek leh perkhuangin an lo rem ang. Asuria chungah kut a thlâk dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Asuria lal rawhna tûr meipui nasa tak chu chheh thûr a ni daih tawh a, thing tam tak an rawlh bawk; A tikâng tûrin Lalpa chuan lui anga luang kât alh a thaw chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ṭanpuina dîl tûra Aigupta ram pan thla, Sakawr chakna ringtute tak hi aw! Sakawr-tawlailîr an ngah a, An sakawr chungchuangte âwm a khauh avângin an ring a ni. Israel Mi Thianghlima lam an hawi duh lo va, Lalpa lah an râwn duh hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ani chuan rem a hria a, thil ṭha lo pawh thlentîr a thiam, A thu a sût dâwn lo. Thil sual titute chungah chuan a che ang a, Anmahni ṭanpuitute chungah a che bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aigupta mite hi zawng mihring mai an ni, Pathian an ni lo ve. An sakawrte pawh sa mai an ni, Thlarau an ni lo ve. Lalpan a kut a lek hun chuan, Ṭanpuitu chu a pai ang a, A ṭanpuia pawh chu a tlu bawk ang, An pahnihin an ral dûn ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpan ka hnênah heti hian a ti: Sakeibaknei sa hauh ngur chu, Berâmpu rual pung khâwm au ri leh thâwm chuan A tizâm miah lo va, a pawisa hlek lo ang hian, Engkim Lalpa , Zion tlânga lo chhuk chuan A tlângte chu a rawn hauh vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Savate chu an bu vênga an thlâwk ang hian, Engkim Lalpan Jerusalem khua chu a vêng ang a, A vêng himin a chhan tlat ang; a zuah ang a, a chhan him ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aw Israel mite u, a lakah in hel ruh hle na a, Hawi kîr leh rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chumi hun chuan tu pawhin an sual phah ṭhin, Tangkarua leh rangkachak milem, An kutchhuakte chu, an paih ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Asuria chu mihring khandaih lovin sah thlûk a ni ang a, Mihring lek loh khandaihin a boral ang. Tlânchhe mah se, tlangvâlte chu salah an man tho vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thlaphâng takin an lal a thi ang a, Bak lêngin sipai hotute chuan an puanzâr an tlânsan ang. Lalpa thuchhuak chuan heti hian a ti: “Zion tlângah a mei a alh reng a, Jerusalem khuaah a thuk pawh a nung reng e.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngai teh, lal dik pakhat alo lal dâwn, A upate pawhin dik takin ro an rêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thlipui laka bihrûkna tûr, Ruahpui laka phen tûr an ni ang a, Ram rova lui luang leh thlalêra lungpui hlim ang hi an ni bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngun takin thil an thlîr ang a, Ngun takin an beng an dawh zêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hmanhmawha rêl lovin engkim an chîk ang a, Ṭawng ban lovin an thu a fiah bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi sual chuan tu ma zah an kai lo vang a, Mi duhâm chuan ngaihsân a hlawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi sualte ṭawng a tlahawlh a, Thil sual tih tûr an suangtuah ṭhîn. Pathian elsên an chîng ṭhîn a, Lalpa thu pawh an la lek ṭhîn. Rilṭâmte tlaina tûr an ngaihthah a, Tuihâlte in tûr tui an leihbuaksak bawk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Duhâmte duhâmzia a va thûk êm! Thil sual tih hi an tum rân a, Dâwta retheite tihchhiata, Pachhiate pawh dik mah sela tihchhiat an tum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi ṭhate erawh chuan thil ṭha an suangtuah a, Chu chu an ṭan zui ngam zêl ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nuho, awm der der ṭhînte u, Tho ula, ka thu hi ngaithla rawh u. Nangni, nula, lungmuanga tâlte u, Ka sawi hi bengkhawn teh u:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kum khat emaw a ral hnu chuan Lungmuanga tâlte u in la khûr ang. Grep rah hleh tûr a awm dâwn lo, Theirah lawh tûr a awm hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Awm der der ṭhînte u, hlau hle rawh u, Lungmuanga tâlte u, khûr bawk rawh u. Inhlîp ula, saruakin awm ula, In kâwngah khân saiip puan fêng rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />In huan duhawm, thlai ṭhat duhna, A chhiat tâk avângin âwm chûmin ṭap rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka mite lo ram chu, hlohar leh hnimhlîngneiin a bawh zo ta. Khawpui nuam tak leh hlim taka an chênna inte A chhiat tâk avângin ṭap chiam rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lal in an rauhsan a, Khaw lûn tak ṭhîn chu a ram ta e. A mualte leh vênbûk in sângte chu Ram sabengtungte tualchaina a ni ang a, Ranrual an tla bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chung lam ata Thlarau kan chunga a rawn leih hunah chuan, Thlalêr ram ro chu ram ṭhaah a chang ang a, Theikung a ngaw khup ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thlalêr ni ṭhînah chuan dik takin ro an rêl ang a, Ram ṭhaah chuan dik takin thil an ti bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Dik taka thil an tih ṭhin avângin Râlmuang takin an khawsa ang a, Lungmuang takin an awm kumkhua bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />An in leh lovah ka mite chu Thlamuang takin chênna rinawm leh muanawmah chuan An awm der der tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chutih hunah chuan ngaw chu a dai ruai ang a, Khawpui pawh chu hmun zâwl duaiah a innghat ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tui hnianghnârnaa thlai chîng ṭhîna, Bâwng leh sabengtungte thlah ṭhînte u, In nihlawh e.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Rawk tâwk ngai lo, mi dang rawk ṭhînte tak hi aw! Bum tâwk ngai lo mi dang bum ṭhînte hian, In rawk zawhah rawk in tuar ang a, In bum hnuah bum in tâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa , kan chungah zahngai la, kan thlîr reng a che, Tûk tin kan bân thapui ni la, Mangan ni-ah min chhanhim bawk ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I thâwmah chuan mite an tlânchhia a, I lo chêt chuan hnam dangte an darh ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khau puang angin râl sumte chu an chuh a, Chhar khâwm tûrin an vâk sup sup mai e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chung lamah khian Lalpa chu a awm a, A va ropui êm! Zion-ah dik tak leh fel takin ro a rêl e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />In hun vawngtu a ni, A mite chu a hum tlat a, Finna leh hriatna pawh a pe. Lalpa ṭih hi an ro hlu ber a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />En teh, an pasalṭhate chu pâwnah an au vêl ruai a, Remna zawnga palaite chu an ṭap zawih zawih mai e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lamlian a reh ṭhuap a, Kawnga kal ngam rêng an awm lo. Thuthlung an bawhchhia a, Inremna thu an pawisa lo va, Tu mah an zah hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ram chu a chul ta a, a ram reng mai, Lebanon ngaw a ngui zo ta. Saron phai chu thlalêr ang mai a ni, Basan leh Karmel tlâng thinghnahte chu a ṭîl zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Ka han che tawh teh ang, ka inchawisâng ang a, Ka ropuizia ka târlang tawh dâwn e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thil sâwt lo in suangtuah a, Eng mah in phuh chhuak si lo va, In thuchhuak chu mei ang a ni. A kâng ral vek dâwn a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chinai lung rawh a darh ang leh Hlîngbuk sâm chu a kâng vâp mai ang hian in ral vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hla taka awmte u, ka thil tih hi hre vek ula, Hnai deuhva awmte u, ka ropuizia lo hre rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zion-a chêng, mi sualte chuan an hlau vang a, Sakhaw ngaihsak lote chu an khûr bawk ang. ‘Kan zînga tu hian nge a thinur mei tuar zo vang? Kumkhuaa alh reng hi tu nge tuar peih awm i?’ an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Dik taka thil tia, thu ṭha sawi ṭhîn, Hlêpna bawlhhlawh chu duh lova, Thamna hûm hlauva kut thing ṭhîn; Thisen chhuah rawt bengkhawn duh lo, Thil sual tih rawtnaa tel ve duh lo mi chu
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hmunsâng takah a chêng ang a, Kulhbîng chhûnga awmte angin a him bawk ang, Ei tûr ngahin tui in tûr pawh a tlachham lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />In mit ngeiin lal ropui tak, Ram zau tak chunga ro a rêl in hmu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />In râlṭit lai nite kha in hre chhuak ang a, ‘Hming lamtu kha khaw nge a awm tâk le, Chhiah lo dawnga, in zât chhiartu pawh kha?’ In la ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi kawlhsen tak, thle lâwr lâwr, Ṭawng thûm hlêt hlût leh ṭawng berek chîl chêl, An sawi in hriat hleih theih si lohte kha In hmu leh tawh lo vang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kût kan hmanna tûr Zion khua hi thlîr ve teh u, Jerusalem khua hi en teh mah u, Puan in nuam tak, zâwn sawn ngai lo, A khennghehna phawng ngai lova, A kaihmarna chat ngai hauh lo ang hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tah chuan, Lalpan a ropuina min entîr ang, Lui tamna ram, tui kawng zau tak bulah kan chêng ang a, Hmêlmaten lawng an rawn kar lût thei lo vang a, Lawng lian a lo lût thei hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalpa chu ro min rêlsaktu a ni, Lalpa chu kan hotu a ni a, Lalpa chu kan lal a ni, Aman min hum tlat ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />An lawng puanzâr kaihna hruite a dûk ta a, A ngul an thlung nghet thei ta lo, Puanzârte pawh an kai pharh thei lo va, An sum zawng zawng kan man ang a, A tam êm a, kebaite hial pawhin an chuh hman ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Khaw chhûnga awmte chuan, “Ka dam lo ve,” an ti ngai lo vang a, An sualte chu ngaihdam a ni bawk ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hnam tinrêngte lo hnai ula, Ngaithla tûrin lo kal rawh u. Lei leh a chhûnga awmte u, lo haw ula, In zavaiin ngaithla rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hnam tin chungah Lalpa a thinur a, An sipai rual chungah a thin a rim a ni. Thah vek atân a dah tawh e, Talh mai tûrin a hlân vek tawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An ruangte chu paih tûr a ni, Phûm tûr a ni lo ve, A uih vut vut ang a, Tlângah an thisen chu a luang zeih zuih bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vâna awmte pawh khi an ral ang a, Lehkha angin vân khi zial bo a ni ang a, Vâna awm zawng zawng khi an tla ang a, Grep leh theipui hnah ro a ṭîl ang hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vânah ka khandaih chu a inpeih ta, Thah atâna dah tawh Edom mite chungah a chhuk thla ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An thisenin Lalpa khandaih chu a bual ang a, An thau a kai luai ang. Berâm leh kêl thisente, Kêlpa kal thautea inthawi angin Bozra khuaah Lalpa a inthawi dâwn, Edom mite a talh ṭeuh vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chumi rual chuan selête pawh a that ang a, Bâwngtuaite leh a chalte pawh a talh bawk ang. An ram chu thisenin a bual ang a, Vaivutte pawh thauvin a pawlh vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpan phuba a lâk a hun ta a, Zion tâna a thungrulh hun a lo ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Edom ram luite chu alkatra-ah a chang ang a, Vaivutte pawh kâtah a chang bawk ang. A ram pum chu alkatra ang maiin a kâng ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chhûn zân zawmin an timit lo vang a, A khu ngun ngun reng ang. Ṭhangthar zêl thlengin a ram ang a, Tu mah tlawh duh an awm lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuivalawng leh sakuh an awm ang a, Chhimbuk leh choâkte an chêng ang. Leilung siam hma ang khân Lalpan a tichhe rem rum ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lala ṭang duh an awm lo vang a, Hotu tûr pawh an awm hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lal inte chu hlîng bawnin a khuh ang a, Kulh chhûngah pawh kângṭhai leh hlohar a tla khat ang. Sihal chênna a ni ang a, Chingpirinu bukhuarna hmun a ni bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sanghar leh chinghnia an insûl reng ang a, Sathâr chuan a ṭhian a ko bawk ang. Tah chuan ṭaunu a lût ang a, Hahchawlhna tûr a hmu ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Rûl thlâwk thei chuan bu a nei ang a, A tui ang a, a awp keu ang a, A note chu a awp lum ang. Mulukawlhte pawh an kawppuite nên Tah chuan an awm ho vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa lehkhabu-ah zawng la, chhiar teh, Pakhat tê mah an bo lo vang, Kawppui an nei ṭheuh zêl a ni. Lalpa chuan thu a pe tawh a, A Thlarau chuan a hruai khâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />An tân ṭhum a vâwr fel tawh a, Ram chin siamin an awmna tûr a pe vek tawh, Chu chu an hmun kumkhua tûr chu a ni, An thlahte pawhin an nei zêl ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thlalêr leh ramro chu a lâwm ang a, Ram kawlh vel vul chu hlimin a pâr vul ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Phûl pangpârte angin a pâr chhuak ang a, Hlim takin a zai ang. Lebanon tlâng angin a ropui ve ang a, Karmel tlâng leh Saron phai ang maiin a duah hluah ang. Lalpa ropuina chu an hmu ngei ang, Kan Pathian mawina nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bân chau tawhte chu tichak ula, Khûp khûr tawhte pawh tichak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Rilru mangangte hnênah chuan, “Kan Pathian chuan phuba a rawn la dâwn, Intipachang ula, hlau hauh suh u, A rawn thungrûl ang a, A chhandam ngei ang che u,” ti ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mitdel mit chu a meng ang a, Bengngawng beng chu a vâr bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kebaite pawh sakhi angin an zuang theuh theuh ang a, Ṭawngtheilo pawh hlimin an zai tawh ang. Thlalêrah tui a chik chhuak ang a, Ram rovah pawh lui a luang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ram ṭau lum huam huamah dîl a awm ang a, Ram chârah chuan tuihna a irh chhuak ang. Sihal tamna, a tuallênna ramah Phairuang leh hnim a awm dul ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tah chuan lamlian a awm ruah ang a, “Kawng Thianghlim,” an ti ang a, Mi bawlhhlawhte an kal ve lo vang, Hei hi a ni an kalna tûr kawng chu. A kal apiang, mi â-te pawh, an bo lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tah chuan sakeibaknei a awm lo va, Ram sakawlh pawh a lo kal lo vang a, Hmuh tûr a awm hek lo vang, Tlan chhuahte kalna tûr kawng a ni si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa tlante an lo kîr leh ang a, Zaiin Zion an pan ang a, Chatuan lâwmna an khum bawk ang; Hlim leh lâwmin an khat ang a, Lungngaih leh ṭah a awm tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hezekia kum sâwm leh pali a lal kumin, Asuria lal Senakeriban Judai rama khua, kulh nei zawng zawng a rûn a, a la ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Asuria lal chuan Lakis khua aṭangin Jerusalem lal Hezekia hnênah, sipai tam tak nên, Rabsakeha a tîr a; dîl chhakta zâwk aṭanga tuikawng bul, puansu mite hmuna lamlianah chuan a ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lal chhûngkaw enkawltu, Hilkia fapa Eliakima te, ziaktu Sebna te, chanchin vawngtu Asapa fapa Joa te an va chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Rabsakeha chuan an hnênah, “Hezekia han hrilh teh u; lal ropui, Asuria lal chuan heti hian a ti. ‘Eng nge rinchhan i neiha i inchhutngên hle le!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka ti a che, hmui themthiam ngawt hian râlthuam leh sipai chakna a lân thei hlei nêm. Tu nge i rinchhan veia, ka laka i hel tâk?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />He luang tiang sâwp, a hawltu kut chhun nghawt tûr, Aigupta hi i ring a ni maw? Aigupta lal Farawa chu a ringtute tân tiang sâwp ang lek hi a ni asin!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa kan Pathian a ni kan rin, i ti em ni? A biakna hmunsâng leh maichâmte Hezekian a duh duhin a sawnsak mai mai a, Jerusalem leh Judai ram mite hnênah, ‘He maichâmah chauh hian Ani chu in be tûr a ni,’ a tih Pathian kha maw in la rin cheu?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka pu, Asuria lal hnênah thu tiam mai teh, tûnah pawh hian keiin, a chuang tûr mi i hmuh zawh phawt chuan, sakawr sânghnih ka pe mai ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aigupta sakawr-tawlailîr leh sakawra innghat i nih chuan engtin nge ka pu sipaite zînga nêp ber pawh i dan zawh ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />He ram tichhe tûrin Lalpa thu lova lo thawk ka nih i ring em ni? Lalpa chuan he ram hi han beia tichhe vek tûrin min ti asin,’ tiin hrilh rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Eliakima te, Sebna te, Joa te chuan Rabsakeha hnênah, “Khawngaih takin Aramaik ṭawngin i chhiahhlawhte hnênah hian thu sawi teh, kan hre ve reng alâwm. Kulh bula awmte hriat phâkah Juda ṭawngin thu sawi suh, an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Rabsakeha erawh chuan, “Ka pu hian hêng thu hi in lal leh nangni hnênah chauh sawi tûrin min tîr hlei nêm. Nangni ang bawka mahni êk eia, mahni zun in tûr kulh bang bula awmte hriat atân sawi tûrin min tîr asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Rabsakeha chu a ding a, Judai ṭawngin ring takin a au va, “Lal ropui, Asuria lal thu hi, ngaithla teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lal chuan heti hian a ti: Hezekia hian bum che u suh se, a hum thei dâwn tawp lo a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />‘ Lalpa chuan min rawn chhan ngei ngei dâwn, Asuria lalin khua hi a rawn la tawp lo vang,’ tiin Hezekia chuan in Lalpa hi ring tûrin a fuih che u pawhin ring suh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hezekia thu hi ngaithla suh u. Asuria lal chuan heti hian a ti:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />‘Lo chhuak ula, inrem ang u; mi tinin mahni grep in ei ṭheuh vang a, mahni theipui in tlân ang a, mahni tuizêma mi tui in in ṭheuh ang. Ka lo kal ang a, in ram ang chiaha ram ṭha, buh leh uain tamna ram, buh hmun leh grep hmun ṭha ramah ka hruai ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpan min chhan ngei ang, tiin Hezekia hian bum che u suh se. Hnam dangte hi thlîr teh u; an pathianten Asuria lakah an chhan thei em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hamath leh Arpad pathiante chu khawiah nge an awm tâk? Sefarvaim pathian pawh khawiah nge a awm tâk? Samaria khua pawh ka lakah a hum thei em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chûng pathiante chuan hêng ramte hi an hum theih si loh chuan Lalpa in tih pawh hian ka lakah Jerusalem khua hi a hum tehchai ang maw?’ a ti,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lalin engtin mah chhâng suh u a tih avângin an ngawi reng a, eng mahin an chhâng lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tichuan, lal chhûngkaw enkawltu Eliakima, Hilkia fapa te, ziaktu Sebna te, chanchin vawngtu Asapa fapa Joa te chu puan thlêr sinin Hezekia hnênah an kal a, Rabsakeha thu chu an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lal Hezekian chûng thu chu a hriatin a puan a pawt thlêr a, saiip puan a sin a, Lalpa inah a lût ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lal chhûngkaw enkawltu Eliakima te, Ziaktu Sebna te leh puithiam zînga upa te chu saiip puan sinin Amoza fapa zâwlnei Isaia hnênah a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Lal Hezekian heti hian a ti: ‘Vawiin hian kan tân manganna ni a lo thleng ta, min hmuhsita, min diriam tak êm hi! Nau hrin hun tawh, a nu chau lutuk si ang mai kan nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian nung sâwt tûra Asuria lal mi tirh, Rabsakeha thu sawi kha Lalpa i Pathian chuan a lo hre châwk ang a. Lalpa , i Pathian chuan hriain hrem teh se. Kan mi, la dam chhunte tân nang ṭawngṭai rawh khai,’ a ti e,” an va ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lal Hezekia mi tirhte chu Isaia hnên an va thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Isaia chuan an hnênah, “ Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Asuria lal chhiahhlawhten min diriam dân thu i hriatte kha hlau suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngai teh, zâmna rilru ka pe ang a, thuthang ka hriattîr ang; a ramah a kîr ang a, a ram ngeiah khandaihin an sât hlum ang,’ tiin in pu hnênah va sawi rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Rabsakeha chu a ṭin a, Lakis aṭangin Asuria lal chu a insawn a, Libna khua a bei tih a hriatin chu lam chu a pan a, a va hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ethiopia lal Tirhaka chanchin chu Asuria lal an hrilh a, amah bei tûrin a lo thawk tih a hriatin Hezekia hnênah palai a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Judai ram lal Hezekia hnênah, ‘I rinchhan in Pathian chuan Asuria kutah Jerusalem chu a pe lo vang,’ tiin bum che u suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Asuria lalten an ram luah zawng zawnga an thil tih, an ram an tihchhiatsak vek thute i hria a. Nang tehlul hi i him bîk dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />‘Ka paten an tihchhiat hnam Gozan te, Haran te, Rezep te, Telesar-a awm Eden-ho te kha an pathianten an chhan thei em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khawiah nge Hamath lal te, Arpad lal te, Sefarvaim-a khaw awm lal te, Hena lal te, Iva lal te kha an awm tâk?’ zu ti rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Palai lehkha rawn ken chu Hezekia chuan a hmuhin a han chhiar a, Lalpa inah a chho va, Hezekia chuan lehkha chu Lalpa hmaah a pharh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hezekia chu Lalpa hnênah a ṭawngṭai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Engkim Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian, Cherub chunga ṭhu, nang chauh hi Pathian chu i ni, ram luah zawng zawng rorêltu i ni si a, lei leh vân pawh hi i siam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i beng lo chhi la, ngaithla teh: Lalpa , meng la, en teh; Pathian nung sâwt tûra Senakeriban thu a rawn sawi zawng zawng hi ngaithla teh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , Asuria lalte hian hnam tin an bei a, an ramte an tihchhiat tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />An pathiante meiah an rawhsak a, chûng chu Pathian an ni lo rêng a, mihring kuta siam thing leh lung mai an ni a; chuvângin, chhe ngei tûr phei zawng an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa , tûnah a kut aṭang hian min chhan chhuak la; tichuan, khawvêl ram luah zawng zawnga miten nang chauh hi Lalpa chu i ni tih an hre dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amoza fapa Isaia chuan Hezekia hnênah mi a tîr a: “A hnêna i ṭawngṭaina chungchâng leh Asuria lal Senakeriba chungthu-ah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian thu sawi chu hei hi a ni: Zion fanuin a hmusit che a, a nuihzat che, Jerusalem fanu chuan i tlânchhia chu lu a thin khum che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tu nge i nuihzata, i sâwt vei le? Tu lakah nge i râwl i rin? Tu lakah nge i hawi chapo hle le? Israel Mi Thianghlima chungah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />I chhiahhlawhte hmangin Lalpa i sâwt vei a, ‘Tawlailîr tam tak nên tlâng sâng sângah ka lâwn a, Lebanon tlâng kil tin ka fang, Sidar thing sâng sâng ka kit a, Fâr thing ṭha ṭha ka kit asin; A tlâng sâng lai ngaw rilte pawh ka fang vek a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuite ka chhun chhuak a, ka in bawk a, Aigupta luite chu ka kephahin ka dai kang vek a ni,’ i ti vei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hmân aṭanga tih ka tum tawh a ni, I hre na nge? Tûna thil lo thleng hi, Hmâna ka rêl daih tawh a ni. Kulh nei khuate i tihchhiata,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A chhûnga chêng an zâmte leh Thlabâr taka an mualpho te, Phûl leh muala hlobet, In chung zâwla hnim ṭiak tîr te, Thli lum chhêm vuai tâk te, Ka rêl lâwk vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka chunga i ânhla te, I ṭhut, i luh leh chhuahte ka hria asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka chungah hian i âng vei a, I chapozia ka beng a lo thleng ta, I hnârah chuan hnâr kawl ka vuah ang a, Lakam ka barh ang che a, I lo kalna lamah ka hnûk kîr leh ang che.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Lal Hezekia hnênah, “Hei hi i tân chhinchhiahna tûr a ni ang: Kuminah hian buh hli in ring ang a, nakkumah pawh chumi hli chu in ring leh ang. A kum thumnaah chuan thlai chîng ula, a rah in seng dâwn nia. Huanah grep phun ula, a rah in ei bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Judai rama mi la damte chu thei kûng, thûk taka zung thlâk, rah tup ang hi an la ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jerusalem aṭangin dam chhuak tûr an awm a, Zion tlângah thi bâng an awm ngei dâwn a ni. Engkim Lalpa ṭhahnemngaihna chuan chûng chu a tipuitling ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chuvângin, Asuria lal chungchâng Lalpan heti hian a ti: “He khawpuiah hian a lo lût lo vang a, thal khat pawh a thlah lo vang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />phaw nên a rawn bei lo vang a, lei kulh a lai hek lo vang, Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />He khua hi keimah avâng leh Davida vângin ka hum ang a, ka chhanhim dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Lalpa tirh Vântirhkoh chu Asuria-ho bûkah chuan a kal a, mi nuaikhat leh sîngriat leh sângnga a that a, zînga an han thawh chuan mitthi ruang hlîr a lo thal phung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Asuria lal Senakeriba chu a ṭin a, a haw a, Ninevi khuaah a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />An pathian Nisroka ina pathian biaa a kûn lai chu a fa Adrammeleka leh Sarezera chuan khandaihin an sât hlum a, Ararat ramah an tlân ta a. A fapa Esarhadona chu a lo lal ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chûng lai chuan lal Hezekia chu thih ngamin a na a, Amoza fapa Isaian a rawn tlawh a, a hnênah, “ Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: I chhûngkaw thu rêl fel rawh, i thi dâwn si a, i dam chhuak dâwn lo ve,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hezekia chuan bang lam a hawi a, Lalpa hnênah a ṭawngṭai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Aw Lalpa , i hmaah dik takin ka awm ṭhîn a, thinlung thianghlim puin i mit hmuha thil ṭha ka tih ṭhin kha, khawngaih takin hre reng ang che,” a ti a, a ṭap ta zawih zawih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Isaia a rawn bia a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Tho la, Hezekia va hrilh rawh. Lalpa , i pu Davida Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: I ṭawngṭai ka lo hria a, i mittui pawh ka lo hmu e. Ngai teh, kum sâwm leh kum nga ka damtîr leh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Asuria lal lakah nang leh he khua hi ka chhan ang a, khawpui hi ka hum tlat ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“ Lalpan a thu sawi hi a ti ngei dâwn tih Lalpa hnên aṭanga i tân chhinchhiahna tûr chu hei hi a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Lal Ahaza dâr chin tehna hlim saw rahka sâwmin ka kîrtîr ang,” a ti a. Chutichuan, ni hlim chu rahka sâwm a kîr leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Judai ram lal Hezekia damlo, dam leh ta chuan heti hian a ziak:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tarkûna dam lovin mitthi khuaah Ka vânglai hian ka liam dâwn ta emaw ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi nung ramah Lalpa hmu tawh lovin Khawvêla chêngte hi hmuh leh ka beisei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Berâmpute puan in an ṭhiat ang hian Ka chênna in min ṭhiatsak a. Puan bu tah zawh an hlep ang hian, Ka nunna hi min hlehsak a, Tûk tin zân tin ka chau mai dâwn emaw ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kâwl ên thlengin ṭanpui dîlin ka au ṭhîn a, Ka ruhte chu sakeibaknei seh tliah ang hi a ni, Tûk tin zan tin ka chau mai dâwn emaw ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Vamûr angin ka chiar ka chiar ṭhîn a, Ṭhuro angin ka rûm ka rûm bawk ṭhîn. Chung lam thlîr nân ka mit a vai zo ta. Lalpa , hnehchhiaha ka awm hi, a bul han tum rawh le.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Eng nge ka sawi tâk ang? Min hrilh angin i rawn ti ta ngei a, Ka tuarna avâng hian ka dam chhûngin ka kal dêm dêm tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa , i tân ka nung ang a, Nangma tân chauh ka nung tawh ang. Min tichak la, min tidam leh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka tuarna kha ka ṭhatna tûr a lo ni e, Min lainat a, chhiatna khur ata chu min la chhuak a, Ka sual zawng zawng i ngaidam ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mitthi khua aṭangin lâwmthu an sawi thei lo, Thi tawhte chuan an fak thei hek lo che, Leilâwta tlate chuan an ring pha tawh lo che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nungdama awmte chauh hian a ni nangmah fak che, Keiin tûna ka fak ang bawk che hian, Pate chuan i thutak chu an fate an zirtîr ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpan min tidam ta, Ṭingṭang tumin fak hla ka sa ang a, Ka dam chhûng zawng Lalpa inah Amah fak hla ka sa tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />(Isaian, “Theipui rah hmehhlâwm la ula, a khawihliah bel rawh u, a dam mai ang,” a tih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hezekia pawhin, “ Lalpa inah ka chho thei dâwn tih chhinchhiahna eng nge ni ang?” a lo ti tawh a.)
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan Baladana fapa Merodak-baladana, Babulon lal chuan Hezekia damlo a dam leh tih a hriatin thilpêk leh lehkha a rawn thawn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An chungah chuan Hezekia chu a lâwm hle a; tichuan, a sum dahna in a entîr a, tangkarua te, rangkachak te, mosola te, hriak man tam te, a râlthuam dahna ina râlthuam te, a sum dahna ina thil awm zawng zawng chu a entîr vek a. Hezekia chuan ama in leh a ram chhûnga a thil neih zawng zawng chu entîr loh a nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zâwlnei Isaia chu Hezekia hnênah a lo kal a, “Khâng mite khân eng nge an rawn tih dâwn? Khawi lam aṭanga lo kal nge an nih?” a ti a. Hezekia chuan, “Ram hla tak aṭanga lo kal an ni, Babulon khua aṭangin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“I in chhûnga mi engte nge an hmuh?” a ti a. Hezekia chuan, “Ka ina thil awm zawng zawng ka entîr vek a, ka sum dahna ina mi entîr loh eng mah ka nei lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Isaia chuan Hezekia hnênah, “Engkim Lalpa thu hi ngaithla teh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngai teh, i ina thil awm zawng zawng, i paten vawiin thlenga an dah khâwm nên, Babulon-a an lâk vek hun a lo thleng dâwn, eng mah hnutchhiah an nei lo vang, Lalpan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangma hrin ngei, i fapate zînga ṭhenkhat an man ang a, an til an rehsak ang a, Babulon lal inah an awm ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hezekia chuan a dam chhûngin râlmuang leh him takin an awm dâwn tihna niin a ngai a, Isaia hnênah, “ Lalpa thu i sawi chu a ṭha e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ka mite hi thlamuan rawh u, thlamuan rawh u,” In Pathianin a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem hnênah thlamuanna thu hril thuai rawh u, An tuar tûr chu an tlâk ta a, Hrem an tuar hi a tâwk ta e, Lalpa kut pawh an sual lêt hnih an tuar tawh e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw chuan, “Thlalêrah Lalpa kawng buatsaih ula, Kan Pathian tân ram rova lamlian tirual rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A ruam apiang chhûng khat ula, Tlâng leh mualte râwt hniam rawh u, A kawi laite tingîl ula, A bumbohte tirual rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa ropuina chu a lang dâwn e, Mi zawng zawngin an hmu vek ang,” Lalpa ngei chuan a ti asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aw chuan, “Au rawh,” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Eng nge ka sawi tâk ang?” a ti a. “Mihringte hi hnimhring ang an ni a, An ropuina pawh phûl pangpâr ang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa thli chu a lo tleh a, Hnim hring a chhêm vuai a, Pangpâr a tichuai ṭhîn, A ni, mihringte hi hnimhring ang chauh an ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hnimhring a ro ṭhîn a, Pangpâr a chuai bawk ṭhîn, Kan Pathian thu hi zawng a awm kumkhua dâwn si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tlâng sângahte lâwn chho zêl la, Zion hnênah thu lâwmawm chu aw ring takin puang rawh, Jerusalem hnênah thu lâwmawm chu puang rawh, tîm suh, Judai ram khawpuite chu hrilh la, ‘In Pathian chu a lo kal ta,’ ti rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />En teh, Lalpa Pathian chu mi chak angin a lo kal a, A bân tha chak hmangin ro a rêl dâwn, A chhan chhuahte a rawn hruai a, A tlan chhuahte a rawn chhawm e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Berâm vêngtu angin berâm rual chu a châwm ang a, A note chu la khâwma pawm chungin A puite chu a hruai dial dial dâwn e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tu nge vei khat lekin tuifinriat teh sêng ang? Tu nge vân khi khâp chhuak thei le? Tu nge leia vaivut hi khova teh sêng awm ang? Tlâng leh mualte tu nge bûk thei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa Thlarau chu tu nge thu neihsak anga, Tu nge remruatsakin kaihruai thei ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A bengvâr nân tu nge a râwn ṭhina, Tu nge kawng dik entîr thei le? Tu nge hriat tûr zirtîr theia, Thil tih dân tûr kawhhmuh thei ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa tân chuan hnam zawng zawng hi, Bâlṭin mawnga tui far khat ang, Bûkthlênga vaivut kai ang lek hi an ni; Thliarkârte pawh lungtê anga, Vawrh derh derh tham lek chauh an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lebanon tlâng ngâwa ramsate chu Lalpa hnêna inthawi nân chuan a tâwk lo va, Thing awmte lah tuah tham a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hnam zawng zawng hi a tân eng tham an ni lo va, Engmahlo mai maiah a ngai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pathian chu tu nên nge in khaikhin ang? Engte nên nge in tehkhin ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thil chher thiamin milem a han chher a, Thil chhûn thiamin rangkachakin a han luan a, Tangkaruain khaidiat awrh tûr a chhersak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chutiang nei zo lo chuan thingtum ngêt lo a thlang chhuak a, Tlu lo tûrin thing tuk thiam chu a tuktîr ṭhîn, Chutiang milem nên maw min tehkhin ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />In hre na nge? In ngaithla lo vem ni? A tîr ata an hrilh lo che u em ni? Leilung innghah dân hi in hre lo maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ani hi zawng kâwlkil hual chung daihah a awm a, A chhûnga awmte chu a tân khauphâr ang lek an ni. Puanzâr angin vân khi a zâr pharh a, Awmna tûr puanin an zâr ang hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lal ropuite a titlâwm a, Leia rorêltute engmahlovah a chantîr a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thing phun lo chawr ṭan tîr, Thlai ṭiak zung thlâk ṭan chauh ang hi an ni. Thliin a rawn chhêm a, a vuai ta a, Thlipui a lo thawk a, Buhpâwl angin a la bo ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tichuan, tu nên hian nge min tehkhin ang a, Tu ang lek nge ka nih? Mi Thianghliman a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Vân lamah khian in mit lên chho ula, In hmuhte khi tu siam nge ni? Sipai rual ang maia hruai chhuak ṭhîntu, An hming chhiara ko ṭheuh theitu siam vek a ni; Thil a ti thei êm a, pakhat tê mah an bo ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Israel thlahte u, engtizia nge ‘ Lalpan kan awm dân hi a hmu lo va, Kan Pathian hian min ngaihthah ta,’ in tih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />In hre na nge? Lalpa chauh hi chatuan Pathian chu a ni a, Kâwlkil hual chhûnga awm zawng zawng hi Ama siam vek a ni. A chau lo va, a hah ngai bawk hek lo. A finzia pawh tu mah hre phâk an awm loh hi, In hre ngai lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hahte a tichak a, Chaute a tichak thar leh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tleirâwlte pawh dangchârin an chau va, Tlangvâlte pawh hahin an thal dêr ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Lalpa nghâktute erawh chu An chak thar leh ang a, Mupui angin thlain an thlâwk chho vang, An tlân ang a, an chau lo vang, An kal ang a, an hah hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thliarkârte u, lo ngaithla rawh u. In mite chu inpeih rawh se; Lo kal ula, sawi ve rawh u, I lo rêl tlâng teh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A kalna lam apianga chak zêl, Khawchhak ata ko chhuaktu hi tu nge? Lalte, hnamte a hneh zêl a, Khandaihin vaivutah a chantîr a, Thliin buhsî a lên darh ṭhîn ang hian a thal hmangin a ûm darh zêl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A ûm zêl a, hliam tuar ve hauh lovin a tlang zêl a, Lei rap hman lo hialin a chak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hêng hi tu nge a tîr ata rêla, Ṭhang lo thar zêl chunga thlentîrtu hi? Kei Lalpa hi, a bul tumtu ka ni, A tâwpna tûr pawh keimah bawk ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thliarkârte chuan ka thil tih an hmuhin an hlau vang, Kâwlkila awmte chu hlauvin an khûr bawk ang. An pung khâwm a, an lo kal e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mahni ṭhian hnaite chu an fuih ṭheuh va, Mahni unaute pawh, ‘Hlau suh,’ an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thil chher mi chuan rangkachak chhûng mi chu a tiphûr a, An milem siam dêng mâmtu chuan, ‘A bet ṭha e,’ tiin a dêngtu chu a fuih bawk a. A nghîn loh nân thîrkilhnain an kilh tlat mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw Israel, nang zawng ka chhiahhlawh i ni a, Aw Jakob, ka thlan i ni, Ka ṭhian Abrahama hrin i ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kâwlkil ata ka lâk chhuah i ni a, A kil hla ber ata ka koh chhuah i ni e. ‘Ka chhiahhlawh i ni e,’ ka tih che kha, Ka thlang che a, ka hnâwl hauh lo vang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hlau suh, ka awmpui zêl a che, Thlaphâng hek suh, i Pathian chu ka ni, Chakna ka pe ang che a, ka pui ang che, Ka bân ding lam tha chak tak hian ka chelh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />I chunga thinurte zakin an mualpho vang. Nangmah khingtute pawh eng mah an ni lo vang. An boral vek dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nangmah beitute chu zawng chiam mah la i hmu zo lo vang, Nangmah dotute chu an ral vek dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa i Pathian hian ka chelh tlat che, ‘Hlau suh, ka pui ang che,’ Keimah ngeiin ka tih tawh kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel mi, aw Jakob, changpât ang lek i ni na a, ‘Hlau suh, ka pui ang che,’ Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti. Israel Mi Thianghlima, tlantu che chu ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngai teh, buh chîl khâwl thar ha hriam tak nei ṭeuhvah Ka chantîr dâwn a che. Tlângte i chîl ang a, a sawm vek ang, Mualte pawh vaivutah a chang bawk ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />I zâp ang a, a lêng darh chum chum ang, Ṭhâwngaleivirin a lên bo vang. Lalpa -ah chuan nang chu i lâwm ang a, Israel Mi Thianghlima chu i chawimawi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Retheite leh pachhiaten tui in tûr an zawna, An hmuh loh pawhin an tuihâl dangro chu Kei Lalpa hian ka chhâng ang a, Israel-te Pathian hian ka thlahthlam lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mual kawlhahte lui ka luantîr ang a, Ruamah te chuan tuihna ka awmtîr ang. Thlalêr ram chu dîlah ka siam ang a, Ram ro pawh chu tui luannaah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thlalêrah chuan sidar thing te, Thingri leh lenhmui, oliv thing nên ka phun ang a, Ram rovah chuan fâr te, phân te, tufâr te ka phun bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chûng chu miten an hmu ang a, Kei Lalpa hian ka tih a ni tih an hria ang, Lalpa , Israel Mi Thianghlima kutchhuak A nih an hre vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nangni, hnam tinrêng pathiante u, Thiamthu sawi tûr in neih chu han sawi teh u, Lalpa , Israel-te lal chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Han sawi ula, thil lo thleng tûr min hrilh rawh u, A lo thlen tûr kan lo hre lâwk dâwn nia. Thil kal tawh pawh engtihna nge sawi fiah ula, Kan lo ngaihtuah dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Thil lo thleng tûr sawi lâwk ula, Pathian in ni emaw kan hre dâwn nia; Thil tih chhiat emaw, tih ṭhat emaw tal nei teh u. Kan hlau vang a, kan ṭih bawk ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Eng mah in lo nih loh hi le, Eng mah tih theih in nei hek lo, Nangni chibai bûktute chu tenawm an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khawchhak ata mi ka pun a, Ka hming a lam ang a, Hmâr lam ram aṭangin a lo kal dâwn. Bêl vawtuin a hlum a rap hrep ang mai hian Rorêltute chirhdiak angin a rap nek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hêng thil lo thlengte hi “I tidik e,” kan tih tûrin Tu ber hian nge hrilh lâwk che u? Tu man in sawi lo va, tu mah in hrilh lo va, Tu man in thu an hre hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Zion mite hrilh hmasa bertu chu ka ni, “En teh, in mite lo haw saw,” tiin Thu lâwmawm chu Jerusalem hrilhtu ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Milemte chu ka han en vêl a, Thurâwn min pe thei rêng ka hmu zo lo, Ka zawhna pawh an chhâng thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />An zavaiin hman tlâk rêng an awm lo, Eng mah tih theih an nei lo va, An milem chhûnte hi engmahlo mai an lo ni e.
  </para>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />En teh, ka chhiahhlawh, ka chelh tlat, Ka duhzâwng tak, ka thlan hi; a chungah ka thlarau ka leih ta a, Hnam tinrêng chungah dik takin ro a rêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A au chhuak lo vang a, A râwl a rin hek lo vang a, Kawtthlêrahte a aw an hre hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Luang sâwp a tichhum dâwn lo va, Khâwnvâr de sêt sêt pawh a timit mai lo vang, Dik takin ro a rêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khawvêlah hian rorêlna dik a awm hma chu A chau lo vang a, a beidawng hek lo vang. Thliarkârte chuan a thu an ngaichâng reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian, vân siamtu leh kaipharh duaitu, Lei leh a chhûnga awm dintu, Nunna thaw leh thlarau petu, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Kei hi Lalpa chu ka ni, Dik taka rêl tûrin ka ko chhuak che, I bân tha tichakin ka hum che a, Nangmah hmangin mi tin tân thu ka thlung ta e, Hnam tin êng atân ka dah ta che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mitdelte mit tivâr tûr te, Rip chhûnga khung tichhuak tûr leh Thim zînga tâng chhan chhuak tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kei hi Lalpa , i Pathian chu ka ni, Tu mân ka ropuina min ṭâwm thei lo, Min fakna pawh milem ṭâwmpui ka phal hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngai teh, thu hrilh lâwkte chu a lo thleng tawh a, Thu thar ka puang dâwn e, A lo thlen hma ngeiin ka hrilh che hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa fakin hla thar ngei sa ula, Khawvêl pum pui hian fak rawh se; Tuifinriata kalte leh a chhûnga awm te, Thliarkârte leh a chhûnga awmte chuan fak vek rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thlalêr ram leh a chhûnga khaw awmten fak sela, Kedar-ho chênna khuate chuan amah chu fak rawh se. Sela khuaa awmten fak selangin, Tlângchhîpa lâwn chhovin au vak rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thliarkâra chêngte chuan Lalpa chu fak sela, chawimawi rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Indo tûra mi huaisen thinthawk angin Lalpa chu a lo thawk e, A han au va, a râwl a chhuah ta a, A hmêlmate lakah a chakzia chu a tilang ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Rei tak chhûng chu chechâng lovin Ka mite hi ka ngawihsan veng veng a, Tûnah nau vei angin ka rûm ta a, Ka thin a tâwt a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tlâng leh mualte ka tichhia ang a, Hnimte ka tiro vang. Luipuite chu ka tikang vek ang a, Dîlte pawh ka tiro vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mitdelte chu an hriat ngai loh kawngah ka hruai ang a, An kal ngai lohnaah ka kalpui ang. Thim chu ka tihênsak ang a, Kawng bumboh pawh ka tihrualsak bawk ang. Chûng chu ka thil tih tûrte chu a ni, Ka ṭhulh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Milem ringa, “Kan pathian chu i lo ni e,” titute chu An tlâwm ang a, an mualpho vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bengngawngte u, ngaithla teh u, Mitdelte u, lo hawi ula, en teh mah u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka chhiahhlawh anga mitdel hi tu nge awma, Ka mi tirh anga bengchhêt hi tu nge awm le? Lalpa chhiahhlawh leh a mi ruat anga Mitdel tu nge awm ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thil tam tak a hmu a; Mahse, a zâwm si lo. Beng a chhi a; mahse, a hre thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lalpan a dikzia tihlan nân A Dân chawimawia tihropui a duh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mahse, a mite chuan suam leh rawk an tâwk a, Huma tlain ripah an tâng zo ta. Man an ni a, chhantu an awm si lo. “Chhuah rawh u,” ti tûr an awm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />In zînga tuin nge hei hi hre duh? Ngun taka ngaithla tawh tûr tu nge awm le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jakoba chu tu nge suamhmang hnêna pea, Israela chu tu nge rawkhmang hnênah pe le? Lalpa a ni lâwm ni? A chungah chuan thil sual an ti a, A kawng an zawh lo va, A Dânte chu an pawisa duh hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A thinur chu an chungah a leih bua a, Indona râpthlâk tak an tuar tâk hi. Israel chungah a thinur chu a alh ta a, An kâng na a, an hre lo va, An pawisa duh chuang lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tûnah hi zawng, Lalpan heti hian a ti: “Jakob, ka siam che a, Israel, ka din i ni, Hlau suh, i tlantu ka nih hi, I hming lamin ka ko che a, ka ta i ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tui thûk i dai laiin ka awmpui zêl ang che, Tui lian pawhin a chîm pil lo vang che, Meiah kal tlang mah la, i kâng lo vang, Meialhte chuan a hliau na lo vang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kei hi Lalpa , i Pathian, Israel Mi Thianghlima, Nangmah chhandamtu chu ka ni, Nangmah tlan nân Aigupta chu ka pe a, Nangmah thleng nân Ethiopia leh Seba ka pe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka ngaihlu êm êm che a, Ka ngaisângin ka hmangaih che. Nangmah avângin mi dang ka thlauhthla a, Mi tam tak chu ka hnâwl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hlau suh, ka awmpui che, Khawchhak ata i thlahte chu ka rawn hruai ang a, Khawthlang ata ka khâwm bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chhuah vek tûrin hmâr lam ka hrilh ang a, Hrêng lo tûrin chhim lam ka hrilh bawk ang, Ka fapate ram hla tak aṭangin han hruai ula, Ka fanute kâwlkil ata han hâwn rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An zavaiin ka hming putu an ni, Ka ropui lan theih nân ka siam an ni, Ka kut ngeia ka din an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mit nei si-a mitdelte leh, Beng nei si-a bengngawngte chu han khâwm rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hnam tinrêng pung khâwm sela, Chi tinrêng lo kal rawh se. An zîngah hei hi tu nge sawia, Tûn hmaa lo sawi lâwk tawh? An sawi dik emaw thuhretu han hruai sela, Mite hriatah, ‘A dik,’ han ti rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka thuhretu i ni, Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti. Ka chhiahhlawh, ka thlan i ni, Min hre tûr leh min ring tûrin, Kei hi Pathian awm chhun ka ni tih hretu atân. Ka awm hmaa awm Pathian an awm lo va, Ka hnuah lah an awm hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kei chauh hi Lalpa chu ka ni, Chhandamtu dang tu mah an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thil lo awm tûr ka hrilh lâwk a, Chhandamtu chu kei hi ka ni, Kei chauh hian ka hrilh che u kha, Hêng hi hnam dang pathiante chuan an ti thei lo. Ka thuhretu i ni, Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti: Kei chauh hi Pathian chu ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Leilung pian hma ata tawh Pathian ka ni, Ka kuta mi tu man min lâksak thei lo va, Ka tih tawh chu sût thei rêng an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nangmah tlantu, Israel Mi Thianghlima, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Nangmahni avângin Babulon bei tûr ka tîr ang a, An kulh kalhnate chu ka chhu chhe vek ang a, Kaldai-ho chu an ṭap tlawk tlawk bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kei hi, Mi Thianghlima, Lalpa ka ni, Israel-te siamtu, in lal ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuipui kân nân kawng ka siam a, Tuifâwn bulh bulh laiah kalna ka siam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sakawr leh tawlailîr ka hruai khâwm a, Sipai rual lian tak ka koh khâwm kha. An thal dêr a, tho leh tûr an awm lo, Khâwnvâr hmeh mih angin an chimit ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hmânlai thilah innghat suh u, Tûn hma thil kha ngaihtuah suh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thil thar ka tih tûr hi thlîr zâwk rawh u, A lo thleng ṭêp tawh e, in hmu lâwm ni? Thlalêrah kawng ka sial ang a, Ram rovah chuan luipui ka luantîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ramsate chuan min chawimawi ang a, Sihalte leh Ostrich-te chuan min fak bawk ang. Ka mi tlante in tûr thlalêrah tui ka tlintîr a, Ram rova lui ka luantîr hunah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka ta tûra ka siam an ni, Min la fak dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jakob, nang erawh chuan min au lo va, Aw Israel, min ning ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hâl ral atân berâm min rawn lâk ngai lo va, Inthawinain min chawimawi duh hek lo. In hnên ata thilhlan ka phût lo va, Rimtui hâl tûr pawhin ka tihah lo che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ai rimtui te min leisak ngai lo va, Inthawina ran thauvin min titlai ngai hek lo. In sualnain min ngei zâwk a, In bawhchhiatna ka kham ngei mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kei hi ka ni in sual ngaidamtu chu, Keimah avângin a ni ka ngaihdam ṭhin che u-a, In sualte chu ka hriat reng ṭhin loh ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Min khing tûrin lo kal ula, In thiamthute han sawi rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />In pa hmasa berin thil sual a ti a, In hruaitute ka lakah hian an hel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tichuan, ka Hmun Thianghlima hotute tibawrhbângin Jakoba chu ka hluihlâwn ang a, Israela chu mi hmuhsitah ka siam bawk ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khai le, nang ka chhiahhlawh Jakob, Ka mi thlan Israel, ngaithla rawh le.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: Siamtu che ka ni a, Pum chhûnga dintu che ka ni, Ka chhiahhlawh Jakob, ka pui ṭhîn che, Ka mi thlan ngei, Jesurun, hlau suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ram rovah tui ka leih ang a, Ram chârah lui ka luantîr ang. I thlahte chungah chuan Thlarau ka leih ang a, I tu leh fate chu mal ka sâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tui tamnaa hnimhring a duah ang leh, Tui luang kama tuipuisuthlah ang hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />‘ Lalpa ta ngei ka ni,’ miten an rawn ti thliah thliah ang, Jakoba hming an rawn ṭâwm ang a, A ṭhente chuan an bânah, ‘ Lalpa ta,’ tih an ziak ang a, Ṭhenkhatte chuan Israela hming an pu bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa , Israel lal, anmahni tlantu, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Kei hi a bul leh a tâwp ka ni, Keimah lo hi Pathian dang an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keimah ang hi tu nge awm le? Han sawi sela, rawn târlang chiang rawh se. Hmânlai mite ka din an ni asin, Thil lo thleng tûr te leh Thil lo awm tûrte chu han puang teh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hlau hauh suh la, thlabâr hek suh, Hmân aṭanga ka sawi lâwk kha in hre lâwm ni? Ka thuhretu in ni, Keimah lo hi Pathian dang an awm em? Ka hriat ve loh pathian ropui an awm em ni?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Milem siamtute hi eng mah an ni hlawm lo, an thil siam, an hlut êm êmte lah a ṭangkai hek lo. Hêng betute hian eng mah an hre fiah thei lo va, an hre thei hek lo, an la zak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian lem siama, milem chhûng ṭhînte hian ṭangkaipui loh an inring ngai em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chûng betu zawng zawng chu an la mualpho vek ang. Mi themthiamte hi mihring mai bawk an ni si a, lo kal khâwm sela, ka hmaah lo ding teh se, an khûr ang a, an mualpho hle ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thîrdêngin meilinga rawhin hriam a chher a, tubohvin a dêng a, theihtâwpin a ṭang a. A rilte a ṭâm a, a lo hah a, tuihâlin a chau hle ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mistiri-in thing chu a han teh a, a rîn kual a, hriamin a riruang chu a han duang a, mihring lemah a chhuah ta a. A in chhûnga dah atân mihring lem mawi tak a siam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ngâw aṭangin sidar thing emaw, fâr thing emaw, sasua emaw a va kit a; a nih loh leh ruah châwm len sidar thing phun chu a kit a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A ṭhen chu thingah a tuah a, a lum a ai a. A lingin chhang a ur a, a ṭhen erawh chu milem siam nân a hmang a, chibai a bûk ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A ṭhen chu thingah a hmang a, sa a rawh a, a ei puar a, mei lum chu a ai a, “A lum hle e, a alh duh hle mai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thing bung dang chuan milem a siam a, a kûn a, chibai a bûk ta a. A hnênah a ṭawngṭai a, “Ka pathian i ni e, min chhandam rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutiang mi chu an mâwl lutuk e, eng mah an hre lo a ni. Hmuh hlauvin an maimitchhîng a, hriat hlauvin an rilru an hawng duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“A ṭhen chu thingtuahah ka hmang a, chhang ka ur a, sa ka rawh a, ka ei a; a ṭhen chuan milem ka siam a, thingtum hmaa kûnin chibai ka lo bûk a nih hi,” tih nachâng hria rêng an awm lo va, hmu thiam an awm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Vaivut ei ang chauhva sâwt lo va ni. A ngaih dân â tak chuan a hruai bo va, chhan chhuah rual a ni tawh lo, “Ka milem ken hi eng mah a lo ni lo,” tih nachâng rêng a hre thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jakob, hêng hi hre reng ang che, Israel, nang hi zawng ka chhiahhlawh i nih hi, Ka chhiahhlawhah ka siam che a, Aw Israel, ka theihnghilh ngai lo vang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thli len bo chhûm angin i bawhchhiatna ka lên bo va, Ṭiauchhûm a ral angin i sualnate a ral ta e. Ka hnênah lo kîr rawh, i tlantu chu ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Vânte u, lâwmin zai rawh u, Lalpan a hna a thawh tâk hi, Lei hnuaite u, au chhuak rawh u, Tlângte u, au hluah hluah ula, Ngaw leh a thing zawng zawngte u, au dur dur bawk rawh u. Jakoba chu Lalpan a tlan chhuak a, Israel-te zîngah a inchawimawi ta e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pum chhûnga siamtu che, nangmah tlantu, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Engkim siamtu, kei hi Lalpa chu ka ni a, Mahni maia vân khi kai pharhtu chu ka ni, Lei hi ka siam lai khân tu nge tel ve?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Zâwlnei derte thu ka tihlawhchham ṭhîn a, Aienthiamte ka timualpho bawk ṭhîn. Mi fingte chu ka let thla a, An hriatna âtthlâkzia ka târlang ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka chhiahhlawhte thu ka nemnghet a, Ka tirhkohte remruat ka tipuitling zêl ṭhîn. ‘Jerusalem khua chu an luah leh ang a, Judai ram khuate pawh an din leh ang, a chhiate pawh ka siam ṭha ang,’ ka ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuifinriat chu kang chat tûrin thu ka pe a, A tuite chu a kang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kura hnênah chuan, ‘Ka berâmpu i ni, ka thiltum chu tihlawhtling rawh, Jerusalem sak ṭhattîr la, Tempul sak nân lung phûmtîr rawh,’ ka ti bawk a.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kura chu Lalpan lal tûrinhriak a thih ta a, A chelh zui a, hnam dang hneh zêl tûr leh lalho chakna hlîpa, Khâr leh hauh loh tûra kulh kawngkhârte hawnsak tûrin a tîr a ni. A hnênah chuan heti hian a ti:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“I hma ka hruai ang a, Tlângte ka lo tihniam ang a, Dâr kawngkhârte ka chhu chhia ang, Kulh kawngka kalhna thîr tlâwnte pawh ka titliak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hmun thima ro an dah ṭhat te, Hmun rila sum an thuhrûkte ka pe ang che. I hming ngeia kotu che hi Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian ka nih i hre dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka chhiahhlawh Jakoba, ka mi thlan Israel avângin I hming ngeiin ka ko ta che. Min hre lo na a, i hming ka sa ta e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kei hi Lalpa chu ka ni, tu dang an awm lo va, Keimah lo chu Pathian dang an awm lo, Min hre lo na a, ka thuam che hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khawchhak ata khawthlang thlengin, Kei lo hi chu Pathian dang rêng an awm lo tih miten an hre dâwn nia, Keimah lo chu Pathian dang rêng an awm lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Êng ka siam a, thim pawh ka awmtîr a, Mal ka sâwm a, vânduainate ka thlentîr bawk. Hêng zawng zawng hi kei Lalpa hian ka tih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vân sâng ata hnehna lo sûr sela, Lei hian lo dawng sela, rah chhuah rawh se, Chhandamna chu lo pâr chhuak bawk rawh se. Kei Lalpa hian chûng chu ka thlentîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hlum tlanga siam bêl chuan a vawtu chu a sawisêl thei em ni? Hlum chuan a vawtu chu, ‘Eng nge i siam dâwn le, i themthiam lo mang e,’ A ti thei dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mahni nu leh pate hnênah, ‘Engati nge hetiang kher khera min hrin le?’ Tu nge ti vei awm ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel-te siamtu, Mi Thianghlima, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Ka fate chungchânga min chachhuaha, Ka tih tûr chu nangni rêlsak rual em ka nih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kei hi ka ni, lei siamtu chu A chhûnga awm mihringte pawh ka siam an ni. Keima kutin vân khi ka zâr pharh a, Thil awm zawng zawngte khi ka thu thu-a che vêl an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Râla lian tûrin Kura chu ka tur tho va, Kawng engkimah ka tihmuingîl bawk ang. Ka khawpui chu a din leh ang a, Lâwmman a phût lo vang a, tlanna man têl a duh hek lo vang, Ka mi, saltângte chu, a chhuah mai ang,” Engkim Lalpan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Aigupta mite thawh chhuah te, Ethiopia ram zawrh sumte chu in ta tûr a ni, An rawn ken ang che u. Seba rama mi sâng tak takte chu In bawiha ṭang tûrin an lo kal ang. Kawl bun chungin an zui ang che u a, In hmaa ṭhingṭhiin ‘Pathian awmpuite chu in lo nih ngei hi le, Ani chauh hi Pathian chak chu a lo nih hi,’ Tiin chibai an bûk bawk ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israel-te Pathian, anmahni chhandamtu chu Pathian inthup i lo nih ngei hi le.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Milem siamtute chu an zak êm êm ang a, An zavaiin an mualpho vang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpan Israel-te chu kumkhua atân a chhandam a, Engtikah mah an mualpho tawh lo vang.’ ”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Vân siamtu chu Pathian a ni, Lei pawh a siam a, nghet takin a din hi. Chhe rem rumin a siam lo va, Chênna tlâkah a siam a ni. Chûng titu Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Kei hi Lalpa chu ka ni, tu dang an awm lo ve,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lei chhûng hmun thim ata A rûkin thu ka sawi lo va, Hmun thengrenga min zawng tûrin Israela thlahte ka tîr hek lo. Kei hi, Lalpa , thu dik sawi ṭhîntu chu ka ni, Thil dik ka puang chhuak ṭhîn.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Chhiatna pumpelh, hnam tinrêngte u, Lo kal ula, pung khâwm rawh u, Tu mah chhâng thei hlei lo thingtuma siam milem, pathiana biaa, zâwntute hian eng mah hriat an nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lo kal ula, in thu han sawi rawh u, Han inrâwn tlâng teh u, Hêng thilte hi hmânlai ata tu nge lo sawi? Kei Lalpa hi ka ni lâwm ni Mahni mite chhandamtu Pathian? Keimah chauh hi ka ni, tu mah dang an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khawvêla mi zawng zawngte u, Ka lam lo hawi ula, ka lo hum ang che u, Keimah chauh hi Pathian ka ni, tu dang an awm lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mahni hming chhâl meuhvin thu ka tiam a, Ka thutiam chu a rinawm ṭhîn a ni. Ka thu sawi tawh ka sût ngai lo, Ka hmaah hian mi tin an lo ṭhingṭhi ang a, Ka hming an chhâl tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />‘ Lalpa , nangmahah chauh a ni, Dikna leh chakna chu a awm,’ min la ti ang a, Ka lam panin an lo kal ang. Min hawtu zawng zawngte erawh chu an mualpho vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kei Lalpa hian Jakoba thlahte chu ka chhandam ang a, Anni chuan mi chawimawi ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Babulon biak lal pathian Bela leh Neboa chu an chau va, An tlâwm ta dêr mai. Sabengtungte an phurhtîr a, Ran chau tawh tân an rit kher mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Milem tlâwm tate chuan, A zâwntute an chhan thei lo, Mahni ngei pawh an inchhan thei lo va, Salah an hruai ta e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jakoba leh Israel chhûng la dam zawng zawngte u, Ka thu hi ngaithla rawh u, In pian aṭang tawh khân ka puak tlei in ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tarkûn lu ṭuak in nih thlengin Kei hi ka ni, khai ding ṭhîntu che u, Ka siam in ni, ka vêng zêl ang che u, Chawiliantu che u ka ni, Ka hum dâwn a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tu nên nge min khaikhin ang a, Tu nên nge min tehkhin ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An ip ata rangkachakte an bun chhuak hawk hawk a, Tangkaruate an bûk chhuak a, Themthiam rualin pathian lem an siam a, Kûnin chibai an bûk ta e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An kokiah an han chhuang a, an pu ta a, An awmna tûrah chuan an va dah a, A din ngaiin a ding rêng mai. A che sawn thei lo va, An auh pawhin a chhâng thei lo, Mangang mah se a chhan thei bawk hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chûng chu hre rengin, Chhût ngun ula, Mi sualte u, ngaihtuah rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hmânlai ata thil awm dân kha hre ta che u, Kei hi Pathian awm chhun ka ni, mi dang an awm lo ve, Keimah chauh hi ka ni Pathian awm chhun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A tîr ata a tâwp dân tûr ka sawi lâwk a, Thil lo thleng tûr hmâsâng ata ka sawi ṭhin kha, ‘Ka remruat chu a nghet tlat ang, Ka duhzâwng chu ka ti ngei ang,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khawchhak ata mupui ka han ko va, Ram hla tak aṭangin ka mi ruat chu ka pun a ni; A ni, ka sawi tawh a, a lo thleng ang, Ka tum tawh a, ka ti ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thinlung luhlulte u, ka thu hi ngaithla rawh u, Hnehna ni chu a hla lo in ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka hnehna ni a lo hnai ta, a hla lo ve. Rei lo tê-ah ka chhandam dâwn che u, Zion chu ka chhandam ang a, Israel chu ka tiropui bawk ang.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw nang nula, Babulon khaw fanu, lo chhuk thla la, Vaivutah hian ṭhu rawh. Lalṭhutthlêng ata kha, Kaldai fanu, leiah ṭhu rawh, ‘A no chik chek mang e,’ an ti leh tawh lo vang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Buh herna khâwl vuan la, buh chu her rawh, I hmai khuhna hlîp la, I fênfual kha tichhîng deuh la, I mal hlîm la, lui kha dai kai rawh le.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Saruakin i awm ang a, I zahmawh pawh a lang bawk ang. Phuba ka la dâwn a, tu mah ka zuah lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel Mi Thianghlima chu min tlantu a ni a, A hming chu Engkim Lalpa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Kaldai-ho hnênah, “Nang Kaldai fanu, Ngawi rengin thim zîngah chuan ṭhu tlawk tlawk rawh, Hnam tin lalnu an vuah dâwn tawh lo che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka mite chungah hian ka thinur a, Ka mi thlante ka sawisa a, I kutah ka rawn dah a, I lo khawngaih si lo. Putarte pawh dim hlek lovin i chhawr zêl mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalnu ni kumkhua tûra inngaiin thil lo thleng tûr i thlîr lo va, A tâwp dân tûr i hre hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nawmchen lâwmnu: lo ngaithla teh, Lungmuang takin i awm der der ṭhîn a, ‘Kei chauh lo chu tu dang nge awm,’ i ti vei a. ‘Hmeithai ka ni dâwn lo, Lû ka sûn hauh lo vang,’ i ti bawk nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thâwklehkhatah, ni khat thil thu maiah, Hêng thilte hi i tuar ngei dâwn. Dawi thiam hlein thil ti thei viau mah la, Lu i sûn ang a, i hmeithai ngei dâwn e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ngaihngam takin thil sual i ti ṭhîn a, ‘Tu man min hmu lo vang,’ tiin i finna leh i hriatna chuan a hruai bo che, ‘Kei chauh lo chu tu dang nge awm?’ I ti rilru vei ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Dawia i dan zawh loh thil ṭha lovin a nang ang che, Thawi dam zawh loh vânduainate i chungah hian a lo thleng ang, I hriat lâwk loh chhiatna a lo thleng thut dâwn si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />I dawi thiam te, i dawibûr te, I naupan lai ata i hman ṭhin kha bânsan duh suh, Tute emaw tihṭhaihin i hlâwkpui hlauh mahna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thurâwntu che an tam vei nên, Eng mah i ti thei chuang si lo. Vân ṭhen thliaha, arsi thlîrtute leh thla tina thil sawi lâwktute chu Lo kal sela, chhan che rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Meia kâng ral mai ṭhîn buhpâwl ang lek an ni, Meialh hluah hluah lakah an inchhan thei lo va, An tân a sa lutuk a ni, Meivâm ai tûr ang lek a ni si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />I naupan lai ata i thawhpui leh i dâwr ṭhinte, Chutiang mai chu an lo ni si, An duh hunah an kalsan mai ang che, Tu man an chhan lo vang che,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jakoba chhûngte u, ngaithla rawh u, Israela hming in pu a, Juda thlah in ni a, Israela Pathian hming chu in lam fo ṭhîn. In ti tak tak si lo va, in ti mai mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khawpui thianghlim mi in inti a, Israel-te Pathian ringtu in inti bawk a, A hming chu Engkim Lalpa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Israel-te hnenah, “A tîr ata hmâsâng thilte ka hril lâwk a, Ka sawi chhuak a, ka puang bawk a. Ka tih chu a ni ta nghâl mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />In luhlul êm êm a, In nghâwng chu thîr anga khauh a ni, In chaldâr lah ngên anga chang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />In chungchâng thu ka sawi lâwk a, A lo thlen hma ngeiin ka hriattîr ṭhîn che u, Chutilo zawng, ‘Kan milem tih a ni, Kan chher leh chhûn milemte thu thu-a lo awm a ni,’ In ti vei dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hêng hi in hmu a, in hre ta a, A dik in ti lâwm ni? Tûn aṭangin thil thar ka hrilh dâwn a che u, In hriat loh thil inthupte chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tûn maiah khân ka awmtîr a, Tûn hma kha chuan in hre ngai lo, Awm tawh ni se, ‘Kan hriat hnu alâwm,’ in ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />In la hre ngai lo va, in la hmu ngai hek lo, Tûn hma zawng khân beng pawhin in hre ngai lo, Mi bum hmang tak in nih ka hria asin, Pian tirh ata hel hmang in ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka hming avângin ka thinur chu ka tilang duh rih lo va, Min fak theih nân ka insûm rih a ni, Ka tiral rih lo vang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tangkarua chu thukah an rawh thianghlim ṭhîn a, Harsatnain nangni pawh hi ka fiah che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Keimah avâng liau liauva ti ka ni, Ka hming tihhliau ka phal lo va, Ka ropuina chu tu ma mi ṭâwm ka phal hek lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Aw ka koh Israel, Aw Jakob, ka thu hi ngaithla rawh, Kei hi a bul leh a tâwp chu ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lei innghahna, keima kuta ka siam a ni, Ka kut ding lamin vân khi ka zâr pharh a, Ka han ko va, an lo awm ta mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lo kal khâwm vek ula, ngaithla rawh u, Tu ber hian nge hêng hi lo sawi lâwk le? Lalpa hmangaiha chuan Babulon-ah a duhzâwng chu a rawn ti ang a, Kaldai mite chungah kut a thlâk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keimah ngeiin ka sawi tawh a, ka koh a ni, Ka rawn hruai a, a tih tûrah a hmuingîl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lo hnai ula, hei hi hre rawh u, A tîr ata a rûkin thu ka sawi lo va, Thil lo thlengah ka awm ve zêl a ni.” (Tûnah Lalpa Pathian chuan min tîr a, A Thlarau pawh min pe a ni.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nangmah thlangtu, Israel Mi Thianghlima, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Kei hi Lalpa , i Pathian chu ka ni, I tâna ṭha tûr chu ka zirtîr ṭhîn che a, I kalna tûr kawng chu ka kawhhmuh bawk ṭhîn che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka thupêkte ngaihven duh ṭhîn la aw: Luipui kang lo angin malsâwmnate a lo luang tûr. Tuifâwnte chuan vaukam a tuam hlup hlup angin, Hlawhtlinna pawh i tân a lo thleng tûr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />I thlahte chu ṭiauvaivut anga tam an ni ang a, I tu leh fate chu chhiar sên an ni lo vang. Ka hmaah chuan an ral ngai hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Babulon khua ata kal chhuak ula, Kaldai ram hi tlânsan rawh u. Hlim taka au vêlin ka thu hi puang ula, Hmun tinrêngah sawi zêl rawh u, ‘ Lalpan a chhiahhlawh Jakoba chu a tlan chhuak ta,’ tiin au rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thlalêr rama a hruai pawhin an tuihâl lo, Lungpui ata an tân tui a lo chhuak a, Lungpui khi aṭangin tuihna a lo chik chhuak bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />‘Mi sualte tân râlmuanna rêng a awm lo ve,’ ” Lalpan a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thliarkârte u, ka thu hi ngaithla rawh u, Hla taka awmte u, ngaihven rawh u. Chhûla ka awm lai khân Lalpan min ko va, Nu pum chhûnga ka awm lai khân ka hming a sa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka thu khandaih hriamah a chantîr a, A kut phênah min dah ṭha a, Thal zum takah min hmang ta a, A thal bâwmah min dah ṭha e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ka chhiahhlawh chu i ni, aw Israel, nangin min chawimawi ang,” min ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka thawkrim thlâwn a ni, Thil lawilovah ka tha ka sêng zo va, Thawh chhuah eng mah ka nei si lo ka ti hial a; Mahse, ka chungthu hi Lalpa rêl tûr a ni. Ka thil tih ang zêla min petu chu Pathian a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka pian hma khân Lalpan a chhiahhlawhah min ruat tawh a, Jakoba chu hruai kîr tûr leh Israel-te hruai khâwm tûrin Lalpan min chawimawi a, Ka Pathian chu ka chakna hnâr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Jakoba thlahte tungdinga, Israel la damte hruai kîr tûra Ka chhiahhlawh nih hi nêp tak a ni. Chu aia hna ropui zâwk tih tûr i nei, Khawvêl pum pui hi chhandam a nih theih nân Hnam tin tân êng i ni ngei bawk tûr a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa Israel-te tlantu, Mi Thianghlima chuan heti hian a ti: “Nang, mi hmuhsit, hnam tin endawng, Rorêltute chhiahhlawh, Lalten bawih ata i chhuak an hmu ang a, Nangmah zahin an tho vang a, Miliante pawh i hmaah an kûn ang.” Lalpan a thu a hlen avângin Israel Mi Thianghliman a thlang a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpan heti hian a ti: “A hun takah ka chhâng che a, A hun takah ka chhan chhuak che, Ka humhim che a, nangmah avângin Hnam dangte nên thu ka thlung a, In ram tungding leha, In ro chan ram ṭiau hnu in luah leh vek theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lung in tângte chu, ‘Chhuak rawh u’, ka ti ang a, Thim zînga awmte chu, ‘Engah lo chhuak rawh u,’ ka ti bawk ang. Berâm angin kalkawngahte an tla ang a, Mual kawlhahte hnimhring an hmu zêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An ril ṭâmin an tui a hâl ngai lo vang a, Thli lum leh chhûn ni sa hrehawm an ti hek lo vang. An hruaitu chuan a lainat a, Tui tlan tûr awmnaah a hruai dâwn si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tlângahte chuan lamlian ka sial ang a, An kalna tûr kalkawng ka buatsaih ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />En teh, ka mi, hla taka lo kalte saw, Hmâr lam ata an lo kal a, Thlang lam ata an lo haw e. Sinim ram hla aṭangtein an lo kal saw.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vânte u, hlim takin au ula, Leilung pawh hi lâwmin au bawk rawh se. Tlângte lâwmin au chhuak sela, Lalpan a mite chu a thlamuan a, Tihduhdah tuarte chu a lainat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zion chuan, ‘Kan Lal P athian -in min ngaihthah a, Lalpan min theihnghilh ta a ni,’ a ti hial a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpan heti hian a ti: “Nuin a fa hnute hne lai a theihnghilh thei em ni? A rîla rah a lainat lo thei dâwn em ni? Nuten an fate chu an theihnghilh mai thei e, Kei chuan ka theihnghilh tawp lo vang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ngai teh, ka kutphahah i hming ka ziak tawh a, I kulh bangte ka vêng reng ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichimtu che ai chuan sak ṭhat duhtu che chu an hmanhmawh zâwk a ni. A tichhetute chuan an chhuahsan thuai ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Dâk la, i mit han lên vêl teh, I mite chu an inhâwr khâwm mêk zêl a ni, An lo kal dâwn ṭêp e, Pathian nung ka nih a chiang ang leh, Movin a incheina a chhuang ang hian, I mite chu i chhuang hle ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />In ramte chu a chhe vek a, a ram dêr kha, A luah tûrte an lo thlen chuan A zîm lutuk ngei dâwn, Tiramtu che an bo vek dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />I tu i fa, saltâng lo hawte chuan, I beng hriatah, ‘Ram hi a zîm lua e, Chên nân ram zau zâwk kan mamawh ta e,’ an la ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />‘Hêng mite hi tu nge min hrinsak le? Ka fa hrinte ka sûn zo va, Sala tângin ka vâkvai a, Hênghote hi tu nge min tihseilensak ni? Keimah chauhvin min hnutchhiah kha, Hêng mite hi khawi lam mi nge?’ i la ti ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: “Hnam tin hmuhah ka bân ka phar ang a, Ka hui ang a, i fate chu an rawn pawmsak ang che, I fanute pawh chu an rawn pua ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lalte chu i pate an ni ang a, Lalnute chuan an awm ang che. Leia bawkkhupin chibai an bûk ang che a, I kea vaivut chu an liak bawk ang. Kei hi Lalpa ka nih i hriat theih nân, Min nghâktute tu mah an mualpho lo vang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mi huai râllâk i chhuhsak ngam em ni? Mi kawlhsenin a tântîr chu i chhuhsak ngam em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Mi huai râllâk chu ka chhuhsak ang a, Mi kawlhsen tântîr pawh ka chhuah bawk ang. Khingtu che chu ka khing ang a, I fate chu kei hian ka chhandam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tinawmnahtu che chu anmahni sa ka eitîr ang a, Uain rui ang maiin thisen an rui phung ang, Kei Lalpa hi nangmah Chhandamtu leh Tlantu, Jakoba Mi Chaka ka nih hi, Mi tinrêngin an hre vek ang.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “In nu Israel chu, ka tirh bo khân, Mâkna lehkha ka pe em ni? Leiba aia an fate hralh angin Tu hnênah nge ka hralh che u? In sual vângin a ni hralh in niha, In bawhchhiatna avângin a ni, in nu ka tirh bo ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka lo kal khân tu man mi ûksak lo, Ka koh lai khân tu man mi chhâng hek lo; Chhan chhuak tûrin ka bân a tawi lutuk ta em ni? Chhan chhuak tûrin ka chak tâwk ta lo vem ni? Ka han hau hlek a, tuipui chu a kang mai a, Luipuite lah thlalêr rovah ka chantîr a, Tui awm loh avângin sanghate an thi a, An ṭawih zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vânte pawh khi ka tithim a, Lusûn puan dum sin ang mai a lo ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa , ka Pathian chuan Thu sawi thiamna min pe a ni, Mi chaute chu thu-a fuih harh dân tûr ka hriat theih nân tûk tin mi tiharh a, A tûk a têlin mi zirtîrna ka hrethiam telh telh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa , ka Pathian chuan ka beng min hawnsak a, Kei ngei pawhin luhlul ka chhuah lohva, Ka hawi lêtsan loh nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vuak atân ka hnungzâng ka dawh a, Ka hmuihmulte an pawhin ka dawh reng a, chil te min chhâk a; Mahse, zakin ka hmai ka hup ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa , ka Pathian chuan min pui ṭhîn a, Chuvâng tak chuan ka mualpho lo va ni; Ka intipachang lui a, zahna tûr rêng ka nei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi ṭantu chu a lo hnai e, Tu nge mi khing ngam ang? Thiam thu sawiin i han ding tlâng teh ang, Min khingtu chu lo hnai teh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa , ka Pathian hi min ṭantu chu a ni, Tu nge thiam loh min chantîr ang? Puan angin an hlui ang a, Thîmin a ei zo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nangni zînga Lalpa ṭih ṭhîn, A chhiahhlawh, a thu pawisa ṭhîntute u, Êng nei lovin thimah kal mah ula, Lalpa hming chu ring mai ula, Pathianah chuan innghat rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mahse, mahni meichher chhi-a, Thal alh thei paite u, In thal alh êngah chuan kal teh rêng u, Lalpa kut in tuar tûr chu, Hrehawm râpthlâk tak a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="51" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Chhan chhuah duha Lalpa zawngtute u, Ka thu hi ngaithla rawh u. In pian chhuahna lungpui hi en ula, In lo chhuahna lung khur hi en teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Abrahama, in thlahtu kha ngaihtuah ula, Sari, in hringtu kha hre reng rawh u. Ka koh lai khân fa rêng an nei lo va, Mal ka sâwm a, an pung ta chiam a nih kha.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpan Zion khua chu a khawngaih a, A khaw chim chhûnga chêngte chu a thlamuan a; A ram, thlalêra chang te pawh, Eden angin a siam ang a, A ram ṭiau chu Lalpan huanah a siam dâwn e. Tah chuan hlimna leh lâwmna a awm ang a, Lâwmthu sawiin fak hla an sa bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Ka mite u, ka thu hi ngaithla ula, Ka hnamte hian an beng lo chhi rawh se, Dân thu chu ka hnên ata a lo chhuak; Ka mite êng atân rorêlna dik ka siamsak bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka hneh hun chu a hnai ta a, Ka chhan chhuah hun a lo thleng dâwn, Keimah ngeiin ka mite chungah ro ka rêl ang a, Thliarkârte chuan min thlîr ang a, Ka kut an nghâk bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vân lamah te in mit lên chho u la, Hnuai lama lei hi en rawh u, Vân khi meikhu angin a zâm ral ang, Puan ang maiin lei pawh hi a la hlui ang a, A chhûnga chêngte pawh tho ang maiin An thi pheng phung bawk ang. Ka chhandamna erawh hi zawng kumkhua atân a ni a, Ka hnehna pawh a tâwp ngai lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thu dik hretu, ka Dân thinlunga paite u, Ka thu hi ngaithla rawh u. Mihring deuna hlau suh ula, An diriamna pawh manganpui hek suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thîmin puante a ei chhia a, Sûlrûl pawhin sahmul puante a ei ral ṭhîn ang hian, Chûngho pawh chu an la ral ang; Ka hnehna erawh chu kumkhua atân a ni a, Ka chhandamna pawh chu chhuan zawng zawng tân a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa , harh la, harh la, tho teh, Hmânlai mite hnênah i chakzia chu i lantîr a, Han lantîr leh teh le. Nang hi i ni lâwm ni, Rahab sât sawma, tuipui Dragon chhun hlumtu kha?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuipui tikanga, i mi thlante kal kaina tûr Tuifinriat mawnga kawng siamtu kha i ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa , i tlante chu an lo hâwng ang, Zion tlâng chu zaiin an lo thleng ang, Chatuan lâwmna an khum ang a, Hlim leh lâwmin an khat ang a, Lungngaih thlaphân a awm tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Kei hi ka ni thlamuanna rawn thlentu, Thi thei mihring, hlobet ang leh hring fate hi, Engtizia nge in hlauh mai le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vân kai pharha, lei nghahchhan phûmtu, In siamtu Lalpa hi in theihnghilh ta em ni? Tiduhdaha tihchhiat tumtu che u thinur hlau rêng rênga in awm mai le? Thinur mah se in tuar lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kun tlawk tlawk tawhte chu an ding char leh thuai ang, Saltâng retheite chu an chhuak thuai ang a, An tânna khur chhûngah chuan an thi lo vang a, Ei tûr an tlachham hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kei hi Lalpa , in Pathian chu ka ni, Tuifinriatte ka chawk let a, Tuifâwnte chu a ri hum hum ṭhîn, Ka hming chu Engkim Lalpa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Vân khi ka kai pharh a, lei innghahna ka phûm bawk a, Zion mite hnênah, ‘Ka mite in ni e, In hmuiah chuan ka thu ka dah ta a, Ka kut phênah ka dah ṭha ta che u,’ ka tih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Harh teh, harh teh, Jerusalem, tho teh, Lalpa thinurna uain chu i in ta a, Pai pai khawpa ruiin i in tâk hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hruai tûr chein i fa tu mah an awm lo va, Kai tûr chein i mite zînga mi tu mah an awm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chhiatna thuah hnih i tuar tâk hi, Tu nge ṭah ta ang che? I ramte chu tihchhiat a ni, a ṭiau zo ta; I mite chuan ṭâm an tâwk a, khandaih an tuar tâk hi, Engtin nge, ka thlamuan tâk ang che?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />I fate chu kawtthlêr pêngṭhuam tinah chauvin an tlu phung mai. Lêna sathâr man ang maiin Lalpa thinur an tuar ta e, An pathianin a hau a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nangni tihduhdah tuar, zu in si lo, ruia pai paite u, Hei hi lo ngaithla rawh u:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian, a mite ṭan thîntu, in Pathian chuan Heti hian a ti: “Rui pai khawpa in tlâk ṭhak no, Lalpa thinurna uain no chu, Ka intîr leh ngai tawh lo vang che u. Ka la bo daih ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nangmahni tiduhdaha, kawtthlêrah te, ‘Ka rahchhanah bawk rawh u,’ tia, I hnungzâng zawha, vei vêl ṭhînte hnênah ka pe thung ang.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="52" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tho teh, tho teh, aw Jerusalem, Han insangmar rawh le, khawpui thianghlim Jerusalem, Ropui takin han inchei teh, Serh tan loh leh mi bawlhhlawhte An lo lût tawh dâwn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw Jerusalem, vaivut ata thovin inbêngfai la, Lalṭhutthlêngah ṭhu rawh. Zion khawpui fanau saltângte u, In nghâwng ata kawl kha hlîp rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Man têl lova bawiha hralh in ni a, tangka sum pe lova tlan in ni ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: “Hmânah ka mite chu anmahni thuin Aigupta ramah an pêm a. Asuria-hovin engkhaw lawilovah an rawn rap bet leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tûnah eng nge ka tih tâk ang?” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti. “Ka mite chu Babulon-ah man pe lovin bawihah an hruai a, an chunga rorêltute chuan an vîn tuar tuar a,” tih hi LALPA thuchhuak a ni. “Nilêng lêngin ka hming an sawichhia a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuvângin, ka mite chuan ka hming an hria ang a, chutih hunah chuan keimah ngei hi a sawitu ka ni tih an hria ang. Ngai teh, keimah ngei hi ka ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zion hnêna, “I Pathian chuan ro a rêl ta,” tia, Bawih chhuah thu lâwmawm tlâng tina rawn puanga, Remna chanchin ṭha rawn thlentute ke chu a va mawi em!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngai teh, i râlvêngtute au thâwm chu! Zion-a Lalpa lo haw an mit ngeia an hmuh avângin Hlim takin an zai e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jerusalem khaw ram tawha chêngte u, Hlim takin au dur dur rawh u; Lalpan a mite chu a thlamuanin Jerusalem khua chu a tlan ta e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi tin hmuhah Lalpan a bân thianghlim a hlîm ta a, Khawvêl pum pui pawh hian Pathian chhandamna chu an hmu bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chhuak rawh u, chhuak rawh u, Babulon hi chhuahsan rawh u; Thil bawlhhlawh rêng rêng khawih suh u, Lalpa bungbêl phurtute u, inthian thianghlim ula, Chhuahsan rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tlânchhia anga kal tûr in ni lo va, Râltlân anga chhuak tûr in ni hek lo, Lalpan in hma a hruai ang a, Israel-te Pathian chu in hnu dâltu a ni dâwn si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai teh, ka chhiahhlawh chu a thil tihah a hmuingîl ang, Miten an chawimawiin an ngaisâng êm êm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amah an hmuhin mi tam tak chuan Mak an ti êm êm dâwn a ni. A hmêl an tichhe nasa êm a, Mihring hmêl pawh a pu lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hnam tam tak chu a thisenin a theh fai ang, Lalte pawhin mak ti takin an hmui an chîp bawk ang; An la hrilh ngai loh chu an hmu ang a, An la hriat ngai loh chu an hre bawk dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="53" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kan thu sawi hi tu nge awih anga, Lalpa kut lo lang hi tu nge hrethiam ang le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A hmaah chuan ani chu thil ṭiak hlim, Lei ro aṭanga zung lo chawr chhuak ang maiin a lo piang chhuak a, Amah kan duhna tûrin ropuina leh mawina rêng a nei lo va, Kan ngainatna tûrin duhawmna rêng a nei hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ani chu mihringte duh loh leh hmuhsitin a awm a, Lungngai thei mi leh na thei mi a ni a; Mite hawisan leh hmuhsitin a awm a, Keini lah chuan engah mah kan ngai si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ani chuan kan natnate min tuarsak a, Kan lungngaihnate a phur a lo ni zâwk; Keini lahin hrem tuarah leh, Pathian nghaisak leh vuakah kan ngai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mahse, ani chuan kan bawhchhiatna avângin hliam a tuar a, Kan sual avânga sawisak a ni; Muanna kan neih theih nân hrem a tuar a, A vuak tuar chu kan tân damna tûr a lo ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Berâm angin kan vâk bo vek tawh a, Mahni duh lam lam kan pan ṭheuh va; Lalpan kan zaa khawlohna chu A chungah chuan a nghat ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ani chu hnehchhiah leh tihduhdahin a awm a, Inngaitlâwm takin a tuar zêl a, A chhâng lêt ve hauh lo; Berâm talh tûr an kaih laia a ngawi tlat leh, Berâm a hmul meh laia a ngawi reng ṭhîn ang hian, Ani pawhin eng mah a sawi lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An han man a, a chungthu an rêl a, A thlah kal zêl tûr tu man an dâwnpui lo; A nunna chu khawvêl ata an lâksak ta, Ka mite sual vânga tihhlum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Râwng taka eng mah ti ngai lovin, Bumna thu rêng rêng sawi ngai lo mah se, Mi suaksualte thlânah phûm tûra ruat a ni a, Mahse, a thih chuan mi hausa thlânah an phûm ta zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpan vuak tuartîr chu ṭha a ti a, A tuar ta rêng a ni. A nunna chu sual thawi nâna i pawm hunah, A thlahte chu a hmu tawh ang. A dam chhûng chu a tisei ang a, A kutah chuan Lalpa duhzâwng a puitling ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A thawh rah a hmuh hunah chuan A thlâwnin a tuar lo tih a hria ang; Ka chhiahhlawh fel tak chuan Mi tam tak a chhanhim ang a, An sualnate a phurhsak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi lian zîngah a chanpual tûr ka dah ta a, Mi chak zîngah râllâk sum chu a sem ve ang; Thi khawp hialin a inpe a, Mi sualte zîngah chhiar a ni si a. Ani zawngin mi tam tak bawhchhiatna phurin Mi sualte tân a ngensak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <chapter number="54" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Aw nang, fa nei ngai lo, hlim takin au rawh le, Nau vei ngai lo, lâwmin au chhuak ta che; Pasal neite ai chuan khawharnu chuan fanau a ngah zâwk dâwn,” Lalpan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I puan in hmun chu zauh la, A khuhna pawh tihlai ang che, ren suh, A thlunna hruite chu tisei zêl la, A kaihmarna khente pawh tinghet sauh rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I ramri chu ding lam leh vei lamah i zauh ang a, Hnam dang luah ramte chu I fate chuan an nei ang a, Khawpui ram tawhte pawh An chûl hnûm leh dâwn e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hlau suh, i zak dâwn tawh lo ve, I mualpho hek lo vang, i tlâwm tawh dâwn si lo, I tleirâwl lai mualphona chu i theihnghilh daih ang a, Hmeithai hmuhsitâwm tak i nih lai pawh i hre reng tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I siamtu chu i pasal a ni ang a, A hming Engkim Lalpa a ni. Israel-te tlantu, Mi Thianghlima a ni a, Lei pum pui Pathian tih a ni bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tleirâwl chhuaha pasal nei, a pasalin a duh tâk loh, Thinlung na êm êm ang hi i ni; Mahse, Lalpan a ko leh dâwn a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Rei lo tê chhûng ka ṭhen che a, Ka khawngaih êm che a, ka ko leh thuai ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka thinur êm vângin ka hawisan lawk che a, Ka hmangaihin ka khawngaih kumkhua ang che, Nangmah tlantu Lalpa chuan a ti e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Nova dam lai khân Leiah tuilêt tawh lo tûrin thu ka tiam a, Thinur taka zilh tawh loh che tûnah ka tiam tâk hi,” Lainattu che, Lalpan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Tlângte chu bovin mualte pawh insawn mah se, Ka lainat che a reh lo vang, Remna thuthlung ka siam ka sût hek lo vang,” Lalpa , hmangaihtu che chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aw Jerusalem, sawisak nek tâwk, Tuifâwn vawrh lên vawrh lên, khawngaih hlawh lo, Lung ṭha chi hmangin ka din leh dâwn a che, I innghahna lungah safir ka phûm ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />I vênbûkah rubi lung ka hmang ang a, I kulh kawngkhârah chuan lung chang tle mi ka hmang ang a, I kulh bangah lung hlu tak tak ka hmang bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />I fa zawng zawng Lalpan a zirtîr ang a, Râlmuang takin an awm der der tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Dikna avângin i nghet ang a, Tiduhdahtu an kal bo vang a, hlauh tûr i nei lo vang, Hlauhawm lahin a hnaih hek lo vang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Beitu che an awm chuan ka thu lova ti an ni a, A bei apiang che chu an tlâwm ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ngai teh, meihawl chhêma, hriamhrei chhertu thîrdêngte hi ka siam an ni; Chûng hriamhrei thil tihchhiat nâna hmangtute pawh ka siam an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nangmah beihna tûra an hriam chherte rêng rêng chu hmuingîl a awm lo vang. Nangmah hêktu zawng zawngte chuan Thiam loh an chang zâwk ang. Hei hi Lalpa chhiahhlawhte chan tûr chu a ni, Hnehna ka pe dâwn e, Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="55" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hawh u, tuihâl apiangte u, Tui hi han pan rawh u. Tangka sum nei lote pawh lo kal ula, In ei atân buh hi tangka pawh pe chuang lovin han la ula, Uain leh hnutetui hi rawn chaw rawh u, A man a awm lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Puar leh fânna ni lovah Engah nge in sum in khawhral le? Tlaina tûr ni lovah in tha in sêng thlâwn e. Ka thu hi ngai ula, Thil ṭha tuihnai tinrêng In châk apiang in ei dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />In beng dawhin ka hnênah lo kal rawh u, Ngaithla ula, in nung dâwn nia. Kumkhua atân thu i thlung ang, Lal Davida hnêna khawngaih ka tiam tlat tâk ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Miten ka ropuizia an hriat theih nân, Ani chu hnam hotu leh hruaitu atân ka ruat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I hriat ngai loh hnam chu i duh duhin i ko vang a, La hre ngai lo che chuan tlânin an rawn bêl dâwn che nia, Israel Mi Thianghliman chu chu a ti ang a, A chawimawi dâwn a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hmuh theiha a awm lai hian Lalpa chu zawng ula, A hnaih lai hian amah chu ko rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi sualte chuan an awm dân chu kalsan sela, Mi tu pawhin an ngaihtuahna sualte bânsan sela, Lalpa lamah lo kîr rawh se. A lo khawngaih ngei ang; Kan Pathian hi ngaihdam peih tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />‘Ka rilru leh in rilru chu a inang lo, Ka awm dân leh in awm dân pawh a inmil bawk hek lo,’ Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vân khi lei aia sâng a ni ang khian, Ka awm dân hi in awm dân aia sâng a ni. Ka rilru pawh in rilru aia thûk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ruah leh vûr chu vân aṭangin a lo tla a, Kîr leh lovin lei hi a tihnâwng ṭhîn, Thlai chi theh chu a tiṭiak a, A thehtu tân rah sêng tûr pawh a awmtîr ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka kâa thuchhuak pawh Hlawhchhama kîr leh rual a ni lo ve, Ka duhzâwng chu a ti zêl ang, Ka tirhnaah a hlawhtling ngei bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hlim takin Babulon chu in chhuahsan dâwn. Râlmuang takin an hruai chhuak ang che u, In hmaah chuan tlâng leh mual te, Lâwmin an au chhuak ang. Ngâwa thingte chuan hlimin kut an bêng dur dur ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hnimhlîngnei hmunah chuan fâr thing a ṭo vang a, Hlohar hmunah lenhmui a ṭo bawk ang. Lalpa thiltih hriat reng nâna kih loh tûr Kumkhua atân chhinchhiahna a ni ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="56" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: Dik takin ro rêl ula, diktakin thil ti rawh u, Ka chhan chhuak thuai dâwn a che u, Ka felzia chu a lo lang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sabat bawhchhe lova serh ṭhîn, Thil ṭha lo rêng rêng khawih duh lo, hêng hi tia, Vawng tlattu mihring chu a nihlawh e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa mite rawn bêltu hnam dangte chuan, “ Lalpan a mite nên min enhrang e,” ti hauh suh se. Til reh pawhin, “Thing ro mai ka ni e,” ti hek suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Til reh hnênah Lalpan heti hian a ti e: Sabat serha, ka duhzâwng tia, Ka thuthlung pawh vuan tlattu chu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka Tempul-ah, ka in chhûng ngeiah hian, Amah hriatrengna tûr ka siamsak ang, Fanu fapa neite aia hming ṭha ka pe bawk ang. A hming a dai ngai lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hnam dang, Lalpa bêla a rawngbâwl ṭhîn Lalpa hming chu ngaina êma, a chhiahhlawha inpe, Sabat bawhchhe lova serh ṭhîn, Ka thuthlung vawng tlat ṭhînte chu
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka tlâng thianghlimah chuan ka hruai ang a, ṭawngṭaina hmun, ka inah chuan, Hlim êm êmin ka awmtîr ang. Hâlral thilhlan inthawinate Ka maichâma an rawn lâk chu ka lo lâwm ang. Ka Tempul hi mi tinrêng tân ṭawngṭaina hmun tih a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tihdarh Israel-te hruai khâwm lehtu, Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak chuan heti hian a ti: A dangte pawh ka la hruai khâwm zêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ramhnuaia chêng, ngawpuia tla, Sakawlhte u, lo kal ula, han seh rawh u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Râlvêngtute mit chu a del vek a, eng mah an hre thei lo. Vêngtua dah ui bauh duh lo ang hi an ni, Mang nei hiala mut bawrh bawrh chauh an duh, Mut hi an va thlahlel kher êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ui koham ang maiin an tlai thei lo, Berâmpu chu an ni ngei a, A chhia a ṭha an thlei thei lo; Mahni duhzâwng angin an khawsa a, An tâna hlâwk tûr chauh an zawng vek mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Hawh u, zu i zawng ang; Rakzu thlum tui i in ṭeuh vang, Naktûk lamah phei chuan vawiin aiin A thlum sawt ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="57" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi dik a thihin hrethiam rêng an awm lo va, Pathian ṭih mi lâk bo a han ni a, Chûng mite chuan hrehawm an kalsan ta tih rêng Ngaihtuah zui thiam an awm hauh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thlamuang takin an awm ta a, Nun ngîl taka khawsa ṭhînte chu An khum laizâwl ngeiah an hahchâwl ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangni, dawi chîngte u, lo kal thuai thuai teh u, Uire fa leh mihur thlahte in ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tu nge in nuihzata, Tu nge in chhiat khuma, in lei in chhuah khum le? Suahsualna leh inbumnaa hrin vek in ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sasaw hnuaiah nuam in tâwl a, thingbuk hlim nuam in pan zêl a, In fa sênte inthawi nân in hlân a, Lui kam khâm kârahte in hlân si ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lui kam lung mûm in thlang chhuak a, Chûngte ngei chu in pathianah in neih ta a, Uain leihin inthawina in hlân a, Ka lâwm dâwnin in ring em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tlâng sâng sângah in mut dun nân khum in dawh a, Tah chuan in rawn inthawi ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />In kawngka phênah chuan In milem chu in hûng ṭhîn a ni. Khumah in puan in phah duai a, In lâwn dûn ta ṭhîn a, In mutpui châkte chu thu in tiam a, Remchâng in hmu mai ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hriak rimtuite in thih mawm a, Moleka biak tumin in pan vang vang ṭhîn a, Biak tûr zawngin palaite ram tin in fantîr a, Mitthi khuaahte hial in kaltîr ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Biak tûr zawngin in hah zo va, “A beidawnthlâk mang e,” in ti si lo. Beisei tûr thar in hmu zêl a, In chau chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tu nge in hlauh, tu mitmei nge in vên? Dâwt min hrilh a, min theihnghilh tâk mai le? Rei tak ka ngawih avâng em ni Min zah lova min hlauh tâk loh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Dik nia i hriat chu i ti ṭhîn a; mahse, a sâwt lo vang, Ka mualpho dâwn a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mangang taka i au hunah I lâk khâwm ṭeuh milemte khân chhâng che rawh se, Thliin a lên ang a, a chhêm bo vang, Kei min bêltute erawh chuan ram hi an rochung ang, Ka tlâng thianghlim an chang bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Heti hian a ti: “Chhûng pâwng rawh u, Lamlian siamin lei chhûng ula, Ka mite hâwn kawng dîptu chu sât fai rawh u.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hmunsânga chêng, chatuana nung, Mi Thianghliman heti hian a ti: “Hmun Thianghlim sâng takah awm mah ila, Thuhnuairawlh leh inchhîrte hnênah chuan Chawisâng tûr leh tiharh tûrin ka awm zêl ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka mite chu ka dem fo lo vang a, Ka thin a ur reng hek lo vang. Ka hmaah chuan an chau chhe dah ang e, Keima siam ngei an ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />An sual vâng leh an duhâm avângin An chungah chuan ka thin a han ur a, Ka hrem a, thinurin ka hawisan ta a ni. Tichuan, an duhzâwng hlîr ti chung zêlin An khawsa lui ta tlat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />An awm dân chu ka hre reng a, Mahse, an natna chu ka tihdamsak ang a, Ka hruai ang a, ka pui ang a, Lusûnte chu ka thlamuan ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ram tin ram tanga awmte tân, Muanna, Muanna, ka mite chu ka tidam ngei dâwn e,” Lalpa kâ chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi sualte zawng tuipui fâwn vêl, Châwl ngai lo ang hi an ni, Tuifâwnah chuan chirh leh bawlhhlawh a lo chhuak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi sualte tân muanna rêng a awm lo, Kan Pathian chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="58" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Au vak vak la, insûm hauh suh, Tawtawrâwt ri angin i aw chhuah la, Ka mite thil tihsual, Jakoba thlahte sualna chu hrilh rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zawn zawng ni tin min zawng ṭhîn a, Ka duhzâwng chu hriat pawh an hre châk hle a, Dik taka thil ti ṭhîn hnam ni âwm takin Pathian thupêk hlamchhiah mai chu in tum lêm lo, Dik taka rorêl dân min zâwt chhên a, Pathian hnaih châk in inti hle.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />‘Chaw kan nghei a, engtizia nge i hmuh si loh? I ngaihsak si loh chuan engah nge ril kan tihṭâm ang?’ in ti. In chaw nghei ni chu nawmsak bâwl nân in hmang hlauh va, In hna thawktute chu in vau bet ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chaw in ngheiin in thin a ram ṭhîn a, Intihbuaia insual duhin Kuttum in lek mai ṭhîn. Hetiang nia in ṭawngṭai chu Chung lama miin hria se inti em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutianga chaw nghei chu ka duhzâwng em ni le? Intihhrehawm ni-ah in siam hlauh va, Hnimhnah a uai angin in kun renga, Vaivut chunga saiip phahin in mut ṭhin hi? Chutiang chu maw chaw nghei in tih? Ka tân a lâwmawm dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chaw nghei dân tûr ka lawmzâwng chu, Dik lo taka mi dang in phuarna phelhsaka, an nghâwngkawl hrui tihchahsak te, Mi tihduhdah chîn sim te, An phurrit zawng zawng hlihsak te hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Rilṭâmte chu in chaw sem ve ula, Vâkvaite chu in in chhûngah hruai lût rawh u; Saruak in hmuhte chu sin tûr pe ve ula, In laichînte hawisan suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, zîng êng angin in êng ang a, In hliam tuar chu a dam thuai ang. Lalpa , Mi Dika chuan in hma a hruai ang a, A ropuina chuan in hnu a dâl bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa in au vang a, a lo chhâng ang che u, In ko vang a, a lo chhâng ang che u. In zîng ata innêkchêpna in tihreha, Ṭawng chhe hmanga inkawh sawk sawk in bânsana,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Rilṭâmte tân in inphala, Retheite pawh in hrai tlai chuan, Thim zînga êng angin in êng ang a, In nguina pawh chhûn êng angin a veng tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka hruai zêl ang che u a, Ni sa hnuaia in dangro chu ka tireh ang a, In châk tinrêng ka pe bawk ang che u. In taksate ka tichak leh ang a, Tui tamna hmuna huan ang leh Tuikhur kang ngai lo ang in ni tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Rei tak chhe tawh in khuate chu In mite chuan lungphûm hlui chungah chuan an din leh ang, ‘Kulh bang leh a chhûnga in siam ṭha lehtu,’ An ti ang che.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Ka ni thianghlim sabat in serh leha, Nuamsip bâwl in bânsana, Lalpa ni sabat hi in hluta, Hna thawk tûra in kal lohva, Mahni duhzâwng ûma titi mai mai nâna Hmang hauh lova in chawimawi chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa -ah chuan lâwmna in hmu ang a, Khawvêl puma chawimawi in ni bawk ang. In pu Jakoba ro ka pe bawk ang che u,” Lalpa kâ chuan a ti asin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="59" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chhan pha lo tûrin Lalpa bân chu a tawi lo va, Hre pha lo khawpin a beng a ngawng hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />In bawhchhiatnate hian a ni, In Pathian nên tihrang che u. In sualte chuan a hmêl a hliah zo va, In aw a hre thei lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />In kutahte thisen a kai hnuang a, In kutzungṭangahte khawlohna chu a khat, In hmuite chuan dâwt in sawi a, In leite chuan thu sual in sep.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tu man dikna an ṭanchhan lo, Thu dik hmanga inkhing an awm hek lo. Thil lawilovah an innghat a, Dâwt ngawt an sawi an sawi. Thu buai awm thei an dap vêl a, Thu chhiaah an chantîr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rûl tui angin thil sual an awp ṭhîn a, Maimawm angin thu sual an zam. An tui awp eitu chu a thi ang a, Tikehtu tân rûlngân a lo chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An thil zam chu sin tlâk a ni lo va, An thil phan chu intuamna tlâk a ni hek lo. An thil tih chu sual hlîr a ni. An kutte chuan pawi a khawih reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sual ti tûrin an tlân chak hle, Mi dik thisen chhuah tûrin an hmanhmawh a, An thil ngaih dân zawng zawng a kawi zo va, An kalna hmun tinah thil a chhe rem rum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Remna kawng chu an hre lo va, Dik taka rorêl dân an hre hek lo. An kawngte chu a kikawi a, A kal veten râlmuanna rêng an hre lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tichuan, rorêlna dik chuan min hlat a, Dik taka thil tih chuan min chîm pha lo. Êng kan duh a, thim hlîr a ni, Khaw êng zawngin thimah kan kal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mitdel angin bang kan dap a, Mit nei lo ang maiin kan phar kan phar. Zân thim angin chhûn laiah pawh kan tlu ṭhîn a, Mi chak zînga mitthi ang mai kan ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Savawm angin kan rûm kan rûm a, Mangang takin ṭhuro angin kan rûm bawk ṭhîn. Rorêlna dik kan beisei a, a awm si lo, Chhan chhuah kan nghâkhlel a, min chhan teuh si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />I hmaah chuan kan khawlohnate hi a va nasa tak êm! Kan sualte chuan min mualpho va, Kan bawhchhiatnate chu kan hre reng a, Kan suahsualnate pawh kan hai lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa phatin kan nawrhsan a, Kan Pathian chu kan hawisan a, Thu veivirin hel zai kan rêl, Chhuanlam dapin dâwtte kan sawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Dik taka rorêlna a awm ta lo, Dik taka thil ti rêng an awm hek lo. Rinawmna chu tuallaiah chuan a thal dêr a, Dikna pawh chu a lo lût thei ta lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Rinawmna rêng a awm ta lo, Sual hawisan chuan a tuar ta thung a, Lalpan a han hmuhin a lungawi lo hle a, Rorêlna dik rêng rêng a hmu zo lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tihduhdah tuar chhan tûr tu mah an awm lo va, Lalpan mak a ti êm êm a. Ama kut ngeiin a chhan dâwn e, Dikna chu a ṭanchhan a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Awmphâw atân dikna a ha ta a, Chhandam theihna lukhum a khum bawk a, Phuba lâkna puan chuan a intuam a, Thinurna puan a bât ta e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />An thil tih ang zêlin a rûl dâwn a, Amah dotute chu thinurnain a rûl ang a, Hmêlmate chungah chuan phuba a la ang a, Thliarkâra awm daihte pawh chu a thungrûl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lalpa hming ropui chu chhak leh thlanga miin an hlau vang a, Lalpa thawin a chhêm tuilian angin Manganna chu a lo thleng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Jakoba thlah, sual hawisantute hnênah Zion-ah chuan Tlantua chu a lo kal ang,” Lalpan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Keiin in hnêna thu ka thlun chu hei hi a ni,” Lalpan a ti. “Ka Thlarau in hnêna awm leh, Ka thu in kâa ka dah chuan Tûn aṭanga kumkhuain a chhuahsan ngai lo vang che u; In fate leh in fate fa lehte pawh a chhuahsan ngai lo vang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="60" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tho la, êng chhuak rawh le, I êng a lo thleng ta, Lalpa ropuina chuan a rawn ên ta a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thim chuan khawvêl a khuh tlat a, Hnam dang chung chu a thim mup mai, Nanga tân zawng Lalpa êng chu a chhuak ta a, A ropuina i chunga fu an hmu vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I êngah chuan hnam tin an lêng ang a, Lalte pawhin i ênna chu an rawn chhim ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I mit han lên chho la, thlîr teh, Inpun khâwmin an lo kal e, Ram hla tak aṭangin i fate chu an lo haw a, I fanute an rawn pua e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I hmuh hun chuan i hmêl a hlim ang a, Hlim lutukin awm ngaihna pawh i hre lo vang. Hnam tin sum leh pai chu tuipui chungah an rawn tawlh haw dâwn e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sanghâwngsei rual an lo kal duah duah mai, Midian leh Efa sanghâwngsei rualte chu, Seba, ram hla tak aṭang chuan an lo kal a, Rangkachak leh beraw an rawn phur e. Lalpa fak hla an rawn sa dual dual mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kedar berâm rualte an rawn khalh duah duah a, Nebaiot berâm chalte an rawn hawn che. Ka maichâmah Lalpa tilâwm tûrin an rawn hlân ang, Ka Tempul chu ka chawimawi dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chhûm vâk dûl dûl, pârva lawi sup sup ang maia Lawng rual lo tawlh dûl dûlte saw khawi lam mi nge?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thliarkâr hla tak aṭanga lo kal an ni a, Tarsis lawngten an hma an rawn hruai a, Ram hla tak aṭangin i fate an rangkachakte an rawn hawn a, Lalpa , i Pathian hming chawimawi tûr leh Israel Mi Thianghlima chawimawi tûrin, I mite chu hnam tin hmuhah Lalpan a chawimawi ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hnam dangte chuan i kulh bangte an rawn rem ṭha ang a, Lalte pawhin i rawng an rawn bâwl ang. Ka thinurin ka han vêl tak nâ che a, Duhsak chein ka khawngaih leh ta che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />I kulh kawngkhârte chu a inhawng reng ang a, Chhûn leh zânah tu man an khâr lo vang. Hnam tin lalten an ro hlute An rawn keng zut zut ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />I rawngbâwl duh lo hnam leh ramte chu an chhia ang a, An ral vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lebanon tlâng tiropuitu thing ṭha ṭha chu, Fâr te, tufâr leh phân thing te, Ka Hmun Thianghlim chei nân an rawn la ang. Ka ke nghahna hmun chu ka chawimawi dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tirethei ṭhîn che thlahte chu Kûnin i hmaah chuan an lo kal ang, Nangmah hmusit ṭhînte chu I ke bulah an bawkkhup ang. “ Lalpa khawpui, Israel Mi thianghlima Zion,” An ti ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An hua che a, an hawisan che, Tu man an tlawh duh loh che kha, Kei hian khaw mawi berah ka din ang che a. Kumkhaw hlimna hmunah ka siam ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hnam dangte leh an lalte chuan An duat ang che a, an hnute te an hnêktîr dâwn a che, Chhandamtu che, kei Lalpa hi ka ni, Jakoba Mi Chaka, tlantu che chu ka nih i hre tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Dâr aiah rangkachak an rawn la ang, Thîr aiah tangkarua, thing aiah dâr, Lung aiah thîr ka rawn lâksak ang che. I chunga thuneitu atân ‘Remna’ ka dah ang a, Hna rêltu atân ‘Dikna’ ka dah bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />I ramah chuan râwng taka che thâwm a reh ang a, I ram chu a chhiain a ram bawk hek lo vang. I bangte chu ‘Chhandamna’ i vuah ang a, I kawngkhâr chu ‘Fakna’ i vuah bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chhûnah ni chu êng a ni tawh lo vang a, Zânah thla pawh i tân khâwnvâr a ni lo vang, Lalpa ngei chu i kumkhaw êng a ni ang a, Pathian ropuina chuan a ên ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />I chungah chuan ni a tla ngai lo vang a, Thla pawh a mang ngai hek lo vang. Lalpa ngei chu i kumkhaw êng a ni ang a, I lusûn hun a ral tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />I mite chu mi dik tak vek an ni ang a, Ram chu in luah kumkhua tawh ang. Ka phun chawr, ka kutchhuak an ni a, Ka ropuizia mi tin hmuha ka tihlanna an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />An hnam zînga tê ber leh tlâwm ber chu Hnam ropui tak an la ni ang. Kei Lalpa hian a hun takah ka ti thuai ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="61" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian thlarau chu ka chungah a awm, Hriak min thih a, Lalpan min tîr a ni. Riangvaite hnênah chanchin ṭha hrila, Nun beidawngte tuamhlâwm tûrin, Saltâng chhuah tûr thu te, Rip thim taka khungte hruai chhuah an nih tûr thu puang tûr te-a tih ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa lungawi hun chu a thleng ta a, An Pathian phuba lâk hun lo thleng chu puanga, Lusûnte chu thlamuan tûrin mi tîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zion khuaa khawharte hnêm tûr leh An lungngaihna lâwma chantîr tûrin, Pawr taka awm intuaihnûm leh tûr te, Ngui taka awm fak hla saktîr leh tûr tein min tîr a ni. Lalpan amah chawimawi tûra a phun, Thing duhawm tak an ni tih thu hrilh tûr ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hmasânga ṭiau tawh khuate chu an din leh ang a, Chim chhe tawh chu an tungding ang. Rei tak ram tawh khawpui chhia chu an siam leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hnam dangte chu in chhawr ang a, In ran rualte an enkawl ang. Ram dang miten in lei an let ang a, In grep huante an thlo bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangni hi zawng ‘ Lalpa puithiam’ tih in ni ang, ‘Pathian rawngbâwltute’ an ti bawk ang che u. Hnam tin hausakna chu in chên ang a, An ropuinate chuan in inthuam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />In zahna leh in mualphona a reh ta a, Nangmahni ram ngeiah in chêng tawh ang; A lehhnihin in hausakna a pung ang a, Kumkhaw lâwmna in chang bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kei Lalpa hi dik taka rorêl duhtu ka ni, Hâlrala hlan atâna ran rûk hi ka hua a ni, Dik tak zêlin an thiltih lâwmman chu ka pe ang a, Kumkhaw thuthlung ka siamsak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />In thlahte chu hnam tin zîngah an lâr ang a, An zînga in fanau chêngte an hmuh chuan Lalpa duhsak hnam in ni tih an hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa -ah chuan ka hlim êm êm ang a, Ka Pathian chungah hian ka lâwm hle ang. Moneitu, puithiam anga inchei leh a mo a inthuam mawi ang hian, Jerusalem khua chu chhandamna leh Hnehna puan chuan a rawn tuam ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Leiah thlai chi a ṭiak ṭhîn a, Huana thil phun a chawr ngei ṭhîn ang hian Lalpa , kan Pathian chuan hnehna a thlentîr ang, Hnam tinrêngin an fak bawk ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="62" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zion avângin ka ngawi hle hle thei lo, Jerusalem avângin ka awm mai mai thei lo, A dikzia chu a lan chiana, Chhandam a nih mei êng anga a lan fiah hma loh chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hnam tinrêngin i dikzia chu an hmu ang, An lalte chuan i ropuizia an hmu bawk ang, Lalpa sak ngei hming thar i pu dâwn e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa tân chawimawina lukhum mawi i ni bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />‘Mâki,’ an ti tawh lo vang che a, I ram pawh chu, ‘Rami,’ an ti bawk hek lo vang. ‘Duhlaii,’ an ti tawh zâwk ang che a, I ram pawh chu, ‘Pawmlaii,’ an ti bawk ang. Lalpa i chungah a lâwm a, I ram tân chuan pasal ang a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nula thianghlim tlangvâl chhuanin a nei ang hian, Siamtu che chuan a pawm ang che. Moneituin a mo a lâwm ang hian, I Pathian chuan a lâwm ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jerusalem, i kulh bangahte chuan râlvêngtu ka dah ang a, A chhûn a zân an awm mai mai lo vang. A thutiam kha hre reng tûrin Lalpa an hrilh nawn fo ṭhîn ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jerusalem a rawn din ngheh leha, Ram tin fak tlâk tûra a rawn siam leh hma chu, Lalpa chu a awm hle hle an phal lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpan a kut ding lam meuh pharin thu a tiam a, A bân tha chak chuan a ti ngei ang. “In buhte chu hmêlma eiah ka pe tawh lo vang a, In thawh chhuah uainte pawh Hnam dangte chuan an in zawhsak tawh lo vang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A sengtute ngei chuan buh chu an ei ang a, Lalpa an fak bawk ang. Grep rah lotute chuan uain chu Ka in thianghlim tualah an in bawk ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khua aṭang hian kal chhuak ula, Ka mite hâwn kawng sial tûrin Thawk chhuak rawh u. Chhûng pâwng ula, lamlian atân lei chhûng rawh u; Lungte thian fai ula, Mi tin hmuhah chhinchhiahna târ chhuak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hnam tin hriatah Lalpan a puang ta e, Zion fanute chu hrilh rawh u, “ Lalpan a rawn chhan ta che u, A chhanchhuahte a rawn hruai a, A tlan chhuahte a rawn chhawm e,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa tlan chhuahte chu ‘Hnam thianghlim,’ an ti ang a, Nang pawh, ‘ Lalpa zawn chhuah, Rauhsan loh Khawpui,’ an ti ang che.
  </para>
  <chapter number="63" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu nge Edom khawpui, Bozra khua aṭanga Puan sen hnuang sina lo kal hi? Ropui takin a inchei a, a lo kal luah luah mai. “Kei ka ni e, Chhandamtu Ropuia, Ka hneh tâk thu ka rawn puang a ni e,”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Engtizia nge i silhfênte a sen hnuang a, Grep rap sâwrtu thawmhnaw ang a nih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keimah maiin hnam dangte chu Grep rah angin ka rap sâwr a, Tu man min pui lo ve. Ka thinrim a, ka rap nek a, Ka thinur a, ka chîl ta nek a ni. An thisen chuan ka silhfênte a chikkhum a, Ka thawmhnawte a bawlhhlawh ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Phuba lâk chu a hun ka ti ta a, Ka mite chu ka tlan hun tûr a lo thleng ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Min ṭanpui tûr tu mah ka hmu lo va, Min thlâwptu tûr an awm lo chu ka hrilhhai hle, Keimah maiin ka hneh ta a, Ka thinur chuan min tithatho a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chûng mite chu ka thinrimin ka chîl nek a, Ka thinurin ka tirui a, an thisen chu leiah a luang ta zeih zuih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa ngilneihzia hi ka hril dâwn e, Ka tâna thil a tih zawng zawng te, Israel chhûngte tân a ṭhatzia te, Khawngaihnaa min vûr fo ṭhîn avâng tein Amah fakin hla ka sa ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Ka mite an ni a, Min bum hauh lo vang,” Lalpan a ti. An tân chhandamtuah a ṭang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An manganna tinrêng a tuarpui a, Vântirhkoh ni lo, amah ngei chuan a chhan ta a, A hmangaih a, a lainat êm avângin a tlan a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mahse, a lakah chuan an hel ta a, A Thlarau Thianghlim rilru chu an tina a, An hmêlmaah a ṭang ta a, A bei lêt ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A mite chuan Mosia dam lai, Hmasâng nite an hre chhuak a, “An ran rualte vênga, Tuipui ata la chhuaktu kha khawiah nge a awm tâk? Mosia hnêna Thlarau petu kha khawiah nge?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mosia ding lama awm, thil ropui tak tia, An hmaa tuifinriat tiṭhena, Kumkhua atân a hming chawimawitu kha khaw nge?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hmun rem laia sakawr a tlân zar zar anga, Tawlhthlu lova tuipui mawnga kaltîrtu kha khaw nge?” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ram ṭha taka ran rual an tla dem dem angin, Lalpan a Thlarauvin a thlamuan a, A mite chu hruaiin hming ṭha a chher ta e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />I chênna hmun thianghlim leh mawi, Vân sâng aṭangte khân, Han thlîr thla la, min han en teh, I ṭhahnemngaihna leh i chakna, I ngilneihna leh i lainatna kha a dai zo ta em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nang zawng kan Pa i ni, Abrahaman min hre phâk lo, Israelan min hmu bawk hek lo; Nang zawng, Lalpa , kan Pa i ni. Eng lai pawha min hum ṭhîntu i ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa , engtizia nge i kawng ata kan pên i phala, Nangmah kan ṭih loh nân min tihluhlul? I ro chan hnam, i chhiahhlawhte avâng hian Kan lam lo hawi leh rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />I mi thianghlimte hian i Tempul chu Rei lo te chhûng an luah hman a, Kan hmêlmaten an chîl chhe ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kan lal ni ngai lo tawp angin nangin min en ta a, I mi ni ngai hauh lo ang mai kan nih tâk hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="64" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vân tithlêrin lo chhuk teh la, I hmaah chuan tlângte an khûr zawih zawih mai tûr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Meiin thingṭang a tialha, Tui chhuan a so bawrh bawrh ang hian, Hnam tinrêng hi i hmaah khûr sela, I hmêlmate i hming hriattîr ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kan beisei loh thil hlauhawm tak tak tia, I lo chhuk laite khân tlâng lian pui pui i hmaah chuan an khûr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangmah ngaitute tân Mita hmuh ngai loh leh benga hriat ngai loh, Thil ti ṭhîntu Pathian, nang chauh i ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thil dik tih châk, i duhzâwnga awm dân hriate I lo lâwm ṭhîn. Kan chungah zawng i thinur ta a ni, Kan sual lui zêl si a, Rei tak sual tawhte hi chhandam kan ni thei dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kan zavaiin kan bawlhhlawh vek tawh a, Kan ṭhatna zawng zawng pawh silhfên bawlhhlawh ang mai a ni, Thinghnah uai ang vek kan ni e. Kan bawhchhiatnate chuan min lên min lên ta mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />I hming lam rêng kan awm lo va, Ṭanpui dîl tûr che-a tho peih kan awm hek lo, Kan lakah hian i hmêl i thup ta a, Kan sualna chuan min delh bet tlat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nang zawng, Lalpa kan Pa i ni, Keini hi bellei kan ni a, nang a vawtu i ni; Kan zavai hian i kutchhuak kan ni e,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa , kan lakah hian thinur tawh lul lo la, Kan suahsualna hre reng hek suh ang che; Min en teh mah, i mite vek kan ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />I khaw thianghlim chu thlalêr a chang zo ta, Zion khua chu thlalêr ram ro a ni ta a, Jerusalem khua chu a ram ta e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kan in thianghlim leh mawi, Kan pi puten an fak ṭhinna che Meiin a kâng zo va, Kan hmun nuam laite pawh A chim zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa , hêng hi pawi i ti lo vem ni? I ngawi tlatin min tirethei reng dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <chapter number="65" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Ka inpeih reng a, min râwn duh si lo va, Hmuh mai theih ka ni a, min zawng duh bawk si lo. Ka mi, ka hming lam duh lote hnênah chuan ‘Heta hi ka awm reng alâwm,’ ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nilêng lêngin an tân ka bân ka phar ṭhîn a, Hel hmangte hian an duhzâwng chauh an zawng, An awm dân hi a dik lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hêng mite hian ka huatzâwng tak an ti lui châmchi a, Huan serhahte an inthawi a, Hnam dang pathian maichâmahte rimtui an hâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mitthi thlarau râwn tûrin Pûkah te, thlânahte an ṭhu zânkhua ṭhîn. Vawk sate an ei a, Sa bawlhhlawh tinrêng tuihâng te, An khuhhriangah an suak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />‘Min rawn hnaih suh, min khawih ang e, In khawih thiang kan ni lo,’ an ti ṭhîn a. Hêng mite hi meikhu, Nilêng lênga min ur rengtu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka ngawihsan mai dâwn hlei nêm, Ka hrem dân tûr ziak fel a ni tawh a, An malchungah ka leihbua ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An sualna chu, an thlahtute sual nên, Anmahni chungah ka thungrûl dâwn. Tlângahte chuan rimtui an hâl ṭhîn a, Mualahte chuan min hmuhsitzia an lantîr ṭhîn. An thil tih ṭhin avângte chuan Hremna, an chunga tla tûr chu, ka teh zo tawh.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Grep la ṭha chu tu man an paih mai mai ngai lo, Uain-ah an siam zâwk ṭhîn. Ka chhiahhlawhte pawh hi an zavai chuan Ka tiboral bîk lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jakoba leh Juda thlah aṭangin Ka tlâng thianghlim luah tûr mi ka ruat ang, Ka tlângte chu an luah ang a, Tah chuan ka chhiahhlawhte an chêng reng dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka mi, mi zawngtute tân chuan Saron phai chu an ran tlatna a ni ang a, Akor ruamah an rante chu an tualchai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa chu kalsan a, ka tlâng thianghlim theihnghilhte u, ‘Gad’ chibai in bûkna tûr in buatsaih a, ‘Meni’, hnênah uain in hlân a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />In tuar tûr khawrêl chu khandaiha thih a ni, Talhtu hmaah in la kûn vek ngei ang. Hêng mite hian ka koh laiin min chhâng lo va, Ka duh loh zâwng sual an ti a, Ka sawi laiin an ngaithla bawk hek lo, Ka lâwm loh zâwng tih an thlang ṭhîn.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: “Ka chhiahhlawhten ei tûr an ngah ang a, Nangni in ril a ṭâm hle ang. Ka chhiahhlawhten in tûr an ngah ang a, Nangni in tui a hâl si ang. Ka chhiahhlawhte an hlim ang a, nangni in zak thung ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka chhiahhlawhte thinlung a hlim ang a, Nangni thinlung nain in chiau in chiau vang a, Lungchhe takin in rûm in rûm bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka thlan, ka mite chuan in hmingte chu ânchhia atân an hmang ang a, Kei, Lalpa Pathian ngei hian ka tihlum ang che u. Ka chhiahhlawhte erawh chu an hming ka sa thar ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ram chhûnga mi, malsâwmna dîl apiangte chuan, Pathian, rinawma malsâwmna an dîl ang a, Ram chhûnga mi, chhechham duh apiangin Pathian rinawma hming chhâlin an chham ṭhîn ang. Tûn hmaa buainate a liam ta a, Ka hmuh phâk loh tûrah an awm zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa chuan, “Ngai teh, vân thar leh lei thar ka siam ta a, Tûn hma thilte a liam ta a, Hriat reng a ni tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka thil siam tharah chuan lâwmin in hlim kumkhua tawh ang. Lâwm nân Jerusalem ka siam thar a, A mite pawh an hlim reng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jerusalem chungah ka lâwm ang a, Ka mite chuan min tihlim ang. Ṭap thâwm hriat tûr a awm tawh lo vang a, Mangang au thâwm a awm bawk hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hlamzuiha thi an awm tawh lo vang a, Tarkûna khûp bihin an dam tawh ang; Kum za dam zo lo chu, ‘vâng laia thi,’ an ti ang a, Mi sual kum za dam zo lova thi chu ‘ânchhia a dawng a ni,’ an ti bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Inte an sa ang a, an luah ang a, Grepte an phun ang a, a rah an ei ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />An in sak chu mi dang luah tûr a ni lo va, An grep phun chu mi dang ei tûr a ni hek lo, Ka mite chu hai tarin an dam ang a, Ka thlante chuan an thawh rah chu, Tarkûn thlengin an tlân ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />An thawhrimna chu a thlâwn ngai lo vang a, An hrinte pawh vânduaina tâwk tûr an awm lo, An tu leh fa chenin Lalpan mal a sâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Min auh hmain ka chhâng ang a, An sawi zawh hma hmain ka lo hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chinghnia leh berâmno an tla dûn ang a, Sakeibaknei pawhin bâwng ang maiin buhpâwl a ei ang a, Rûlte pawhin chawah vaivut an ring bawk ang. Ka tlâng thianghlimah chuan Thil ṭha lo leh intihnat rêng a awm lo vang,” Lalpan a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="66" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Vân ka lalṭhutthlêng ani a, Lei ka ke nghahchhan a ni; In eng ang nge min sak anga, Khawiah nge ka chên ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thil zawng zawng hi ka kut ngeia ka siam a ni; Tichuan, an lo awm ta a ni,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti. “Ka hmuh duhzâwng tute nge ni? Rilrua inngaitlâwm leh inchhîra ka thu awihtute hi an ni asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mahse, hêng mite tân hi chuan bâwng talha hlan emaw, Mihring thaha inthawi emaw a lêm chuang lo. Berâm hlan emaw, ui reh hlum hlan emaw, Chhangphut hlan emaw, vawk thisen hlan emaw, Rimtui an hâl emaw, milem an bia emaw, An tân a lêm chuang lo. An duh duhin thil an ti a. Thil tenawm biak an châkzâwng tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Keiin an tân thil râpthlâk tak ka tih dâwn hi, An thil hlauh ber ka thlentîr ang; Ka auh lai khân min chhâng lo va, Ka sawi lai khân an ngaithla duh si lo, Ka mit hmuhah ka duh loh zâwng thil an ti a, Ka lawm loh zâwng tih an thlang ta.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa ṭiha, a thu awihtute u, A thu sawi hi ngaithla rawh u, In u leh naute chuan an hua che u a, ‘ Lalpa ropuina chu lo lang ang hmiang, In lâwm emaw kan hria ang chu!’ An ti vei ṭhîn, an la mualpho ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khawpui chhûnga ri ta chêl chûl, Tempul chhûnga thâwm chu eng nge ni ta? Lalpa phuba la thâwm a ni, A hmêlmate a thungrûl ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Vei hman lova nau hring ta thut ang hian, Ka khawpui chuan vei lâwk awm hauh lovin fapa zu hring ta a!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutiang thil chu tu nge hre ngai? Tu nge hmu tawh awm le? Ram hi ni khat maiah a lo awm thei em ni? Hnam pawh a lo piang thut thei dâwn em ni? Zion khua chuan a han vei ṭan chauh va, Fapa a hring ta mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pian hun thlentîr siin ka piantîr lo vang maw?” Lalpan a ti. “Hring ṭêp tawh chu ka kîrtîr dâwn em ni?” In Pathianin a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jerusalem tuarpuitute u, lâwmpui ula, He khawpui duhsaktute u, lâwm ve rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nauvin hnutê duh tâwk a hne ang hian, A ropuina lo duah leh chu duh tâwkin chên rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Lui kang lo ang maiin remna ka pe ang a, Hnam dang hausakna tinrêngte, Lui lian angin ka rawn luan luhtîr ang. Nuin a nau hnutê pein a pawm ṭhîn a, A malchungah a sêp lep lep ṭhîn a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A nau a awm tlei ṭhîn ang hian, Keimah ngei hian ka awm tlei ang che u a; Thlamuang takin Jerusalem-ah chuan in awm tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chu chu in hmuh hunah lâwmin in harh huai huai ang a, Hnim chawrno angin in duah leh ang. Kei Lalpa hian ka chhiahhlawhte ka pui ṭhîn a, Ka hmêlmate chungah ka thinur ṭhîn tih in hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngai teh, mei nên Lalpa a lo thawk e, Ṭhâwngaleivir tawlailîra lo chuangin a thinur chu meiin a hrithla dâwn, Meialh hmangin a rawn hrem ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa chuan mei hmangin ro a rêl dâwn, Mi tin chungah a khandaih chu a lek ang a, Lalpan a that rem rum dâwn e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Inthian thianghlim tûra inbual faia, Hnam dang pathian be tûra kal nguah nguah te, Vawk leh chaichîm sate eia, Bawlhhlawh tinrêng eitute chu an boral ṭêp a ni,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“An thiltihte leh an ngaihtuahte chu ka hria; hnam tinrêng leh ṭawng tinrêng hmangte chu ka hruai khâwm dâwn. An lo kal ang a, ka ropuina an rawn hmu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Anni chu chhinchhiahna ka entîr ang. An zînga ṭhenkhat chu ka zuah ang a, hnam dang zîngah Tarsis-ah te, Pul-ah te, Lud-ah te ka tîr ang a, thal kâp thiamte chu Tubal-ah te, Javan-ah te, thliarkâr hla takah te, ka hming la hre ngai hauh lo leh ka ropuizia la hmu ngai lo hnênahte ka tîr ang a, hnam tinrêng zîngah ka ropuizia an puang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa hnêna thil hlan tûr an rawn la ang hian hnam tinrêng zînga mi in unaute chu an rawn hruai ang. Sakawr chungahte an chuang ang a, tawlailîrahte an ṭhu ang a, zâwn bâwmahte an ṭhu ang a, sabengtung leh sanghâwngsei chungahte an lo chuang ang. Israel-ten thlêng thianghlima thil hlan tûr an rawn keng ang hian ka tlâng thianghlim Jerusalem-ah chuan an lo kal ang,” Lalpan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“An zînga ṭhenkhat chu puithiamah te, Levia chi-ah te ka lo siam ang,” Lalpan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Vân thar leh lei thar ka siam tûr chu, Ka hmaah chuan a awm reng ang, Chutiang bawkin in thlahte leh In hmingte chu a awm reng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Thla thar leh sabat ni apiangin Chibai mi bûk tûrin mi tin an lo kal zut zut ang,” Lalpan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“An chhuah pah chuan, ka laka hel ṭhînte ruang chu an hmu ang a, A ṭawih lung chu a thi sêng lo vang, A kângtu mei pawh chu a mit ngai lo vang, Mi zawng zawngin tenawm an ti hle ang.”
  </para>
</usx>
